values
  ('1009592247032260547', 'Yu Yu Hakusho: Eizou Hakusho', 1994, 'Animation', 'Noriyuki Abe', null, 'Ai Orikasa, Mayumi Tanaka, Hisako Kyoda, Yuri Amano, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Megumi Ogata, Shigeru Chiba, Nozomu Sasaki', null, 'Two recap specials that focus on Team Urameshi''s matches in the Dark Tournament and four separate volumes focusing around one of the main characters; Yusuke, Kurama, Hiei, or Kuwabara.', 'Two recap specials that focus on Team Urameshi''s matches in the Dark Tournament and four separate volumes focusing around one of the main characters; Yusuke, Kurama, Hiei, or Kuwabara.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wOHrpZgWgN6Ruyv6Sv7OYEUO1v4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:513813'),
  ('540840693948917928', 'Yu Yu Hakusho: The Movie - Poltergeist Report', 1994, 'Animation, Fantasy, Action', 'Masakatsu Iijima, Hiroki Kanno, Hiroki Takagi', 'Yukiyoshi Ôhashi, Hiroshi Hashimoto, Sukehiro Tomita', 'Nozomu Sasaki, Shigeru Chiba, Megumi Ogata, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Sanae Miyuki, Yuri Amano, Mayumi Tanaka, Hisako Kyoda', null, 'When the Spirit World is flooded due to an unusual rainfall which overflows the River Sanzu (aka the River Styx), Lord Koenma senses an extremely powerful enemy. He entrusts Death God Botan, to deliver to Spirit Detective Yusuke, a mysterious item which must be protected from the invading enemy. However, by the time Botan finds Yusuke, she''s too weak to explain the situation. Yusuke and his friends are left in the dark about the new enemy, but not for long. Soon it is a battle for Earth between mere Spirit Detectives and the almighty king of the Netherworld.', 'When the Spirit World is flooded due to an unusual rainfall which overflows the River Sanzu (aka the River Styx), Lord Koenma senses an extremely powerful enemy. He entrusts Death God Botan, to deliver to Spirit Detective Yusuke, a mysterious item which must be protected from the invading enemy. However, by the time Botan finds Yusuke, she''s too weak to explain the situation. Yusuke and his friends are left in the dark about the new enemy, but not for long. Soon it is a battle for Earth between mere Spirit Detectives and the almighty king of the Netherworld.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a0KGBLZXJ3riF0UJaZRxTGoVUEt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45279'),
  ('810674565605352741', 'Yu Yu Hakusho: The Movie - The Golden Seal', 1993, 'Animation, Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Noriyuki Abe, Akihiro Enomoto', null, 'Nozomu Sasaki, Megumi Ogata, Nobuyuki Hiyama, Masami Suzuki, Mayumi Tanaka, Mitsuaki Madono, Rica Matsumoto, Takeshi Aono', null, 'While vacationing, Koenma is kidnapped by a pair of demons known as Koashura and Garuga, who demand the possession of Lord Enma''s coveted "Golden Seal." Botan finds Yusuke Urameshi and Kazuma Kuwabara on their summer vacation as well, and asks for their assistance in Koenma''s rescue.', 'While vacationing, Koenma is kidnapped by a pair of demons known as Koashura and Garuga, who demand the possession of Lord Enma''s coveted "Golden Seal." Botan finds Yusuke Urameshi and Kazuma Kuwabara on their summer vacation as well, and asks for their assistance in Koenma''s rescue.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cf6twiyA7XuJcVYgTtHwYDUQrjv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:45278'),
  ('4839514616644833', 'Yu-Gi-Oh! Bonds Beyond Time', 2010, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Yumenosuke Tokuda, Katsuyuki Takahashi, Takahiro Kagami', 'Shin Yoshida', 'Yuya Miyashita, KENN, Shunsuke Kazama, Atsushi Tamura, Jirou Jay Takasugi, Takanori Hoshino, Shintaro Asanuma, Ayumi Kinoshita', 'PG', 'After falling through a time-slip, Yusei Fudo (who has just had his powerful card stolen by a mysterious stranger) meets with Jaden Yuki and Yugi Muto, who agree to help Yusei defeat the evil Paradox, who is planning to destroy Pegasus before he can invent Duel Monsters.', 'After falling through a time-slip, Yusei Fudo (who has just had his powerful card stolen by a mysterious stranger) meets with Jaden Yuki and Yugi Muto, who agree to help Yusei defeat the evil Paradox, who is planning to destroy Pegasus before he can invent Duel Monsters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2HQ3KI4uFfB6A4cuYhmmd25n0ah.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:72013'),
  ('398393001785208906', 'Yu-Gi-Oh! The Movie', 2004, 'Animation, Fantasy, Action, Science Fiction', 'Hatsuki Tsuji', 'Michael Pecoriello', 'Dan Green, Eric Stuart, Scott Rayow, Wayne Grayson, Gregory Abbey, Amy Birnbaum, Tara Sands, Maddie Blaustein', 'PG', 'After the conclusion of the Battle City Tournament, deep below the sands of Egypt, an ancient evil has awakened. Anubis, who was defeated centuries ago by Yugi’s mysterious alter ego – the ancient Pharaoh – has returned for revenge. Wielding the power of the Eighth Millennium Item, Anubis is determined to destroy Yugi and take over the world.', 'After the conclusion of the Battle City Tournament, deep below the sands of Egypt, an ancient evil has awakened. Anubis, who was defeated centuries ago by Yugi’s mysterious alter ego – the ancient Pharaoh – has returned for revenge. Wielding the power of the Eighth Millennium Item, Anubis is determined to destroy Yugi and take over the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3VD5QDTu0rQgRvERBMXtAvg0oIC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11052'),
  ('489987307339134780', 'Yu-Gi-Oh!: The Dark Side of Dimensions', 2016, 'Adventure, Animation', 'Satoshi Kuwabara, Chiyuki Tanaka, Takahiro Kagami', 'Masahiro Hikokubo, Kazuki Takahashi, Satoshi Kuwabara', 'Kenjiro Tsuda, Shunsuke Kazama, Hiroki Takahashi, Maki Saito, Takayuki Kondo, Rica Matsumoto, Junko Takeuchi, Ryou Naitou', 'PG', 'Having faced each other on countless occasions, Yugi and Kaiba again put their pride and experience to the test in a duel that transcends dimensions.', 'Having faced each other on countless occasions, Yugi and Kaiba again put their pride and experience to the test in a duel that transcends dimensions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ti0CRprP9iSg9IDadTZ3TFnuczS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366170'),
  ('1026905344721468262', 'Yu☆Gi☆Oh!', 1999, 'Adventure, Animation, Fantasy', 'Junji Shimizu, Gou Koga, Shingo Araki', 'Yasuko Kobayashi', 'Megumi Ogata, Hikaru Midorikawa, Eiko Yamada, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Yumi Kakazu, Ryotaro Okiayu, Yukana, Konomi Maeda', null, 'A shy duelist stumbles upon the legendary Red Eyes Black Dragon, with that card in his possession, he must learn to bring out his confidence to duel.', 'A shy duelist stumbles upon the legendary Red Eyes Black Dragon, with that card in his possession, he must learn to bring out his confidence to duel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJ3nnWgNiBhuYNWZlYBISwcLgdw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:378240'),
  ('195014258552393944', 'Yucatán', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Daniel Monzón', 'Daniel Monzón, Jorge Guerricaechevarría', 'Luis Tosar, Rodrigo de la Serna, Stephanie Cayo, Joan Pera, Gloria Muñoz, Alicia Fernández, Adrián Núñez, Lupe Cartié Roda', 'PG', 'Two white collar thieves compete fiercely against the other trying to steal to an old baker the millions he won on the lotto.', 'Two white collar thieves compete fiercely against the other trying to steal to an old baker the millions he won on the lotto.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6z3f3I2YLpaipyYGItOf7c7kqRK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:517324'),
  ('459965049301159370', 'Yuck!', 2024, 'Animation, Comedy, Romance', 'Loïc Espuche', 'Loïc Espuche', 'Noé Chabbat, Katell Varvat, Enzo Desmedt, Camille Bouisson, Hugo Chauvel, Roman Freud, Mattias Marcussy, Mokhtar Camara', null, 'Yuck. Couples kissing on the mouth are gross. And the worst is, you can''t miss them: when people are about to kiss, their lips become all pink and shiny. Little Léo laughs at them, just like all the kids at the summer camp. But he has a secret he won''t tell his friends: his own mouth has actually begun glistening. And, in reality, Léo desperately wants to give kissing a try.', 'Yuck. Couples kissing on the mouth are gross. And the worst is, you can''t miss them: when people are about to kiss, their lips become all pink and shiny. Little Léo laughs at them, just like all the kids at the summer camp. But he has a secret he won''t tell his friends: his own mouth has actually begun glistening. And, in reality, Léo desperately wants to give kissing a try.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fdDkTqzjMS63PowQ1lluMg8A2QS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1220646'),
  ('941990859173673797', 'Yudo: The Way of the Bath', 2023, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Masayuki Suzuki, Shozo Katashima', 'Kundo Koyama', 'Toma Ikuta, Gaku Hamada, Kanna Hashimoto, Keiko Toda, Susumu Terajima, Fumiyo Kohinata, Masataka Kubota, Kotaro Yoshida', null, 'Two estranged brothers inherit Marukin Hot Springs, a small-town bathhouse. One sees it as an homage to their late father; the other—a struggling architect—as lucrative real estate for condos. Their eclectic collection of townsfolk customers show them the value of the bath goes way beyond a scrub and soak.', 'Two estranged brothers inherit Marukin Hot Springs, a small-town bathhouse. One sees it as an homage to their late father; the other—a struggling architect—as lucrative real estate for condos. Their eclectic collection of townsfolk customers show them the value of the bath goes way beyond a scrub and soak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xWE090nzihu8aa4S6L2vbPMKa2a.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1029486'),
  ('286152182893345910', 'Yuki & Nina', 2009, 'Drama', 'Hippolyte Girardot, Nobuhiro Suwa, Josée Deshaies', 'Nobuhiro Suwa, Hippolyte Girardot', 'Noë Sampy, Arielle Moutel, Tsuyu Shimizu, Hippolyte Girardot, Marilyne Canto', null, 'When Yuki finds out that her parents are separating and she is moving to Japan with her mother, she and her best friend Nina devise ways to reunite the feuding adults.', 'When Yuki finds out that her parents are separating and she is moving to Japan with her mother, she and her best friend Nina devise ways to reunite the feuding adults.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5ZBo6PDiNtGRbi1sdlwg94Etlla.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52637'),
  ('387449556048286590', 'Yuki''s Sun', 1972, 'Animation, Drama', 'Hayao Miyazaki, Yōichi Kotabe, Yasuo Otsuka', 'Isao Takahata', null, null, 'TV pilot based on an original manga by Tetsuya Chiba, about a 10-year old girl named Yuki. An orphan who''s being adopted by a family.', 'TV pilot based on an original manga by Tetsuya Chiba, about a 10-year old girl named Yuki. An orphan who''s being adopted by a family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cLQKaxGQkgG8G9F9o4DGX9Z0zuf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:375079'),
  ('946309044325644178', 'Yuku and the Himalayan Flower', 2022, 'Animation, Family, Adventure', 'Rémi Durin, Arnaud Demuynck', 'Arnaud Demuynck', 'Lily Demuynck Deydier, Agnès Jaoui, Arno, Tom Novembre, Alice on the Roof, Igor van Dessel, Carine Seront, Thierry de Coster', null, 'Yuku is a young mouse who lives with her family in the cellar of a castle. Her grandmother passes on the family values by telling her timeless folk tales. Injured in a tussle with a cat, the old mouse is bedridden and she tells her children that she will have to leave them to follow the little blind mole into the Earth’s tunnels. In one of her grandmother’s storybooks, Yuku learns that the flower of the Himalayas can bring her eternal light. She leaves on a journey of discovery to find the flower.', 'Yuku is a young mouse who lives with her family in the cellar of a castle. Her grandmother passes on the family values by telling her timeless folk tales. Injured in a tussle with a cat, the old mouse is bedridden and she tells her children that she will have to leave them to follow the little blind mole into the Earth’s tunnels. In one of her grandmother’s storybooks, Yuku learns that the flower of the Himalayas can bring her eternal light. She leaves on a journey of discovery to find the flower.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5Db9zPyyBu78tLpnXIlQ7C3qQ8z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:947704'),
  ('1039671178841933537', 'Yulenka', 2009, 'Thriller, Drama, Horror', 'Aleksandr Strizhenov, Artur Gimpel, Valery Tamanov', 'Artur Gimpel', 'Marat Basharov, Darya Balabanova, Oksana Lavrentyeva, Александра Дыхне, Anna Kazyuchits, Irina Kupchenko, Sergey Grekov, Aleksandr Strizhenov', null, 'A university professor, who wants to slow down a little, moves with his wife and daughter, from the big city to a small town and starts a new job as a teacher in a girls'' gymnasium. Something weird is happening with the class, they seem to hide a secret. As it turns out, these girls don''t play with dolls...', 'A university professor, who wants to slow down a little, moves with his wife and daughter, from the big city to a small town and starts a new job as a teacher in a girls'' gymnasium. Something weird is happening with the class, they seem to hide a secret. As it turns out, these girls don''t play with dolls...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oGgoCkw7IC6bF7hhGu0oldbrmIW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44839'),
  ('231773921494797979', 'Yuli', 2018, 'Drama', 'Icíar Bollaín, Álex Catalán', 'Paul Laverty', 'Santiago Alfonso, Carlos Acosta, Keyvin Martínez, Edison Manuel Olbera, Laura de la Uz, Yerlín Pérez López, Carlos Enrique Almirante, Andrea Doimeadios', null, 'Yuli is the nickname given to Carlos Acosta by his father, Pedro, who considers him the son of Ogun, an African god and a fighter. As a child Yuli avoids discipline and education, learning from the streets of an impoverished and abandoned Havana. His father, however, has other ideas, and knowing that his son has a natural talent for dance, sends him to the National Ballet School of Cuba. Despite his repeated escapes and initial poor behaviour, the boy is inevitably drawn to the world of dance, and begins to shape his legendary career from a young age, becoming the first black dancer to be cast in some of the most prestigious ballet roles, originally written for white dancers, in companies such as the Houston Ballet or the Royal Ballet in London.', 'Yuli is the nickname given to Carlos Acosta by his father, Pedro, who considers him the son of Ogun, an African god and a fighter. As a child Yuli avoids discipline and education, learning from the streets of an impoverished and abandoned Havana. His father, however, has other ideas, and knowing that his son has a natural talent for dance, sends him to the National Ballet School of Cuba. Despite his repeated escapes and initial poor behaviour, the boy is inevitably drawn to the world of dance, and begins to shape his legendary career from a young age, becoming the first black dancer to be cast in some of the most prestigious ballet roles, originally written for white dancers, in companies such as the Houston Ballet or the Royal Ballet in London.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hGGbrGNLqB0SSdH9DCuas3mSAv6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:537021'),
  ('1091854622090032818', 'Yuma', 1971, 'Western, TV Movie, Crime', 'John M. Stephens, Wesley Barry, Ted Post', 'Charles A. Wallace', 'Clint Walker, Barry Sullivan, Kathryn Hays, Edgar Buchanan, Morgan Woodward, Peter Mark Richman, John Kerr, Bing Russell', 'NR', 'A down-and-dirty town is forced to shape up when a new marshal (Clint Walker) comes to town. However, when a scheme is launched to destroy the lawman''s authority, he must discover the perpetrators and preserve his reputation.', 'A down-and-dirty town is forced to shape up when a new marshal (Clint Walker) comes to town. However, when a scheme is launched to destroy the lawman''s authority, he must discover the perpetrators and preserve his reputation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/piocFW0MMik9ELkhexRLkAoM5tY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76837'),
  ('662248353966135117', 'Yumeji', 1991, 'Drama', 'Seijun Suzuki, Junichi Fujisawa, Kensaku Watanabe', 'Yōzō Tanaka', 'Kenji Sawada, Yoshio Harada, Tomoko Mariya, Masumi Miyazaki, Tamasaburō Bandō V, Kazuhiko Hasegawa, Léona Hirota, Akaji Maro', null, 'Following the life of Japanese artist and poet Yumeji Takehisa through the imagining of an encounter with a beautiful widow with a dark past.', 'Following the life of Japanese artist and poet Yumeji Takehisa through the imagining of an encounter with a beautiful widow with a dark past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hWpDDjkRHzYb1EyS6XwnFAlDOJD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110903'),
  ('791136017779365900', 'Yumeno Kyusaku''s Girl Hell', 1977, 'Drama, Mystery, Horror', 'Yoshifumi Kamoda, Yonezō Maeda, Masaru Konuma', 'Akio Ido', 'Yûko Asuka, Asami Ogawa, Masakazu Kuwayama, Eimei Esumi, Nobutaka Masutomi, Noboru Mitani, Moeko Ezawa, Makiko Kishimoto', null, 'Utae and Aiko attend an all-girl private school where the devoutly religious principal seems to be raping some of the students, including Utae.', 'Utae and Aiko attend an all-girl private school where the devoutly religious principal seems to be raping some of the students, including Utae.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cykTpvB40EnHmbZLLbd4cskAfIO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:255593'),
  ('829453363007714101', 'Yummy', 2019, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Lars Damoiseaux, Daan Nieuwenhuijs', 'Lars Damoiseaux, Eveline Hagenbeek', 'Maaike Neuville, Bart Hollanders, Benjamin Ramon, Clara Cleymans, Annick Christiaens, Éric Godon, Joshua Rubin, Taeke Nicolaï', null, 'A young couple travels to a shabby Eastern European hospital for plastic surgery. The young woman wants a breast reduction. Her mother comes along for yet another face-lift. Wandering through an abandoned ward the boyfriend stumbles upon a young woman, gagged and strapped to an operating table; she is the result of an experimental rejuvenation treatment. He frees her, but does not realize he just caused the outbreak of a virus that will change doctors, patients and his mother-in-law into bloodthirsty zombies.', 'A young couple travels to a shabby Eastern European hospital for plastic surgery. The young woman wants a breast reduction. Her mother comes along for yet another face-lift. Wandering through an abandoned ward the boyfriend stumbles upon a young woman, gagged and strapped to an operating table; she is the result of an experimental rejuvenation treatment. He frees her, but does not realize he just caused the outbreak of a virus that will change doctors, patients and his mother-in-law into bloodthirsty zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nRysfd4JdnPJx82ZYs8atFmSuVC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:633604'),
  ('238642717816186672', 'Yuni', 2021, 'Drama', 'Teoh Gay Hian, Kamila Andini', 'Kamila Andini, Prima Rusdi', 'Arawinda Kirana, Kevin Ardilova, Dimas Aditya, Neneng Wulandari, Vania Aurellia, Boah Sartika, Anne Yasmine, Nazla Thoyib', null, 'In her last year of secondary school, a bright Indonesian student is determined to pursue her education and resist getting married, despite the expectations of her community.', 'In her last year of secondary school, a bright Indonesian student is determined to pursue her education and resist getting married, despite the expectations of her community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2NY6jrjneH6qgGCVPdcqcH9NpyN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:796158'),
  ('428239262435761165', 'Yuppi Du', 1975, 'Music, Comedy, Romance', 'Adriano Celentano, Sofia Scandurra, Alfio Contini', 'Adriano Celentano, Alberto Silvestri, Miky Del Prete', 'Adriano Celentano, Charlotte Rampling, Claudia Mori, Lino Toffolo, Gino Santercole, Rosita Celentano, Memo Dittongo, Jon Lei', null, 'In a dystopian Venice, humble fisherman Felice finds out his deceased wife isn''t actually dead, having faked her suicide to disappear from his life. Only, now she''s back, and wants their daughter too!', 'In a dystopian Venice, humble fisherman Felice finds out his deceased wife isn''t actually dead, having faked her suicide to disappear from his life. Only, now she''s back, and wants their daughter too!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5sWKSMo0vJtORZzcMuejntdeqxv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60810'),
  ('465521701778382100', 'Yuppies', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Carlo Vanzina, Massimo Carocci, Luigi Kuveiller', 'Enrico Vanzina, Carlo Vanzina', 'Jerry Calà, Christian De Sica, Massimo Boldi, Ezio Greggio, Corinne Cléry, Federica Moro, Guido Nicheli, Ugo Bologna', null, 'Willy, Giacomo, Lorenzo and Sandro are 4 young yuppies rampant in the "Milano da bere" of the 80s, who live in the myth of Lawyer Gianni Agnelli and Silvio Berlusconi; their only purpose in life is to appear rather than be. Giacomo is an advertiser, Lorenzo is a notary, Sandro is a dentist, and Willy is a car salesman.', 'Willy, Giacomo, Lorenzo and Sandro are 4 young yuppies rampant in the "Milano da bere" of the 80s, who live in the myth of Lawyer Gianni Agnelli and Silvio Berlusconi; their only purpose in life is to appear rather than be. Giacomo is an advertiser, Lorenzo is a notary, Sandro is a dentist, and Willy is a car salesman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7AQ8p2gJjLsW2ea5Gr2TFNbIWc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38342'),
  ('122986985489255999', 'Yuppies 2', 1986, 'Comedy', 'Enrico Oldoini, Sergio D''Offizi, Liliana Betti', 'Liliana Betti, Enrico Oldoini', 'Jerry Calà, Christian De Sica, Massimo Boldi, Ezio Greggio, Athina Cenci, Federica Moro, Gioia Scola, Jinny Steffan', null, 'The adventures of the Milanese yuppies continue, always polished, "at home" in via Montenapoleone or at Nepentha, impeccable in dressing and "winning" at work, a little less in private life.', 'The adventures of the Milanese yuppies continue, always polished, "at home" in via Montenapoleone or at Nepentha, impeccable in dressing and "winning" at work, a little less in private life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipFKXSGafLLJg3nOg0UBmmttKq3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38343'),
  ('664992759705153645', 'Yura Was Here', 2026, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Sergey Malkin, Filipp Zadorozhnyy, Ekaterina Chadaykina, Alyona Sadyrina, Aleksandr Demyanov, Ivan Bartusenko, Vladimir Golov', 'Sergey Malkin, Yuliana Koshkina', 'Konstantin Khabenskiy, Kuzma Kotrelev, Denis Paramonov, Aleksandr Porshin, Vasily Mikhailov', null, 'At 30, Oleg and Seryoga still dream of becoming rock stars. They play in a little-known band, live in a communal apartment, and are preparing for an important performance at a local festival. On the eve of the concert, they are unexpectedly approached by Oleg''s uncle, a 50-year-old man with mental disabilities, whom the boys cannot leave unattended, not even for a minute.', 'At 30, Oleg and Seryoga still dream of becoming rock stars. They play in a little-known band, live in a communal apartment, and are preparing for an important performance at a local festival. On the eve of the concert, they are unexpectedly approached by Oleg''s uncle, a 50-year-old man with mental disabilities, whom the boys cannot leave unattended, not even for a minute.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FlIKKxFOjkPYxFw15clvt6vBUy51.jpg', 'plex:movie:yura-was-here'),
  ('270756634719837634', 'Yuri Marçal: Honest Mistake', 2022, 'Comedy', 'Riccardo Melchiades, Fabio Ock', 'Yuri Marçal', 'Yuri Marçal', null, 'From sharing his unique views on family, race and religion to detailing an online rift that blew up, Brazilian comedian Yuri Marçal isn''t holding back.', 'From sharing his unique views on family, race and religion to detailing an online rift that blew up, Brazilian comedian Yuri Marçal isn''t holding back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xpf3vcuowBxKLqcbH2bC8KuO0at.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:979522'),
  ('533669203648018590', 'Yuri''s Day', 2008, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Oleg Lukichyov, Kirill Serebrennikov, Oleg Shuvaev', 'Yuriy Arabov', 'Kseniya Rappoport, Roman Shmakov, Yevgeniya Kuznetsova, Sergey Sosnovsky, Sergey Medvedev, Igor Khripunov, Vladislav Abashin, Dmitriy Podnozov', null, 'Before leaving Russia and moving to Western Europe, famous opera singer Lyuba travels to her hometown to say goodbye and show her teenage son around. But Andrey, Lyuba’s son, disappears and she must stay in the place she hates the most to search for him. A piercing exploration of identity and transformation, against the backdrop of a Russian hinterland, surrounded by Orthodox churches and snow.', 'Before leaving Russia and moving to Western Europe, famous opera singer Lyuba travels to her hometown to say goodbye and show her teenage son around. But Andrey, Lyuba’s son, disappears and she must stay in the place she hates the most to search for him. A piercing exploration of identity and transformation, against the backdrop of a Russian hinterland, surrounded by Orthodox churches and snow.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xJy3eLeStVQ7MSfrzaPpn0PUt8g.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38326'),
  ('420866778910250903', 'Yurigokoro', 2017, 'Mystery, Crime', 'Naoto Kumazawa, Yu Koreyasu, Keisuke Imamura', 'Naoto Kumazawa', 'Yuriko Yoshitaka, Tori Matsuzaka, Kenichi Matsuyama, Aimi Satsukawa, Nana Seino, Kaya Kiyohara, Tae Kimura, Yuki Tayama', null, 'Ryosuke has a bright future. He just opened a successful restaurant and hopes to tie the knot soon with his alluring girlfriend. But then his father declares he has pancreatic cancer and his betrothed vanishes without a trace. In his father’s belongings, he discovers a secret diary, which starts with an ominous sentence: “Without remorse, I take a life …” Ryosuke is completely spellbound and reads on, discovering that the document is actually the confession of a murderer.', 'Ryosuke has a bright future. He just opened a successful restaurant and hopes to tie the knot soon with his alluring girlfriend. But then his father declares he has pancreatic cancer and his betrothed vanishes without a trace. In his father’s belongings, he discovers a secret diary, which starts with an ominous sentence: “Without remorse, I take a life …” Ryosuke is completely spellbound and reads on, discovering that the document is actually the confession of a murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/23pAdjSGCHZXX2xLCjghipIKqRf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:455960'),
  ('669054618860790812', 'Yuriko''s Aroma', 2010, 'Drama, Romance', 'Kōta Yoshida', 'Kōta Yoshida', 'Noriko Eguchi, Shota Sometani, Noriko Kohara, Saori Hara, Jun Miho, Jiro Takasaki, Shige Kasai', null, '30 something year old Yuriko (Noriko Eguchi) works as a aromatherapist at an aroma salon. She uses essentials oils and her hands to soothe her client’s inner well-being. Yuriko also has a secret she can’t tell anyone; She gets incredibly turned on by the sweaty scent of a 17 year old high school student named Tetsuya (Shota Someya). Tetsuya is also the nephew of the salon owner (Jun Miho). Meanwhile, salon client Ayama (Saori Hara) asks to practice aromatherapy, but her real intent is to press her large breasts against Yuriko.', '30 something year old Yuriko (Noriko Eguchi) works as a aromatherapist at an aroma salon. She uses essentials oils and her hands to soothe her client’s inner well-being. Yuriko also has a secret she can’t tell anyone; She gets incredibly turned on by the sweaty scent of a 17 year old high school student named Tetsuya (Shota Someya). Tetsuya is also the nephew of the salon owner (Jun Miho). Meanwhile, salon client Ayama (Saori Hara) asks to practice aromatherapy, but her real intent is to press her large breasts against Yuriko.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dw38v66vSqDcQ0vXj1nVXwZKxtw.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67560'),
  ('209353072338287524', 'Yusuf and Kenan', 1979, 'Drama, Crime', 'Güneş Karabuda, Ömer Kavur', 'Ömer Kavur, Onat Kutlar', 'Cem Davran, Tamer Çeliker, Hakan Tanfer, Yalçın Avşar, Şevket Avşar, Suna Selen, Sadettin Erbil, Gülten Kaya', null, 'When their father is killed in a blood feud, Yusuf and Kenan, two shepherd boys, flee to Istanbul in search of their uncle. They become involved with the streetboys, and Yusuf turns to crime although Kenan wants to learn a trade.', 'When their father is killed in a blood feud, Yusuf and Kenan, two shepherd boys, flee to Istanbul in search of their uncle. They become involved with the streetboys, and Yusuf turns to crime although Kenan wants to learn a trade.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kRZ8oOX2TypgATLm2z9sYhxxR69.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285163'),
  ('381793660288774056', 'Yusuf Yusuf', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Ersoy Güler, Tolga Kutluay', 'Ersoy Güler, Ramazan Demirli', 'Ali Sunal, Burak Satıbol, Oya Başar, Sinem Öztürk, Bülent Seyran, Ayhan Taş, Eylül Öztürk, Ayçin İnci', null, 'Since his childhood, interested in cars, car races and dreamed to be a rally pilot but became a minibus driver in Ankara. This movie tells Yusuf''s story full of action as well as comedy.', 'Since his childhood, interested in cars, car races and dreamed to be a rally pilot but became a minibus driver in Ankara. This movie tells Yusuf''s story full of action as well as comedy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9O54uBh9rEl9OixUKDUqRjYdjaO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:334613'),
  ('389490907807874501', 'Yuva', 2004, 'Drama, Crime', 'Mani Ratnam, Ravi K. Chandran', 'Mani Ratnam', 'Ajay Devgn, Abhishek Bachchan, Vivek Oberoi, Rani Mukerji, Kareena Kapoor Khan, Esha Deol, Om Puri, Anant Nag', null, 'An accident on a bridge ties together three young men from different social classes, sparking a course of events that will forever alter their lives.', 'An accident on a bridge ties together three young men from different social classes, sparking a course of events that will forever alter their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8cMCIsULa0IrZq0KkCLejMINWmq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43410'),
  ('453676194003988661', 'Yuvvraaj', 2008, 'Drama', 'Subhash Ghai, Arundhati Sen Verma, Rajendra Kumar Das', 'Kamlesh Pandey, Sachin Bhowmick, Subhash Ghai', 'Salman Khan, Anil Kapoor, Katrina Kaif, Zayed Khan, Boman Irani, Mithun Chakraborty, Aushima Sawhney, Javed Sheikh', null, 'Two estranged brothers (Salman Khan, Zayed Khan) must learn to work together to claim their rightful share of an inheritance left solely to their eldest sibling (Anil Kapoor).', 'Two estranged brothers (Salman Khan, Zayed Khan) must learn to work together to claim their rightful share of an inheritance left solely to their eldest sibling (Anil Kapoor).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iZHd6JS8dxsEo4DN4DnIKTHQp4h.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20358'),
  ('837197867694128834', 'Yves Saint Laurent', 2014, 'Drama', 'Jalil Lespert, Thomas Hardmeier', 'Jalil Lespert, Marie-Pierre Huster, Jérémie Guez', 'Pierre Niney, Guillaume Gallienne, Nikolai Kinski, Charlotte Le Bon, Xavier Lafitte, Laura Smet, Marie de Villepin, Ruben Alves', 'R', 'A look at the life of French designer Yves Saint Laurent from the beginning of his career in 1958 when he met his lover and business partner, Pierre Berge.', 'A look at the life of French designer Yves Saint Laurent from the beginning of his career in 1958 when he met his lover and business partner, Pierre Berge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vEepuUvERKdHfUyys1XYbHoERE7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:245775'),
  ('129901229012006110', 'Yvonne of the Night', 1949, 'Drama', 'Giuseppe Amato, Amleto Pannocchia, Mario Craveri', 'Fabrizio Sarazani, Giuseppe Amato, Oreste Biancoli', 'Totò, Olga Villi, Frank Latimore, Eduardo De Filippo, Gino Cervi, Giulio Stival, Arnoldo Foà, John Strange', null, 'Carlo Rutelli falls in love with the beautiful variety singer Yvonne la Nuit, but his father opposes the wedding. World War I breaks out and Carlo is killed while Yvonne has a son, but on orders from Carlo''s father, she is told he is dead. Her career descends and only Nino, an art partner, remains close to her and helps her earn her living by singing in taverns.', 'Carlo Rutelli falls in love with the beautiful variety singer Yvonne la Nuit, but his father opposes the wedding. World War I breaks out and Carlo is killed while Yvonne has a son, but on orders from Carlo''s father, she is told he is dead. Her career descends and only Nino, an art partner, remains close to her and helps her earn her living by singing in taverns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fpl1KI4GhRNZvn29A4hqbWAIzNJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:48948'),
  ('380179859097231154', 'Z', 2019, 'Horror, Thriller', 'Brandon Christensen, Bradley Stuckel', 'Brandon Christensen, Colin Minihan', 'Keegan Connor Tracy, Jett Klyne, Sean Rogerson, Sara Canning, Stephen McHattie, Chandra West, Ali Webb, Deborah Ferguson', null, 'A family find themselves terrorized by their eight-year-old son''s imaginary friend.', 'A family find themselves terrorized by their eight-year-old son''s imaginary friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kFQrl8fCIrQEXqFUc6bBUylrFs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:623520'),
  ('474238773291210714', 'Z Channel: A Magnificent Obsession', 2004, 'History, Documentary', 'Xan Cassavetes, John Pirozzi', null, 'Quentin Tarantino, Robert Altman, Jim Jarmusch, Paul Verhoeven, Alexander Payne, James Woods, Henry Jaglom, Jacqueline Bisset', 'R', 'A documentary on the Z Channel, one of the first pay cable stations in the US, and its programming chief, Jerry Harvey. Debuting in 1974, the LA-based channel''s eclectic slate of movies became a prime example of the untapped power of cable television.', 'A documentary on the Z Channel, one of the first pay cable stations in the US, and its programming chief, Jerry Harvey. Debuting in 1974, the LA-based channel''s eclectic slate of movies became a prime example of the untapped power of cable television.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mhEUVtXc08I8hZSbexWnilXga1p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:56224'),
  ('963375635439880998', 'Z for Zachariah', 2015, 'Drama, Romance, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Craig Zobel, Tim Orr', 'Nissar Modi', 'Margot Robbie, Chiwetel Ejiofor, Chris Pine', 'PG-13', 'In the wake of a nuclear war, a young woman survives on her own, fearing she may actually be the proverbial last woman on earth, until she discovers the most astonishing sight of her life: another human being. A distraught scientist, he’s nearly been driven mad by radiation exposure and his desperate search for others. A fragile, imperative strand of trust connects them. But when a stranger enters the valley, their precarious bond begins to unravel.', 'In the wake of a nuclear war, a young woman survives on her own, fearing she may actually be the proverbial last woman on earth, until she discovers the most astonishing sight of her life: another human being. A distraught scientist, he’s nearly been driven mad by radiation exposure and his desperate search for others. A fragile, imperative strand of trust connects them. But when a stranger enters the valley, their precarious bond begins to unravel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/c7rdpZlviWAcOOx5bnzfqPPPNvq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:193687'),
  ('1061386809666390203', 'Z Storm', 2014, 'Crime, Thriller', 'Tony Cheung Tung-Leung, Chow Chi-Fai, Monet Au Man-Yi', 'Wong Ho-Wa', 'Louis Koo, Gordon Lam Ka-Tung, Dada Chan Ching, Xia Yan, Michael Wong, Lo Hoi-Pang, Stephen Au Kam-Tong, Derek Tsang Kwok-Cheung', null, 'ICAC principal investigator William Luk takes his job seriously, and he needs every last scintilla of support from his team to take on the powerful and cunning Supt Wong, who is corrupt to the core. Wong is an enthusiastic tool of the monstrous Malcolm Wu, a cowboy big-time share trader who will stop at nothing to secure a large slice of the upcoming float of the HK government pension fund, worth billions.', 'ICAC principal investigator William Luk takes his job seriously, and he needs every last scintilla of support from his team to take on the powerful and cunning Supt Wong, who is corrupt to the core. Wong is an enthusiastic tool of the monstrous Malcolm Wu, a cowboy big-time share trader who will stop at nothing to secure a large slice of the upcoming float of the HK government pension fund, worth billions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fAHPfitc4deaquh9mg2oIsMcMVV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:277519'),
  ('573840166511300276', 'Z Zone', 2024, 'Horror', 'Bilguun Chuluundorj', 'Bilguun Chuluundorj', 'Purevjargal Erdenebileg, Bazarragchaa Byambajav, Tsenguun Chingis, Byambasuren Bumbayar, Batbaatar Batkhuleg, Odgerel Bat-Orshikh, Dashnamjil Iderjavkhlan, Sukhbaatar Sukhbat', null, 'In a remote corner of the world, a group of troubled youths finds themselves whisked away to a mysterious military base after a series of misbehaviors. Expecting little more than a stern reprimand, they are instead thrust into a world of secrets and shadows. In a desperate bid for freedom, they must unravel the mysteries of the base and confront the sinister forces that lurk in the shadows. But with time running out and danger lurking around every corner, the odds of survival grow slimmer by the minute. Courage, strength, and sacrifice, would they finally escape the clutches of the base and emerge from the darkness into the light?', 'In a remote corner of the world, a group of troubled youths finds themselves whisked away to a mysterious military base after a series of misbehaviors. Expecting little more than a stern reprimand, they are instead thrust into a world of secrets and shadows. In a desperate bid for freedom, they must unravel the mysteries of the base and confront the sinister forces that lurk in the shadows. But with time running out and danger lurking around every corner, the odds of survival grow slimmer by the minute. Courage, strength, and sacrifice, would they finally escape the clutches of the base and emerge from the darkness into the light?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6kFtdxfTC4xR8yDGbIjTgGEcFI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1301650'),
  ('670439019016509769', 'Z-O-M-B-I-E-S', 2018, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Paul Hoen', 'David Light, Joseph Raso', 'Meg Donnelly, Milo Manheim, Trevor Tordjman, Kylee Russell, Carla Jeffery, Kingston Foster, James Godfrey, Naomi Snieckus', 'G', 'Two star-crossed freshmen – a zombie, Zed and a cheerleader, Addison – each outsiders in their unique ways, befriend each other and work together to show their high school and the Seabrook community what they can achieve when they embrace their differences.', 'Two star-crossed freshmen – a zombie, Zed and a cheerleader, Addison – each outsiders in their unique ways, befriend each other and work together to show their high school and the Seabrook community what they can achieve when they embrace their differences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6S9O5U7Ietqh6zTtZhGbhbA3Pze.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:483980'),
  ('15023755353887886', 'Z-O-M-B-I-E-S 2', 2020, 'Fantasy, Romance, TV Movie', 'Rudolf Blahacek, Paul Hoen, Andrew Shea', 'Joseph Raso, David Light', 'Meg Donnelly, Milo Manheim, Chandler Kinney, Trevor Tordjman, Kylee Russell, Carla Jeffery, Pearce Joza, Ariel Martin', 'G', 'Zed and Addison are back at Seabrook High, where, after a groundbreaking semester, they continue to steer both their school and community toward unity. But the arrival of a new group of outsiders – mysterious werewolves – threatens to shake up the newfound peace and causes a rift in Zed and Addison’s budding romance.', 'Zed and Addison are back at Seabrook High, where, after a groundbreaking semester, they continue to steer both their school and community toward unity. But the arrival of a new group of outsiders – mysterious werewolves – threatens to shake up the newfound peace and causes a rift in Zed and Addison’s budding romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cOnxoQ3kx4mgmWb7yRi6GBWssOh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:599521'),
  ('1114224814607587092', 'Z-O-M-B-I-E-S 3', 2022, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family, TV Movie', 'Paul Hoen, Boluwatife Samson, Brent Geisler', 'David Light, Joseph Raso', 'Meg Donnelly, Milo Manheim, Chandler Kinney, Trevor Tordjman, Pearce Joza, Ariel Martin, Matt Cornett, Terry Hu', 'G', 'Zed and Addison are beginning their final year at Seabrook High in the town that’s become a safe haven for monsters and humans alike. Zed is anticipating an athletic scholarship that will make him the first Zombie to attend college, while Addison is gearing up for Seabrook’s first international cheer-off competition. Then suddenly, extraterrestrial beings appear around Seabrook, provoking something other than friendly competition.', 'Zed and Addison are beginning their final year at Seabrook High in the town that’s become a safe haven for monsters and humans alike. Zed is anticipating an athletic scholarship that will make him the first Zombie to attend college, while Addison is gearing up for Seabrook’s first international cheer-off competition. Then suddenly, extraterrestrial beings appear around Seabrook, provoking something other than friendly competition.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqzdv4nArhuZxd7il0boKaVxQMF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:809107'),
  ('848102681098982401', 'Z-O-M-B-I-E-S 4: Dawn of the Vampires', 2025, 'Fantasy, Music, Romance, Adventure, Family, Comedy, TV Movie', 'Paul Hoen, Danielle Aufiero, Amber Horn', 'David Light, Joseph Raso, Josh A. Cagan', 'Meg Donnelly, Milo Manheim, Freya Skye, Malachi Barton, Kylee Russell, Chandler Kinney, Swayam Bhatia, Julian Lerner', 'G', 'A new adventure dawns for Zed and Addison when their summer road trip takes an unexpected detour, landing them in the middle of yet another monster rivalry: Daywalkers vs. Vampires. Tensions flare when Zed and Addison find themselves acting as camp counselors between the two opposing supernatural factions. With the help of Eliza and Willa, they must convince sworn enemies Nova and Victor to try to unite their warring worlds before an even greater threat endangers them all.', 'A new adventure dawns for Zed and Addison when their summer road trip takes an unexpected detour, landing them in the middle of yet another monster rivalry: Daywalkers vs. Vampires. Tensions flare when Zed and Addison find themselves acting as camp counselors between the two opposing supernatural factions. With the help of Eliza and Willa, they must convince sworn enemies Nova and Victor to try to unite their warring worlds before an even greater threat endangers them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6rGsqBxI4r1YkS9FuraovWi465w.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1243341'),
  ('247432848608995974', 'Z.P.G.', 1972, 'Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Michael Campus, Jan Weincke, Michael Reed', 'Max Ehrlich, Frank De Felitta', 'Oliver Reed, Geraldine Chaplin, Don Gordon, Diane Cilento, David Markham, Bill Nagy, Sheila Reid, Aubrey Woods', 'PG', 'In the not too distant future, an overpopulated Earth government makes it illegal to have children for a generation. One couple, unsatisfied with their substitute robot baby, breaks the rules.', 'In the not too distant future, an overpopulated Earth government makes it illegal to have children for a generation. One couple, unsatisfied with their substitute robot baby, breaks the rules.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rAV2ZiU3mAe0fyqGhHp3N8e5XoF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52608'),
  ('350651458356041179', 'Za Palycha! 2', 2026, 'Comedy, Action, War', 'Maxim Boev, Vyacheslav Krasakov, Natalya Gavrilkova, Evgeniya Paymetkina, Aleksey Tikhonov, Alexandr Chubinets, Olga Bulanova', 'Georgy Afanasyev, Maxim Boev', 'Egor Ovchinnikov, Sergey Shakurov, Nikolay Naumov', null, 'Artyom Golub was once a rich kid, confident his father would "solve" any problem. But life put everything in its place: after an accident, Tema joins the Airborne Forces. Upon his return, he works, raises his daughter, and tries to live by his conscience. Meanwhile, his grandfather, the legendary paratrooper Palych, grows apple trees and dreams of peace. However, businessman Vasiliy arrives in Podgorny, wanting to tear down the monument to the Liberator Soldier and build a shopping mall. Palych protests, then disappears. To save his grandfather and uncover the truth behind the conflict, Tyoma reassembles the paratroopers.', 'Artyom Golub was once a rich kid, confident his father would "solve" any problem. But life put everything in its place: after an accident, Tema joins the Airborne Forces. Upon his return, he works, raises his daughter, and tries to live by his conscience. Meanwhile, his grandfather, the legendary paratrooper Palych, grows apple trees and dreams of peace. However, businessman Vasiliy arrives in Podgorny, wanting to tear down the monument to the Liberator Soldier and build a shopping mall. Palych protests, then disappears. To save his grandfather and uncover the truth behind the conflict, Tyoma reassembles the paratroopers.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2Fgu1junYOcKD1Nwqijjs75pF0Qao.jpg', 'plex:movie:za-palycha-2'),
  ('167509745887999385', 'Zaat', 1971, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Don Barton, Jack McGowan', 'Don Barton', 'Marshall Grauer, Wade Popwell, Paul Galloway, Gerald Cruse, Sanna Ringhaver, Dave Dickerson, Rich Valliere, Nancy Lien', 'PG', 'A mad scientist unleashes his master plan: to transform himself into a mutated walking catfish, and gain revenge on those who have spurned him. His plans go wrong, and he becomes tempted to kidnap a nubile young woman to similarly transform her so that he can breed.', 'A mad scientist unleashes his master plan: to transform himself into a mutated walking catfish, and gain revenge on those who have spurned him. His plans go wrong, and he becomes tempted to kidnap a nubile young woman to similarly transform her so that he can breed.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g0kYZe6feiXQowaNsV6GBW5R5q0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31116'),
  ('206000495947017119', 'Zabriskie Point', 1970, 'Drama', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Alfio Contini, Robert Rubin', 'Michelangelo Antonioni, Tonino Guerra, Sam Shepard', 'Mark Frechette, Daria Halprin, Paul Fix, G.D. Spradlin, Bill Garaway, Kathleen Cleaver, Rod Taylor, Martin Abrahams', 'R', 'Anthropology student Daria, who''s helping a property developer build a village in the Los Angeles desert, and dropout Mark, who''s wanted by the authorities for allegedly killing a policeman during a student riot, accidentally encounter each other in Death Valley and soon begin an unrestrained romance.', 'Anthropology student Daria, who''s helping a property developer build a village in the Los Angeles desert, and dropout Mark, who''s wanted by the authorities for allegedly killing a policeman during a student riot, accidentally encounter each other in Death Valley and soon begin an unrestrained romance.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uelo2oMg4fM51LAm4eEArEwOHXZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2998'),
  ('436977762519160216', 'Zach Galifianakis: Live at the Purple Onion', 2007, 'Comedy', 'Michael Blieden, Brandon Hickman', 'Zach Galifianakis', 'Zach Galifianakis, Joe Wagner, Brian Unger', 'NR', 'From an inauspicious beginning performing comedy routines in the back of a burger joint in New York, unorthodox stand-up star Zach Galifianakis has made a splash on the scene with his inimitable brand of humor. In this live show filmed at San Francisco''s Purple Onion nightclub, the versatile funnyman serves up a healthy dose of his signature wit.', 'From an inauspicious beginning performing comedy routines in the back of a burger joint in New York, unorthodox stand-up star Zach Galifianakis has made a splash on the scene with his inimitable brand of humor. In this live show filmed at San Francisco''s Purple Onion nightclub, the versatile funnyman serves up a healthy dose of his signature wit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/96plQO27AHyfxjVbSewKTtUkohv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16453'),
  ('998521844539432523', 'Zach''s Lie', null, 'Drama', 'Erahm Christopher', 'Roland Smith, Erahm Christopher', 'Gaten Matarazzo, Diego Velazquez, Logan Thompson, Landry Bender', null, 'Jack Osborne''s life changes forever the night men in masks break into his house, threaten his family, and ransack their home. Jack, his mother, and his sister are then forced to enter Witness Security Program. Jack becomes "Zach" and moves to Elko, Nevada, a town in the middle of nowhere. There he meets Sam, the strangest school custodian he has ever encountered, and Catalin, a girl who might make Zach''s uprooting worth the trouble. But just as Zach finally begins to piece together a new life, he finds himself in danger again-and this time his actions could determine the fates of everyone he cares about.', 'Jack Osborne''s life changes forever the night men in masks break into his house, threaten his family, and ransack their home. Jack, his mother, and his sister are then forced to enter Witness Security Program. Jack becomes "Zach" and moves to Elko, Nevada, a town in the middle of nowhere. There he meets Sam, the strangest school custodian he has ever encountered, and Catalin, a girl who might make Zach''s uprooting worth the trouble. But just as Zach finally begins to piece together a new life, he finds himself in danger again-and this time his actions could determine the fates of everyone he cares about.', null, 'tmdb:movie:432421'),
  ('585900590216237689', 'Zachariah', 1971, 'Comedy, Drama, Music, Western', 'George Englund, Jaime Contreras, Terry Morse Jr.', 'Phil Proctor, David Ossman, Philip Austin', 'John Rubinstein, Patricia Quinn, Don Johnson, Elvin Jones, Dick Van Patten, Doug Kershaw, William Challee, Robert Ball', 'PG', 'A blacksmith and an amateur gunslinger embark on journey through the west together but soon separate and have surreal experiences of their own.', 'A blacksmith and an amateur gunslinger embark on journey through the west together but soon separate and have surreal experiences of their own.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3UsTPl50gVevv3ycyFM7BhuIMIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:65134'),
  ('54763858291610946', 'Zack and Miri Make a Porno', 2008, 'Comedy, Romance', 'David Klein, Kevin Smith, Milos Milicevic', 'Kevin Smith', 'Seth Rogen, Elizabeth Banks, Craig Robinson, Gerry Bednob, Edward Janda, Nicholas Lombardi, Chris Milan, Jennifer Schwalbach Smith', 'R', 'Lifelong platonic friends Zack and Miri look to solve their respective cash-flow problems by making an adult film together. As the cameras roll, however, the duo begin to sense that they may have more feelings for each other than they previously thought.', 'Lifelong platonic friends Zack and Miri look to solve their respective cash-flow problems by making an adult film together. As the cameras roll, however, the duo begin to sense that they may have more feelings for each other than they previously thought.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ipePhKf87FixwfAVJ8MMWK53caI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10358'),
