  ('515154403282440390', 'Zack Snyder''s Justice League', 2021, 'Action, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Ben Howard, Damon Caro, Misha Bukowski', 'Chris Terrio', 'Ben Affleck, Henry Cavill, Gal Gadot, Ray Fisher, Jason Momoa, Ezra Miller, Ciarán Hinds, Amy Adams', 'R', 'Determined to ensure Superman''s ultimate sacrifice was not in vain, Bruce Wayne aligns forces with Diana Prince with plans to recruit a team of metahumans to protect the world from an approaching threat of catastrophic proportions.', 'Determined to ensure Superman''s ultimate sacrifice was not in vain, Bruce Wayne aligns forces with Diana Prince with plans to recruit a team of metahumans to protect the world from an approaching threat of catastrophic proportions.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tnAuB8q5vv7Ax9UAEje5Xi4BXik.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:791373'),
  ('787869587384888742', 'Zafarinas', 1995, 'Thriller', 'Pedro Olea, Paco Femenía', 'Pedro Olea, Fernando Lalana', 'Jorge Sanz, María Barranco, Óscar Ladoire, Javier Albalá, Esperanza Campuzano, Ramón Langa, Miguel del Arco, David González', null, 'International Award Winning Actor Jorge Sanz, star of the Academy Award© winning picture, "Belle Epoque", stars in this action packed film in which a corporal of the guard is teamed with a young prisoner to solve the strange killings that have occurred in the walled city of Zafarinas. The young team finds themselves plunged into a world of drugs, deceit and passion where they find that all is not what it seems.', 'International Award Winning Actor Jorge Sanz, star of the Academy Award© winning picture, "Belle Epoque", stars in this action packed film in which a corporal of the guard is teamed with a young prisoner to solve the strange killings that have occurred in the walled city of Zafarinas. The young team finds themselves plunged into a world of drugs, deceit and passion where they find that all is not what it seems.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Y3PSIFboEDBfLlNSe3h7BH7AHk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120506'),
  ('313752660531448695', 'Zaï Zaï Zaï Zaï', 2022, 'Comedy', 'François Desagnat, Olivier Gossot', 'Jean-Luc Gaget, François Desagnat', 'Jean-Paul Rouve, Julie Depardieu, Yolande Moreau, Ramzy Bedia, Julie Gayet, Sarah-Laure Estragnat, David Schnee, Émilie Perrin', null, 'Imagine a world where the worst behaviour you could ever have is to forget your store''s loyalty card in your other trousers...that''s what happens to Adrien. This serious misconduct forces him to go into hiding, as both police and media hunt him down.', 'Imagine a world where the worst behaviour you could ever have is to forget your store''s loyalty card in your other trousers...that''s what happens to Adrien. This serious misconduct forces him to go into hiding, as both police and media hunt him down.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mJy20VCNMXq4DVlLzuowjqdeY3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:774600'),
  ('608645866265592952', 'Zaina: Rider of the Atlas', 2005, 'Adventure, Family', 'Bourlem Guerdjou, Bruno de Keyzer', 'Bourlem Guerdjou, Juliette Sales', 'Aziza Nadir, Simon Abkarian, Sami Bouajila, Michel Favory, Assaad Bouab, Lounès Tazairt, Hassam Ghancy, Taïeb Ajedig', null, 'Young Zaina, must lead a caravan of precious thoroughbreds to Marrakech to take part of the most prestigious of all races : the Agdal. Along she''ll have to face powerful OMAR and learn to trust her newly discovered father Mustapha.', 'Young Zaina, must lead a caravan of precious thoroughbreds to Marrakech to take part of the most prestigious of all races : the Agdal. Along she''ll have to face powerful OMAR and learn to trust her newly discovered father Mustapha.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6Vg38bP2EbYx21rPw07xp3gzucK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:78351'),
  ('76497858374791711', 'Zak & Wowo: The Legend of Lendarys', 2024, 'Animation, Adventure, Fantasy', 'Philippe Duchene, Jean-Baptiste Cuvelier', 'Nadege Girardot, Philippe Duchene', 'Jérôme Niel, Manu Payet, Clara Luciani, Kyan Khojandi, Akil Wingate', null, 'In a land of verdant landscapes, the emergence of terrifying creatures forces all to seek refuge in a fortified city -- all but twins Zak and Kyle.', 'In a land of verdant landscapes, the emergence of terrifying creatures forces all to seek refuge in a fortified city -- all but twins Zak and Kyle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tN7tc6JkFKHyma4i5bLCn5wNgL1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1208491'),
  ('67666416631035741', 'Zakhar Berkut', 1972, 'Drama, History', 'Leonid Osyka, Valeriy Kvas, L. Kolesnik', 'Dmytro Pavlychko', 'Vasyl Symchych, Ivan Havryliuk, Antonina Leftiy, Kostiantyn Stepankov, Boryslav Brondukov, Ivan Mykolaichuk, Bolot Beyshenaliev, Fedir Panasenko', null, 'This film is based on the classic novel of the same name by writer Ivan Franko, one of the most famous figures of Ukrainian literature. It is set during the 1200s and the invasion of the medieval Ukrainian-Russian state of Rus'' by Chengis Khan''s Golden Horde. Due to its having been produced during the Soviet era, the story''s aspect of class-conflict between the "heroic" peasantry and the "decadent" noble particularly emphasized here.', 'This film is based on the classic novel of the same name by writer Ivan Franko, one of the most famous figures of Ukrainian literature. It is set during the 1200s and the invasion of the medieval Ukrainian-Russian state of Rus'' by Chengis Khan''s Golden Horde. Due to its having been produced during the Soviet era, the story''s aspect of class-conflict between the "heroic" peasantry and the "decadent" noble particularly emphasized here.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3MtWuPUGKS8K5OCnFKGuO5iPAFL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278089'),
  ('802542214199982124', 'Zakhm', 1998, 'Drama', 'Mahesh Bhatt', 'Tanuja Chandra, Mahesh Bhatt', 'Ajay Devgn, Pooja Bhatt, Sonali Bendre, Kunal Khemu, Ashutosh Rana, Nagarjuna Akkineni', null, 'Amidst religious riots, a son deals with his mother''s life-threatening injuries, and her last request.', 'Amidst religious riots, a son deals with his mother''s life-threatening injuries, and her last request.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qXJWHVj3vcQviTKpKGHjYMypitj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:155308'),
  ('100683987305632653', 'Zaki Chan', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Wael Ehsan, Mohamed Shafiq, Sherif Ismail', 'Mohamed Fadl', 'Ahmed Helmy, Yasmin Abdulaziz, Amir Karara, Hassan Hosny, Mahmoud El-Bezzawy, Hassan Kamy, Youssef Daoud, Badria Tolba', null, 'Trouble follows Zaki wherever he goes, until he finds out that his father''s boss needs a bodyguard for his kids and he decides to apply for the job even though he doesn''t really fit the requirements.', 'Trouble follows Zaki wherever he goes, until he finds out that his father''s boss needs a bodyguard for his kids and he decides to apply for the job even though he doesn''t really fit the requirements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8qq6zrQcI6xOgxym0q9VU6uGEUK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:191159'),
  ('768299271550217853', 'Zakir Khan: Haq Se Single', 2017, 'Comedy', 'Angshuman Ghosh', 'Zakir Khan', 'Zakir Khan', null, 'In Haq Se Single, Zakir''s narrative takes you through his own journey of becoming the ultimate #SakhtLaunda. The guy who''s survived rejection, love, heart breaks and adulthood - who''s single and proud of it!', 'In Haq Se Single, Zakir''s narrative takes you through his own journey of becoming the ultimate #SakhtLaunda. The guy who''s survived rejection, love, heart breaks and adulthood - who''s single and proud of it!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ybNEKl4BMLCjlAxCok6t8DHb9x0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:462405'),
  ('1005820688739196891', 'Zakir Khan: Kaksha Gyarvi', 2018, 'Comedy', 'Angshuman Ghosh', 'Zakir Khan', 'Zakir Khan', null, 'Zakir Khan is back, and this time he takes you down the memory lane by reminiscing about school, friends and everything that era signified for Zakir. Right from survival to bullying he shares every hysterical and amusing story from his book of memories.', 'Zakir Khan is back, and this time he takes you down the memory lane by reminiscing about school, friends and everything that era signified for Zakir. Right from survival to bullying he shares every hysterical and amusing story from his book of memories.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oq8rDKYgNsy7onNyUPMbINhDxaH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:563778'),
  ('619385002301823957', 'Zakir Khan: Tathastu', 2022, 'Comedy, TV Movie', null, 'Zakir Khan', 'Zakir Khan', null, 'Tathastu starts off with a recap of moments from Zakir''s life. Starting from his early school days, the performance is a ride where the audience gets a peek at the family he was born in, the characters he grew closest to and his young years bloated with aspirations of becoming an RJ. He goes onto share a few personal learnings on stage as he tries to make sense of his journey thus far.', 'Tathastu starts off with a recap of moments from Zakir''s life. Starting from his early school days, the performance is a ride where the audience gets a peek at the family he was born in, the characters he grew closest to and his young years bloated with aspirations of becoming an RJ. He goes onto share a few personal learnings on stage as he tries to make sense of his journey thus far.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKIyc4DHs8TV8seyNBLAuxvsgFY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1054569'),
