  ('140070499822896097', 'Zama', 2017, 'Drama, History', 'Lucrecia Martel, Rui Poças', 'Lucrecia Martel', 'Daniel Giménez Cacho, Lola Dueñas, Matheus Nachtergaele, Juan Minujín, Nahuel Cano, Mariana Nunes, Carlos Defeo, Rafael Spregelburd', null, 'In a remote South American colony in the late 18th century, officer Zama of the Spanish crown waits in vain for a transfer to a more prestigious location. He suffers small humiliations and petty politicking as he increasingly succumbs to lust and paranoia.', 'In a remote South American colony in the late 18th century, officer Zama of the Spanish crown waits in vain for a transfer to a more prestigious location. He suffers small humiliations and petty politicking as he increasingly succumbs to lust and paranoia.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kpp9R6iYKSIXxfyW0feVYrk0jsg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:326382'),
  ('953507631673010420', 'Zamaana Deewana', 1995, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ramesh Sippy, Amar Dogra, K.K. Mahajan', 'Javed Siddiqui', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Jeetendra, Shatrughan Sinha, Raveena Tandon, Anupam Kher, Prem Chopra, Tinnu Anand, Kiran Juneja', null, 'A police commissioner enlists the aid of an eccentric inspector to end a gang war between bitter enemies.', 'A police commissioner enlists the aid of an eccentric inspector to end a gang war between bitter enemies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYAfxnzVM604D4kuqziemoGtHnq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160247'),
  ('497574119559552115', 'Zambezia', 2012, 'Comedy, Animation, Adventure, Family', 'Wayne Thornley', 'Andrew Cook, Raffaella Delle Donne, Wayne Thornley', 'Samuel L. Jackson, Abigail Breslin, Leonard Nimoy, Jeremy Suarez, Jeff Goldblum, Jenifer Lewis, Noureen DeWulf, Richard E. Grant', 'G', 'Set in a bustling bird city on the edge of the majestic Victoria Falls, "Zambezia" is the story of Kai - a naïve, but high-spirited young falcon who travels to the bird city of "Zambezia" where he discovers the truth about his origins and, in defending the city, learns how to be part of a community.', 'Set in a bustling bird city on the edge of the majestic Victoria Falls, "Zambezia" is the story of Kai - a naïve, but high-spirited young falcon who travels to the bird city of "Zambezia" where he discovers the truth about his origins and, in defending the city, learns how to be part of a community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7aJl440TlbyqthklVrvCnSbjKYe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:133931'),
  ('486656751926207417', 'Zameen', 2003, 'Action, Thriller', 'Rohit Shetty', 'Robin Bhatt', 'Ajay Devgn, Abhishek Bachchan, Bipasha Basu, Mukesh Tiwari, Pankaj Dheer, Mohan Joshi, Amrita Arora, Arun Bali', null, 'An Army colonel (Devgan) and his commandos capture a dangerous terrorist. The other members of the terrorists'' organization hatch a plot to hijack an Indian jet and demand his release in exchange. In Mumbai, ACP Jay (Bachchan) is hot on their trail. He discovers Army''s involvement in the case and has to work together with the colonel. However, there are some skeletons in the closet.', 'An Army colonel (Devgan) and his commandos capture a dangerous terrorist. The other members of the terrorists'' organization hatch a plot to hijack an Indian jet and demand his release in exchange. In Mumbai, ACP Jay (Bachchan) is hot on their trail. He discovers Army''s involvement in the case and has to work together with the colonel. However, there are some skeletons in the closet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAKO0Rk0Vqm1Mabi6tpFTY202hz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101783'),
  ('79611009905238765', 'Zamfir''s Zona', 2002, 'Drama', 'Zdravko Šotra', 'Zdravko Šotra', 'Vojin Ćetković, Katarina Radivojević, Dragoslav ''Dragan'' Nikolić, Milena Dravić, Radmila Živković, Nikola Đuričko, Sloboda Mićalović, Nebojša Ilić', null, 'Zona Zamfirova is set in the eastern Serbian city of Niš in the 19th century. The plot follows the story of Zona Zamfirova, a local rich man''s daughter, and the vicissitudes of her affair with Mane, an ordinary goldsmith. As it was undesirable for the daughter of a rich man to marry a craftsman, the two are at first divided, with the possibility of Zona marrying Manulać, who came from a wealthy family. Everything is, however, changed as Mane organizes a successful conspiracy to keep Zona for himself.', 'Zona Zamfirova is set in the eastern Serbian city of Niš in the 19th century. The plot follows the story of Zona Zamfirova, a local rich man''s daughter, and the vicissitudes of her affair with Mane, an ordinary goldsmith. As it was undesirable for the daughter of a rich man to marry a craftsman, the two are at first divided, with the possibility of Zona marrying Manulać, who came from a wealthy family. Everything is, however, changed as Mane organizes a successful conspiracy to keep Zona for himself.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dH2d2wPHimn1diMdmKb5cUJIz4n.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51817'),
  ('745632346708708291', 'Zamora', 2024, 'Comedy', 'Neri Marcorè, Duccio Cimatti', 'Neri Marcorè, Alessandro Rossi, Paola Mammini', 'Alberto Paradossi, Marta Gastini, Neri Marcorè, Anna Ferraioli Ravel, Giovanni Storti, Walter Leonardi, Giovanni Esposito, Antonio Catania', null, 'Soccer is an alien world for Walter Vismara, an unfamiliar terrain he''s always avoided. But when his job hangs in the balance, he''s thrust into the role of goalkeeper by his soccer-obsessed boss. Forced into a relentless routine of practice sessions and taunts, Walter finds himself trapped in a nightmare. His troubles escalate when he discovers his beloved in the arms of his archenemy, adding a personal dimension to his challenges. Determined to prove his worth, Walter devises a plan: to play the fool outwardly while secretly honing his skills. As he navigates this comedic yet challenging journey on the soccer field, will Walter emerge victorious and finally earn the respect he deserves?', 'Soccer is an alien world for Walter Vismara, an unfamiliar terrain he''s always avoided. But when his job hangs in the balance, he''s thrust into the role of goalkeeper by his soccer-obsessed boss. Forced into a relentless routine of practice sessions and taunts, Walter finds himself trapped in a nightmare. His troubles escalate when he discovers his beloved in the arms of his archenemy, adding a personal dimension to his challenges. Determined to prove his worth, Walter devises a plan: to play the fool outwardly while secretly honing his skills. As he navigates this comedic yet challenging journey on the soccer field, will Walter emerge victorious and finally earn the respect he deserves?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xS1ZTbiPVMaXrBV4WInEIeJOmQc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1066591'),
  ('657559280977138115', 'Zampo y yo', 1966, 'Drama', 'Luis Lucia', null, 'Ana Belén, Fernando Rey, Luis Dávila, Humberto Sempere, Emiliano Redondo, Montserrat Julió', null, 'Ana Belén, motherless and daughter of a powerful businessman, lives in a luxurious mansion; but she is not happy, until she attends a circus performance, where she meets Zampo, an old clown with whom she becomes close friends.', 'Ana Belén, motherless and daughter of a powerful businessman, lives in a luxurious mansion; but she is not happy, until she attends a circus performance, where she meets Zampo, an old clown with whom she becomes close friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fl5wkFzhe0msIHOYKwn5LyDqFfn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:222605'),
  ('360721546711248626', 'Zandalee', 1991, 'Drama, Romance, Thriller', 'Sam Pillsbury, Patrick Burns, Joe Burns', 'Mari Kornhauser', 'Nicolas Cage, Erika Anderson, Judge Reinhold, Joe Pantoliano, Viveca Lindfors, Steve Buscemi, Marisa Tomei, Aaron Neville', 'R', 'Bored with her marriage to burnt out poet turned corporate executive Thierry, Zandalee falls prey to an old friend of her husband, the manipulative and egotistical Johnny and becomes enmeshed in a sensual, passionate and destructive affair.', 'Bored with her marriage to burnt out poet turned corporate executive Thierry, Zandalee falls prey to an old friend of her husband, the manipulative and egotistical Johnny and becomes enmeshed in a sensual, passionate and destructive affair.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sW7nX30z07kmmstuI9S9s5ZSSAb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36630'),
  ('635954261817129856', 'Zandy''s Bride', 1974, 'Western', 'Jan Troell, Jordan Cronenweth, Miles Middough', 'Marc Norman', 'Gene Hackman, Liv Ullmann, Eileen Heckart, Susan Tyrrell, Harry Dean Stanton, Joe Santos, Frank Cady, Sam Bottoms', 'PG', 'Zandy Allan purchases a mail-order bride, Hannah Lund. He treats her as a possession, without respect or humanity, until their shared ordeal as they struggle to survive develops in him a growing love.', 'Zandy Allan purchases a mail-order bride, Hannah Lund. He treats her as a possession, without respect or humanity, until their shared ordeal as they struggle to survive develops in him a growing love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b6QSdYiswlZdpnWksd8uQ7kLtgJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:96337'),
  ('53228906105420619', 'Zanetti Story', 2015, 'Documentary', 'Carlo A. Sigon, Simone Scafidi', null, 'Javier Zanetti, José Mourinho, Lionel Messi, Roberto Baggio, Esteban Cambiasso, Jorge Burruchaga, Ivan Cordoba, Massimo Moratti', null, 'Javier Zanetti is one of the last legends of world football. In 1995, still a boy, leaves his Buenos Aires to go to play in Europe, in Inter Milan. Quickly he became the favorite one of Inter''s supporters, and while the years pass,while many great players arrive at Inter without winning anything, he trains and fights every day with the same force as of the beginning. Until, at the age of 40, he wins what no other captain has ever won in the all history of Inter. The story of Javier Zanetti is told through the voices of teammates, coaches, journalists and personalities from the world of entertainment. And most importantly, by the great Argentine writer Albino Guaron,who has dedicated his last novel to Zanetti.', 'Javier Zanetti is one of the last legends of world football. In 1995, still a boy, leaves his Buenos Aires to go to play in Europe, in Inter Milan. Quickly he became the favorite one of Inter''s supporters, and while the years pass,while many great players arrive at Inter without winning anything, he trains and fights every day with the same force as of the beginning. Until, at the age of 40, he wins what no other captain has ever won in the all history of Inter. The story of Javier Zanetti is told through the voices of teammates, coaches, journalists and personalities from the world of entertainment. And most importantly, by the great Argentine writer Albino Guaron,who has dedicated his last novel to Zanetti.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eVyRMYegjAyDGgvJXvip89Zjp0c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:328087'),
  ('916923194819912945', 'Zanjeer', 1973, 'Action', 'N. Satyen, Prakash Mehra', 'Salim Khan, Javed Akhtar', 'Amitabh Bachchan, Jaya Bachchan, Pran Sikand, Om Prakash, Ajit Khan, Bindu Desai, Iftekhar, Keshto Mukherjee', null, 'A tough and honest police officer clashes with a crime boss who, unbeknownst to him, happens to be his parents'' murderer.', 'A tough and honest police officer clashes with a crime boss who, unbeknownst to him, happens to be his parents'' murderer.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/durMAVvVETtevu1EDv3VIcNs7gO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:103236'),
  ('453401666723524617', 'Zanjeer', 2013, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Apoorva Lakhia', 'Apoorva Lakhia, Suresh Nair', 'Ram Charan, Prakash Raj, Priyanka Chopra Jonas, Sanjay Dutt, Srihari, Atul Kulkarni, Mahie Gill, Kavita Kaushik', null, 'A remake of the 1973 action film of the same name.', 'A remake of the 1973 action film of the same name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xh9sPcIEIdco1EzBaEXmuPlZv44.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:218898'),
  ('869864415215330516', 'Zapata: The dream of a hero', 2004, 'War, Drama', 'Alfonso Arau, Vittorio Storaro, Marcelo Del Rio', 'Alfonso Arau', 'Alejandro Fernández, Patricia Velásquez, Jesús Ochoa, Jaime Camil, Fernando Becerril, Miguel Couturier, Lucero, José Luis Cruz', null, 'This fictionalized portrayal of Emiliano Zapata as an Indigenous Mexican shaman, directed by Alfonso Arau, was reportedly the most expensive Mexican movie ever produced, with a massive ad campaign, and the largest ever opening in the nation''s history. Unusual in the Mexican film industry, Zapata was financed independently.', 'This fictionalized portrayal of Emiliano Zapata as an Indigenous Mexican shaman, directed by Alfonso Arau, was reportedly the most expensive Mexican movie ever produced, with a massive ad campaign, and the largest ever opening in the nation''s history. Unusual in the Mexican film industry, Zapata was financed independently.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jE3WNZ7eYSPpmJCeTgim5j4v8T0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:174120'),
  ('1029358345761809992', 'Zapatos viejos', 1993, 'Comedy, Drama, Music', 'Sergio Andrade, Pedro Galindo III', null, 'Gloria Trevi, Alma Muriel, Silvia Derbez, Jorge "Maromero" Paez', null, 'Young Gloria is abused by the Vitorina, hospice caretaker hosting it. She forces her to perform the heaviest tasks. Gloria is only happy in music class. When she grows decides to escape, and now she lives on the street with another girl, both singing in the trucks and try to survive.', 'Young Gloria is abused by the Vitorina, hospice caretaker hosting it. She forces her to perform the heaviest tasks. Gloria is only happy in music class. When she grows decides to escape, and now she lives on the street with another girl, both singing in the trucks and try to survive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b9qzo67b9mUIclYEJ38IqoQPnri.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:186721'),
  ('509374757130785418', 'Zappa', 1983, 'Drama', 'Bille August, Jan Weincke, Mads Egmont Christensen', 'Bjarne Reuter', 'Adam Tønsberg, Morten Hoff, Peter Reichhardt, Lone Lindorff, Arne Hansen, Thomas Nielsen, Solbjørg Højfeldt, Bent Raahauge Jørgensen', null, 'Denmark, 1961. Bjørn, a middle-class boy in his early teens, wants to be accepted by Steen, a bullying peer of his with wealthy but freezingly cold parents. Bjørn''s other good friend is Mulle, a cheerful and more childish working-class boy. All three seem friends at first, but gradually Steen starts pushing Mulle away while pulling the impressionable Bjørn with him towards more and more violence.', 'Denmark, 1961. Bjørn, a middle-class boy in his early teens, wants to be accepted by Steen, a bullying peer of his with wealthy but freezingly cold parents. Bjørn''s other good friend is Mulle, a cheerful and more childish working-class boy. All three seem friends at first, but gradually Steen starts pushing Mulle away while pulling the impressionable Bjørn with him towards more and more violence.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sVlxMRMdwhHxsHKBKhjvtz6jOJy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16039'),
  ('183106143821555333', 'Zappa', 2020, 'Music, Documentary', 'Alex Winter, Anghel Decca', null, 'Frank Zappa, Mike Keneally, Pamela Des Barres, Lonnie Lardner, Patrice Zappa, Rose Zappa, Francis Zappa, Edgard Varèse', 'NR', 'With the help of more than 10,000 dedicated Zappa fans, this is the long-awaited definitive documentary project of Alex Winter documenting the life and career of enigmatic groundbreaking rock star Frank Zappa. Alex also utilizes in this picture thousands of hours of painstakingly digitized videos, photos, audio, writing, and everything in between from Zappa''s private archives. These chronicles have never been brought to a public audience before, until now.', 'With the help of more than 10,000 dedicated Zappa fans, this is the long-awaited definitive documentary project of Alex Winter documenting the life and career of enigmatic groundbreaking rock star Frank Zappa. Alex also utilizes in this picture thousands of hours of painstakingly digitized videos, photos, audio, writing, and everything in between from Zappa''s private archives. These chronicles have never been brought to a public audience before, until now.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qQVsDHZ2JZ4dEtAZVMmZqfH4xpG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:353047'),
  ('805959928211616539', 'Zapped', 2014, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Family', 'Peter DeLuise, James Alfred Menard, Catherine Kretz', null, 'Zendaya, Chanelle Peloso, Spencer Boldman, Emilia McCarthy, Adam DiMarco, William Ainscough, Aleks Paunovic, Lucia Walters', null, 'Zoey is a talented dancer whose organized life is rudely disrupted when she moves in with her new step-dad and three step-brothers, until she discovers a dog-training app that can get boys to obey her every command. But she soon learns that it isn''t the cure-all she had hoped for.', 'Zoey is a talented dancer whose organized life is rudely disrupted when she moves in with her new step-dad and three step-brothers, until she discovers a dog-training app that can get boys to obey her every command. But she soon learns that it isn''t the cure-all she had hoped for.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/u33QFfbvChD5LNcuZD0LsSVnoa1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:278774'),
  ('196131875355711176', 'Zapped Again!', 1990, 'Comedy', 'Doug Campbell, Tom Grubbs, Steve Love', null, 'Todd Eric Andrews, Kelli Williams, Reed Rudy, Maria McCann, David Donah, Ira Heiden, Rossie Harris, Linda Larkin', 'R', 'A new kid moves into school, making enemies with the affluent societies and joining the beleaguered Science Club. But when an old potion is discovered to confer telekinetic power he gets the chance to get his own back, as well as having a bit of fun on the side.', 'A new kid moves into school, making enemies with the affluent societies and joining the beleaguered Science Club. But when an old potion is discovered to confer telekinetic power he gets the chance to get his own back, as well as having a bit of fun on the side.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jjAR8ZLn6E83XmyXz3zCa2j0xeK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54768'),
  ('1014210189451192877', 'Zapped!', 1982, 'Comedy', 'Robert J. Rosenthal, Daniel Pearl, Frank Capra III', 'Robert J. Rosenthal, Bruce Rubin', 'Scott Baio, Willie Aames, Robert Mandan, Felice Schachter, Scatman Crothers, Roger Bowen, Mews Small, Greg Bradford', 'R', 'Peyton and Barney are fun loving high school students working on a science project with white mice. When one of the mice begins to move food toward itself with out touching it, Barney finds he has accidently discovered a formula for telekinetic powers. Now, how much trouble can a high school boy who can move things with just his mind get into?', 'Peyton and Barney are fun loving high school students working on a science project with white mice. When one of the mice begins to move food toward itself with out touching it, Barney finds he has accidently discovered a formula for telekinetic powers. Now, how much trouble can a high school boy who can move things with just his mind get into?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gpDRBziCjSoi1vOSTzq9rkCCSuI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:23943'),
  ('299444434997723581', 'Zara Hatke Zara Bachke', 2023, 'Comedy, Drama, Romance', 'Laxman Utekar, Raghavendran Ramadoss', 'Ramiz Ilham Khan, Maitrey Bajpai, Laxman Utekar', 'Vicky Kaushal, Sara Ali Khan, Rakesh Bedi, Sushmita Mukherjee, Neeraj Sood, Kanupriya Pandit, Akash Khurana, Anubha Fatehpuria', null, 'Kapil and Somya fall in love, get married and are happily living in a joint family. However, soon the love fades away and the couple is on the verge of a divorce, but not a real one as a twist awaits the two families.', 'Kapil and Somya fall in love, get married and are happily living in a joint family. However, soon the love fades away and the couple is on the verge of a divorce, but not a real one as a twist awaits the two families.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIziBCZWsDCzFbil4iT9TyUOnhT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:920679'),
  ('190078144759279288', 'Zarafa', 2012, 'Family, Animation', 'Rémi Bezançon, Jean-Christophe Lie, Adeline Bonacchi', 'Alexander Abela, Rémi Bezançon', 'Max Renaudin, Simon Abkarian, Vernon Dobtcheff, Roger Dumas, Ronit Elkabetz, Mohamed Fellag, Déborah François, Thierry Frémont', 'NR', 'Inspired by the true story of the first giraffe to visit France, Zarafa is a sumptuously animated and stirring adventure, and a throwback to a bygone era of hand-drawn animation and epic storytelling set among sweeping CinemaScope vistas of parched desert, wind-swept mountains and open skies. Under the cover of darkness a small boy, Maki, loosens the shackles that bind him and escapes into the desert night. Pursued by slavers across the moon-lit savannah, Maki meets Zarafa, a baby giraffe – and an orphan, just like him – as well as the nomad Hassan, Prince of the Desert. Hassan takes them to Alexandria for an audience with the Pasha of Egypt, who orders him to deliver the exotic animal as a gift to King Charles of France.', 'Inspired by the true story of the first giraffe to visit France, Zarafa is a sumptuously animated and stirring adventure, and a throwback to a bygone era of hand-drawn animation and epic storytelling set among sweeping CinemaScope vistas of parched desert, wind-swept mountains and open skies. Under the cover of darkness a small boy, Maki, loosens the shackles that bind him and escapes into the desert night. Pursued by slavers across the moon-lit savannah, Maki meets Zarafa, a baby giraffe – and an orphan, just like him – as well as the nomad Hassan, Prince of the Desert. Hassan takes them to Alexandria for an audience with the Pasha of Egypt, who orders him to deliver the exotic animal as a gift to King Charles of France.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r2QvKG2gjG2Jv53rMTQcrCoKBj4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:94196'),
  ('320381540000202787', 'Zardoz', 1974, 'Fantasy, Action, Thriller, Science Fiction', 'Geoffrey Unsworth, John Boorman', 'John Boorman', 'Sean Connery, Charlotte Rampling, Sara Kestelman, John Alderton, Sally Anne Newton, Niall Buggy, Bosco Hogan, Jessica Swift', 'R', 'In the far future, a savage trained only to kill finds a way into the community of bored immortals that alone preserves humanity''s achievements.', 'In the far future, a savage trained only to kill finds a way into the community of bored immortals that alone preserves humanity''s achievements.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6qvQhJhvM7wWPB2LjVpivSNraIv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:4923'),
  ('517517631758554308', 'Zatch Bell! 101st Devil', 2004, 'Comedy, Animation, Adventure, Action', 'Junji Shimizu, Hideki Hashimoto, Keisuke Watabe', 'Hiroshi Hashimoto', 'Takahiro Sakurai, Ai Maeda, Akiko Yajima, Toshiyuki Morikawa, Ikue Otani, Rie Kugimiya, Masami Kikuchi, Hiroki Takahashi', null, 'While the battle to determine the next king of the demon realm has often been fraught, the rules were always clear. 100 demon children partnered with 100 humans would challenge each other, using 100 magical books. What none of them knew was that there was a 101st magical book, powerful enough to stop any of the others. Gash and Kiyomaro must begin a journey that will take them into the demon realm to confront the mysteries of Gash''s past. But will they escape in time to help their friends in a battle with a seemingly unstoppable enemy?', 'While the battle to determine the next king of the demon realm has often been fraught, the rules were always clear. 100 demon children partnered with 100 humans would challenge each other, using 100 magical books. What none of them knew was that there was a 101st magical book, powerful enough to stop any of the others. Gash and Kiyomaro must begin a journey that will take them into the demon realm to confront the mysteries of Gash''s past. But will they escape in time to help their friends in a battle with a seemingly unstoppable enemy?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eW250uuZW49GTJ5ZH0e3kNesWSd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:404250'),
  ('843472587365775203', 'Zatch Bell! Attack of Mechavulcan', 2005, 'Animation, Adventure, Action', 'Hidemi Kubo, Takuya Igarashi, Motoi Takahashi', 'Makoto Raiku, Aya Matsui', 'Shigeru Chiba, Takahiro Sakurai, Ikue Otani, Mari Adachi, Tomoko Akiya, Hozumi Goda, Masami Kikuchi, Rie Kugimiya', null, 'As Kiyomaro races to catch the bus to seaside camp, little does he know that Dr. M2, a demonic magic scientist from the future, has sent out a robot to kidnap him. He''s trapped in limbo with the mad magic scientist who wants to be his partner and an army of Vulcan robot lookalikes. Dr. M2 sends a robot to pretend to befriend Gash, keeping him away from Kiyomaro until M2 can abscond with the teen genius to the future. In the end, it comes down to saving the world with a little help from their friends...', 'As Kiyomaro races to catch the bus to seaside camp, little does he know that Dr. M2, a demonic magic scientist from the future, has sent out a robot to kidnap him. He''s trapped in limbo with the mad magic scientist who wants to be his partner and an army of Vulcan robot lookalikes. Dr. M2 sends a robot to pretend to befriend Gash, keeping him away from Kiyomaro until M2 can abscond with the teen genius to the future. In the end, it comes down to saving the world with a little help from their friends...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5crCDxMF062JPxc3aT0gn323QuP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:125565'),
  ('28375173138073174', 'Zathura: A Space Adventure', 2005, 'Science Fiction, Adventure, Family', 'Jon Favreau, Guillermo Navarro, Conte Mark Matal', 'David Koepp, John Kamps', 'Josh Hutcherson, Jonah Bobo, Dax Shepard, Kristen Stewart, Tim Robbins, Frank Oz, John Alexander, Derek Mears', 'PG', 'After their father is called into work, two young boys, Walter and Danny, are left in the care of their teenage sister, Lisa, and told they must stay inside. Walter and Danny, who anticipate a boring day, are shocked when they begin playing Zathura, a space-themed board game, which they realize has mystical powers when their house is shot into space. With the help of an astronaut, the boys attempt to return home.', 'After their father is called into work, two young boys, Walter and Danny, are left in the care of their teenage sister, Lisa, and told they must stay inside. Walter and Danny, who anticipate a boring day, are shocked when they begin playing Zathura, a space-themed board game, which they realize has mystical powers when their house is shot into space. With the help of an astronaut, the boys attempt to return home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gDb5BW2NLqZ9cvg9nyzkZVvmgze.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:6795'),
  ('849397028728641342', 'Zatoichi', 2003, 'Adventure, Drama, Action', 'Takeshi Kitano, Katsumi Yanagijima', 'Takeshi Kitano', 'Takeshi Kitano, Tadanobu Asano, Michiyo Yasuda, Yui Natsukawa, Guadalcanal Taka, Daigorô Tachibana, Yuko Daike, Ittoku Kishibe', 'R', 'Blind traveler Zatoichi is a master swordsman and a masseur with a fondness for gambling on dice games. When he arrives in a village torn apart by warring gangs, he sets out to protect the townspeople.', 'Blind traveler Zatoichi is a master swordsman and a masseur with a fondness for gambling on dice games. When he arrives in a village torn apart by warring gangs, he sets out to protect the townspeople.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iCIycswWbX1EDS6PYYBcR9ohrC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:246'),
  ('893124999944033413', 'Zatoichi and the Chess Expert', 1965, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Kenji Misumi, Chikashi Makiura', 'Daisuke Itō', 'Shintarō Katsu, Mikio Narita, Kaneko Iwasaki, Gaku Yamamoto, Saburo Date, Tatsuo Endō, Takuya Fujioka, Ryo Horikawa', null, 'Zatoichi makes friends with a dangerous chess player, while fending off angry yakuza and bloodthirsty relatives out for revenge, and trying to save a sick child. Meanwhile, his luck with dice is turning.', 'Zatoichi makes friends with a dangerous chess player, while fending off angry yakuza and bloodthirsty relatives out for revenge, and trying to save a sick child. Meanwhile, his luck with dice is turning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/holeUhFVatGhZmtVzWCNFTVvduZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54275'),
  ('587995454497529906', 'Zatoichi and the Chest of Gold', 1964, 'Action, Drama, Adventure', 'Kazuo Ikehiro, Kazuo Miyagawa', 'Akikazu Ota, Shozaburo Asai', 'Shintarō Katsu, Shōgo Shimada, Mikiko Tsubouchi, Machiko Hasegawa, Tomisaburō Wakayama, Tatsuya Ishiguro, Matasaburô Niwa, Hikosaburo Kataoka', null, 'Ichi travels to the village of Itakura to pay his respects at the grave of Kichizo, a man he killed two years ago. When some tax money is stolen while in transit to the governor he is accused and sets out to find the money and clear his name.', 'Ichi travels to the village of Itakura to pay his respects at the grave of Kichizo, a man he killed two years ago. When some tax money is stolen while in transit to the governor he is accused and sets out to find the money and clear his name.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y4tvdvgJjZwXVpeCpqZS0siic24.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40897'),
  ('304675412397240688', 'Zatoichi and the Doomed Man', 1965, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Kazuo Mori, Hiroshi Imai', 'Shozaburo Asai', 'Shintarō Katsu, Kanbi Fujiyama, Eiko Taki, Kenjirō Ishiyama, Yukio Horikita, Hajime Koshikawa, Sachiko Murase, Tokio Oki', null, 'Blind swordsman Zatoichi, jailed briefly, is implored by another prisoner to aid him in proving his innocence of a crime for which he is sentenced to death. Zatoichi is reluctant to get involved, because he knows how often such involvement has led to trouble in the past. But events conspire to thrust him repeatedly into involvement, and gradually he comes to believe in the man''s innocence and determines to free him.', 'Blind swordsman Zatoichi, jailed briefly, is implored by another prisoner to aid him in proving his innocence of a crime for which he is sentenced to death. Zatoichi is reluctant to get involved, because he knows how often such involvement has led to trouble in the past. But events conspire to thrust him repeatedly into involvement, and gradually he comes to believe in the man''s innocence and determines to free him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7LNLv8ZICzdtpOrOko3sXhWicl3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54274'),
  ('1066753518448198210', 'Zatoichi and the Fugitives', 1968, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Kimiyoshi Yasuda, Kazuo Miyagawa', 'Kinya Naoi', 'Shintarō Katsu, Kyōsuke Machida, Takashi Shimura, Jōtarō Senba, Hōsei Komatsu, Shōzō Nanbu, Yukio Horikita, Seishiro Hara', null, 'Zatoichi runs afoul of some evil fugitives, working for a corrupt law official.', 'Zatoichi runs afoul of some evil fugitives, working for a corrupt law official.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m299HKMbzNPWt26Lud8S84sXs6c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54280'),
  ('1121823992038154058', 'Zatoichi at Large', 1972, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Kazuo Mori, Fujio Morita', 'Kinya Naoi', 'Shintarō Katsu, Rentaro Mikuni, Hisaya Morishige, Etsushi Takahashi, Naoko Ohtani, Osamu Sakai, Renji Ishibashi, Katsutoshi Akiyama', null, 'Blind masseur and master swordsman Zatoichi finds a robbed and fatally wounded pregnant woman, whose baby he delivers before she dies. He takes the baby in search of its father and finds the child''s aunt, who is about to be forced into prostitution for want of a payment the dead mother was bringing. Zatoichi determines to save the woman from her cruel fate.', 'Blind masseur and master swordsman Zatoichi finds a robbed and fatally wounded pregnant woman, whose baby he delivers before she dies. He takes the baby in search of its father and finds the child''s aunt, who is about to be forced into prostitution for want of a payment the dead mother was bringing. Zatoichi determines to save the woman from her cruel fate.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lYcRZLdV3oeIZkeihbagW1pdi8W.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54284'),
  ('476114014069974973', 'Zatoichi Goes to the Fire Festival', 1970, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Kenji Misumi, Kazuo Miyagawa, Toshiaki Kunihara', 'Yamada Takayuki, Shintarō Katsu', 'Shintarō Katsu, Tatsuya Nakadai, Reiko Ōhara, Masayuki Mori, Shinnosuke Ikehata, Kazuko Yoshiyuki, Kō Nishimura, Ryūnosuke Kaneda', null, 'The blind masseuse is targeted by the leader of a powerful yakuza group while also fending off a jealous husband bent on revenge. Zatoichi tours Edo''s underground via a rousing onsen fight scene, gambling houses and the gender-bending character of Umeji, before a final, flame-filled conflagration.', 'The blind masseuse is targeted by the leader of a powerful yakuza group while also fending off a jealous husband bent on revenge. Zatoichi tours Edo''s underground via a rousing onsen fight scene, gambling houses and the gender-bending character of Umeji, before a final, flame-filled conflagration.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pJ8LQ4AwC64M5KljSVxR7qwHYSE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54283'),
  ('75997471058298579', 'Zatoichi in Desperation', 1972, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Shintarō Katsu, Fujio Morita', 'Minoru Inuzuka', 'Shintarō Katsu, Kiwako Taichi, Katsuo Nakamura, Asao Koike, Kyoko Yoshizawa, Yasuhiro Koume, Joji Takagi, Masumi Harukawa', null, 'After accidentally causing the death of an old lady, Zatoichi tries to do right by buying the lady’s daughter’s freedom from a brothel - but this causes more problems than solves them.', 'After accidentally causing the death of an old lady, Zatoichi tries to do right by buying the lady’s daughter’s freedom from a brothel - but this causes more problems than solves them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/51GZ78cpBfsJ9jQ3utDkWVgTM5p.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54306'),
  ('928270734840388291', 'Zatoichi Meets the One-Armed Swordsman', 1971, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Kimiyoshi Yasuda, Hsu Tseng-Hung, Akikazu Ota', 'Yamada Takayuki, Kimiyoshi Yasuda', 'Shintarō Katsu, Jimmy Wang Yu, Yuko Hama, Michie Terada, Kōji Nanbara, Tōru Abe, Shinsuke Minami, Goro Kumon', null, 'Zatoichi is a blind massage therapist and swordsman who finds out that something troubling is taking place on the outskirts of town. After discovering who the guilty parties are -- an accomplished Chinese martial artist named Wang Kang and his youthful attendant -- Zatoichi finds them and discovers that the pair''s mixed up with a dangerous bunch of terrorist samurai who murdered the boy''s parents. Now, Zatoichi must step in to save the day.', 'Zatoichi is a blind massage therapist and swordsman who finds out that something troubling is taking place on the outskirts of town. After discovering who the guilty parties are -- an accomplished Chinese martial artist named Wang Kang and his youthful attendant -- Zatoichi finds them and discovers that the pair''s mixed up with a dangerous bunch of terrorist samurai who murdered the boy''s parents. Now, Zatoichi must step in to save the day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gtormJtTP126NjdWgH8nRUWXvuU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24444'),
  ('1090966309768513593', 'Zatoichi Meets Yojimbo', 1970, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Kihachi Okamoto, Kazuo Miyagawa', 'Kihachi Okamoto, Tetsurō Yoshida', 'Shintarō Katsu, Toshirō Mifune, Ayako Wakao, Osamu Takizawa, Masakane Yonekura, Shin Kishida, Kanjūrō Arashi, Toshiyuki Hosokawa', null, 'Zatoichi treks to a village that has always been a favorite spot of his, only to discover that it’s become a living hell, plagued by feuding father and son yakuza as well as the younger crime boss’s bodyguard, scruffy, smart-mouthed, cash-hungry Yojimbo of legend.', 'Zatoichi treks to a village that has always been a favorite spot of his, only to discover that it’s become a living hell, plagued by feuding father and son yakuza as well as the younger crime boss’s bodyguard, scruffy, smart-mouthed, cash-hungry Yojimbo of legend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/faY48OfU3M32JXWUNz8doaG3Cd4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42601'),
  ('860633156556959381', 'Zatoichi on the Road', 1963, 'Adventure, Action, Drama, History', 'Kimiyoshi Yasuda, Shozo Honda', 'Minoru Inuzuka', 'Shintarō Katsu, Shiho Fujimura, Ryūzō Shimada, Reiko Fujiwara, Matasaburô Niwa, Yoshio Yoshida, Sonosuke Sawamura, Shōsaku Sugiyama', null, 'Zatoichi is sworn to protect the life of a young girl and without any real allies finds himself in the middle of a bloody turf war.', 'Zatoichi is sworn to protect the life of a young girl and without any real allies finds himself in the middle of a bloody turf war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vF5RtmhcD1mdgYIAf9CJuCt6AN8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18624'),
  ('194481491171375197', 'Zatoichi the Fugitive', 1963, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Tokuzō Tanaka, Chikashi Makiura', 'Seiji Hoshikawa', 'Shintarō Katsu, Miwa Takada, Masayo Banri, Katsuhiko Kobayashi, Jun''ichirō Narita, Tōru Abe, San''emon Arashi, Yūji Hamada', null, 'After arriving in the town of Shimonita, Ichi finds that a price has been put on his head by a local yakuza boss. He''s drawn into a trap, but after hearing of the slaying of a former love, Ichi furiously fights his way through the entire clan to face the killer, a hired ronin.', 'After arriving in the town of Shimonita, Ichi finds that a price has been put on his head by a local yakuza boss. He''s drawn into a trap, but after hearing of the slaying of a former love, Ichi furiously fights his way through the entire clan to face the killer, a hired ronin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/giR1dC7hRfpps1M2TSGs1eR1F1Z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18511'),
  ('423780981389158924', 'Zatoichi the Outlaw', 1967, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Satsuo Yamamoto, Kazuo Miyagawa', 'Takehiro Nakajima, Koji Matsumoto, Kiyokata Saruwaka', 'Shintarō Katsu, Rentaro Mikuni, Kō Nishimura, Yūko Hamada, Toshiyuki Hosokawa, Takuya Fujioka, Kenjirō Ishiyama, Mizuho Suzuki', null, 'When a local gambling house kidnaps some peasants because they failed to pay their debts, a rival gambling house pays their debts and sets them free.', 'When a local gambling house kidnaps some peasants because they failed to pay their debts, a rival gambling house pays their debts and sets them free.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ujszCOunFyY9OjYDRB5SaI2ZQyF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54278'),
  ('1010380525416087162', 'Zatoichi: Darkness Is His Ally', 1989, 'Action, Drama, Adventure', 'Shintarō Katsu, Mutsuo Naganuma', 'Shintarō Katsu, Tatsumi Ichiyama, Tsutomu Nakamura', 'Shintarō Katsu, Kanako Higuchi, Takanori Jinnai, Ryûtarô Gan, Yuya Uchida, Toyomi Kusano, Tsurutaro Kataoka, Miho Nakayama', null, 'Older, wiser but still a wandering loner, the blind, peace-loving masseur Ichi seeks a peaceful life in a rural village. When he''s caught in the middle of a power struggle between two rival Yakuza clans, his reputation as a deadly defender of the innocent is put to the ultimate test in a series of sword-slashing showdowns.', 'Older, wiser but still a wandering loner, the blind, peace-loving masseur Ichi seeks a peaceful life in a rural village. When he''s caught in the middle of a power struggle between two rival Yakuza clans, his reputation as a deadly defender of the innocent is put to the ultimate test in a series of sword-slashing showdowns.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uLpWIKg5DdLNan1o2u6gvQ6KIVe.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:40644'),
  ('733075940887635221', 'Zatoichi: The Last', 2010, 'Action, Drama', 'Junji Sakamoto, Norimichi Kasamatsu', 'Kikumi Yamagishi', 'Shingo Katori, Satomi Ishihara, Takashi Sorimachi, Chieko Baisho, Yoshio Harada, Arata Iura, Koichi Iwaki, Seishirou Katou', null, 'A blind master swordsman attempts to lead a quiet life with his wife but he is provoked back into battle.', 'A blind master swordsman attempts to lead a quiet life with his wife but he is provoked back into battle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/znEujnsZJPauN1VEaJIFYQcC4ns.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55894'),
  ('746437820909926115', 'Zatoichi''s Cane Sword', 1967, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Kimiyoshi Yasuda, Senkichirō Takeda', 'Ryōzō Kasahara', 'Shintarō Katsu, Shiho Fujimura, Yoshihiko Aoyama, Makoto Fujita, Kiyoko Suizenji, Eijirō Tōno, Masumi Harukawa, Masako Akeboshi', null, 'Zatoichi comes upon the town of Tonda, overrun by gangsters. Using one of his favorite techniques, Zatoichi proceeds to win 8 ryo in a rigged gambling game. Of course, the local gangsters attempt to kill him, and the adventure begins. It turns out a blacksmith named Senzo examines Zatoichi''s cane sword, and discovers it to be forged by his old mentor. Senzo discovers the sword is at the end of its usefulness and will break when it is used next.', 'Zatoichi comes upon the town of Tonda, overrun by gangsters. Using one of his favorite techniques, Zatoichi proceeds to win 8 ryo in a rigged gambling game. Of course, the local gangsters attempt to kill him, and the adventure begins. It turns out a blacksmith named Senzo examines Zatoichi''s cane sword, and discovers it to be forged by his old mentor. Senzo discovers the sword is at the end of its usefulness and will break when it is used next.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2UUr2KXLuC7UcLCwMN5QX6izVhb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54277'),
  ('1123678173044328146', 'Zatoichi''s Conspiracy', 1973, 'Action, Drama, Adventure', 'Kimiyoshi Yasuda, Chikashi Makiura, Masao Kobayashi', 'Kei Hattori', 'Shintarō Katsu, Yukiyo Toake, Takashi Shimura, Eiji Okada, Kei Satō, Yoshio Tsuchiya, Rie Yokoyama, Tatsuo Endō', null, 'Zatoichi, the famed blind swordsman, returns to his home village for the first time in many years. He is befriended by Omiyo, who had the same wet-nurse as Zatoichi. He also encounters a boyhood friend, Shinbei, who is now wealthy and appears not to remember Zatoichi. Shinbei seems to be interested in repaying the villagers'' debts, but is, in reality, manipulating the ownership of a now valuable rock quarry. Zatoichi learns of the subterfuge and confronts his old friend, who has a score of yakuza swordsmen backing his play.', 'Zatoichi, the famed blind swordsman, returns to his home village for the first time in many years. He is befriended by Omiyo, who had the same wet-nurse as Zatoichi. He also encounters a boyhood friend, Shinbei, who is now wealthy and appears not to remember Zatoichi. Shinbei seems to be interested in repaying the villagers'' debts, but is, in reality, manipulating the ownership of a now valuable rock quarry. Zatoichi learns of the subterfuge and confronts his old friend, who has a score of yakuza swordsmen backing his play.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kJxvpauRjOfHUjQCJIPeQ360J7r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54307'),
  ('1132762685201220456', 'Zatoichi''s Flashing Sword', 1964, 'Action, Drama, Adventure', 'Kazuo Ikehiro, Yasukazu Takemura', 'Shozaburo Asai, Minoru Inuzuka', 'Shintarō Katsu, Tatsuo Endō, Bokuzen Hidari, Ryōsuke Kagawa, Naoko Kubo, Mayumi Nagisa, Takashi Etajima, Ryūtarō Gomi', null, 'Blind masseur Zatoichi is nursed back to health by a young woman after he is shot by a gang member. Zatoichi, who had come to the village to repay a debt, now feels further indebted. He commits himself to use his amazing sword skills to help the young woman''s father, whose river-crossing service is under attack by the same gang responsible for Zatoichi''s wounds.', 'Blind masseur Zatoichi is nursed back to health by a young woman after he is shot by a gang member. Zatoichi, who had come to the village to repay a debt, now feels further indebted. He commits himself to use his amazing sword skills to help the young woman''s father, whose river-crossing service is under attack by the same gang responsible for Zatoichi''s wounds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q7M70mfiADpTBVz1JuKWR4NCXMK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54265'),
  ('340526751237988997', 'Zatoichi''s Pilgrimage', 1966, 'Drama, Action, Adventure', 'Kazuo Ikehiro, Senkichirō Takeda', 'Kaneto Shindō', 'Shintarō Katsu, Michiyo Yasuda, Kunie Tanaka, Hisashi Igawa, Masao Mishima, Jōtarō Senba, Ryūtarō Gomi, Isao Yamagata', null, 'Zatoichi''s trek through 88 temples to atone for his violent past is interrupted as he stumbles into a village terrorized by a violent yakuza boss.', 'Zatoichi''s trek through 88 temples to atone for his violent past is interrupted as he stumbles into a village terrorized by a violent yakuza boss.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rJe6eUmPSvdhgjil5JeGA0YVhQF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54276'),
  ('1029135741396055733', 'Zatoichi''s Revenge', 1965, 'Adventure, Action, Drama', 'Akira Inoue, Fujio Morita', 'Minoru Inuzuka', 'Shintarō Katsu, Norihei Miki, Mikiko Tsubouchi, Takeshi Katō, Fujio Harumoto, San''emon Arashi, Saburo Date, Jun Katsumura', null, 'Itinerant masseur and master swordsman, the blind Zatoichi, is near the village of his teacher, Hikonoichi, so he decides to visit. He learns of Hikonoichi''s recent robbery and murder and the imprisonment of his virginal daughter, Osayo, in a brothel. Through friendship with Denroku, a local dice thrower and devoted father, Ichi uncovers an unholy alliance between the governor and the area strongman: among their scams is falsifying tax records to put farmers in debt, then forcing their daughters into prostitution at the boss''s brothel. With help from Denroku''s daughter, Otsuru, Ichi comforts Osayo until he can provoke showdowns with the villains and their henchmen.', 'Itinerant masseur and master swordsman, the blind Zatoichi, is near the village of his teacher, Hikonoichi, so he decides to visit. He learns of Hikonoichi''s recent robbery and murder and the imprisonment of his virginal daughter, Osayo, in a brothel. Through friendship with Denroku, a local dice thrower and devoted father, Ichi uncovers an unholy alliance between the governor and the area strongman: among their scams is falsifying tax records to put farmers in debt, then forcing their daughters into prostitution at the boss''s brothel. With help from Denroku''s daughter, Otsuru, Ichi comforts Osayo until he can provoke showdowns with the villains and their henchmen.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/94LUhdkHPMjCfaqQuPrwGzmKUAK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54273'),
  ('886303043991550861', 'Zatoichi''s Vengeance', 1966, 'Action, Drama, Adventure', 'Tokuzō Tanaka, Kazuo Miyagawa', 'Hajime Takaiwa', 'Shintarō Katsu, Shigeru Amachi, Jun Hamamura, Gen Kimura, Kanae Kobayashi, Kōichi Mizuhara, Mayumi Ogawa, Kei Satō', null, 'Zatoichi comes upon a dying man who asks him to give a bag of money to "Taichi". Zatoichi has no idea who this is but when he comes upon a small town harassed by gangsters, he finds that "Taichi" was the man''s young son. Along his travels he also met a blind monk who makes Zatoichi question his murderous lifestyle. In trying to help the town, Zatoichi kills some gangsters and becomes a hero to the boy. He must make a choice of whether to use non-violence and set a good example, or violence and set the boy on the wrong path in life.', 'Zatoichi comes upon a dying man who asks him to give a bag of money to "Taichi". Zatoichi has no idea who this is but when he comes upon a small town harassed by gangsters, he finds that "Taichi" was the man''s young son. Along his travels he also met a blind monk who makes Zatoichi question his murderous lifestyle. In trying to help the town, Zatoichi kills some gangsters and becomes a hero to the boy. He must make a choice of whether to use non-violence and set a good example, or violence and set the boy on the wrong path in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9OkByHoDn8dqGUXfQlgEMSaEJaA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21410'),
  ('295258177911454196', 'Zaza', 1923, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Allan Dwan, Harold Rosson', 'Albert S. Le Vino', 'Gloria Swanson, H.B. Warner, Ferdinand Gottschalk, Lucille La Verne, Mary Thurman, Yvonne Hughes, Riley Hatch, L. Rogers Lytton', 'NR', 'Zaza is an actress and the favorite at an open-air theater in a small French town. When diplomat Bernard Dufresne comes to the village, he stays away for fear he will fall for her. But during one performance, while Zaza is singing on a swing, her rival cuts the rope and she falls. Zaza is badly injured and she makes Dufresne''s acquaintance. A romance quickly springs up and he installs her in a villa. Their happiness is marred, however, when his wife appears.', 'Zaza is an actress and the favorite at an open-air theater in a small French town. When diplomat Bernard Dufresne comes to the village, he stays away for fear he will fall for her. But during one performance, while Zaza is singing on a swing, her rival cuts the rope and she falls. Zaza is badly injured and she makes Dufresne''s acquaintance. A romance quickly springs up and he installs her in a villa. Their happiness is marred, however, when his wife appears.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jTAwURCzTx6xhMZfqL43XKXn37B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:200923'),
  ('1000519040519727222', 'Zazie dans le Métro', 1960, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'Louis Malle, Henri Raichi, Philippe Collin', 'Louis Malle, Jean-Paul Rappeneau', 'Catherine Demongeot, Philippe Noiret, Hubert Deschamps, Carla Marlier, Annie Fratellini, Vittorio Caprioli, Yvonne Clech, Odette Piquet', null, 'A brash and precocious ten-year-old comes to Paris for a whirlwind weekend with her rakish uncle.', 'A brash and precocious ten-year-old comes to Paris for a whirlwind weekend with her rakish uncle.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hl0loQ9fci2PMdRFuZIYoHTP8x8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:2546'),
  ('829762445490445964', 'Ze Film', 2005, 'Comedy', 'Guy Jacques, Jean Poisson', 'Constantine Attia, Guy Jacques, Emmanuel List', 'Clément Sibony, Dan Herzberg, Micky El Mazroui, Predrag ''Miki'' Manojlović, Lorànt Deutsch, Karina Testa, Adel Bencherif, Samir Guesmi', null, 'A poor kid nicknamed Kubrick loves movies and dreams about being an award winning director. One day, he stumbles upon a movie shoot, gets confused with a real movie maker and takes the equipment he needs to shoot his movie.', 'A poor kid nicknamed Kubrick loves movies and dreams about being an award winning director. One day, he stumbles upon a movie shoot, gets confused with a real movie maker and takes the equipment he needs to shoot his movie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/89KxarYSgCEe4O4uAG0PmdEydRS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13749'),
  ('955549740497275019', 'Zebra Lounge', 2001, 'Thriller', 'Kari Skogland, Barry Parrell, Effy Papadopoulos', 'Monte Montgomery, Claire Montgomery', 'Kristy Swanson, Stephen Baldwin, Brandy Ledford, Cameron Daddo, Dara Perlmutter, Daniel Magder, Vince Corazza, Brian Paul', 'R', 'Alan and Wendy Barnet have been married just long enough for the excitement to have gone out of their relationship, and they''re looking for a way to put some spice back in their lives. After placing a personal ad looking for another couple interested in swapping mates, the Barnets are led to the Zebra Lounge, where they meet Jack and Louise Bauer, a pair of seasoned erotic adventurers. While the Barnets find the swinging scene exciting at first, they soon decide it may be doing more harm than good to their marriage. But easing the Bauers out of their lives proves to be neither simple nor safe.', 'Alan and Wendy Barnet have been married just long enough for the excitement to have gone out of their relationship, and they''re looking for a way to put some spice back in their lives. After placing a personal ad looking for another couple interested in swapping mates, the Barnets are led to the Zebra Lounge, where they meet Jack and Louise Bauer, a pair of seasoned erotic adventurers. While the Barnets find the swinging scene exciting at first, they soon decide it may be doing more harm than good to their marriage. But easing the Bauers out of their lives proves to be neither simple nor safe.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hyej1bAJkY39O1tVIYdjLM6nfl6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:59940'),
  ('810513694791070279', 'Zebra Stripes', 2014, 'Comedy', 'Benoît Mariage, Benoît Dervaux', 'Benoît Mariage', 'Benoît Poelvoorde, Marc Zinga, Tatiana Rojo, Tom Audenaert, Eric Larcin, Sibiri Tiémogo, Alice Hermance Gbongo, Franck Diabagaté', null, 'José is a football agent who goes to Ivory Coast to spot young talents in football. He is a braggart , who willingly sleeps with Gigi , a beautiful African woman who loves the luxury he offers her... One day, José spots Yaya, a street boy with the potential of a champion, and brings him to Belgium. Will Yaya be José''s reward? Between the poor neighborhoods of Abidjan and Sporting Club of Charleroi, the cultural "gap" is brutal... and reserves surprises.', 'José is a football agent who goes to Ivory Coast to spot young talents in football. He is a braggart , who willingly sleeps with Gigi , a beautiful African woman who loves the luxury he offers her... One day, José spots Yaya, a street boy with the potential of a champion, and brings him to Belgium. Will Yaya be José''s reward? Between the poor neighborhoods of Abidjan and Sporting Club of Charleroi, the cultural "gap" is brutal... and reserves surprises.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAIT1neDejiOAb276mOWz2KwPp3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:249147'),
  ('16202923612010959', 'Zebrahead', 1992, 'Drama, Romance', 'Anthony Drazan, Maryse Alberti', 'Anthony Drazan', 'Michael Rapaport, Kevin Corrigan, N''Bushe Wright, Lois Bendler, Dan Ziskie, DeShonn Castle, Marsha Florence, Jon Seda', 'R', 'A white, hip-hop loving teen falls in love with a black girl in Detroit.', 'A white, hip-hop loving teen falls in love with a black girl in Detroit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yM5faEnpRmYHGyMerTY1GZUErUy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:70489'),
  ('931684816649722856', 'Zebraman', 2004, 'Comedy, Action', 'Takashi Miike, Kazushige Tanaka, Kaori Ohtagaki', 'Kankuro Kudo', 'Show Aikawa, Kyoka Suzuki, Atsuro Watabe, Yui Ichikawa, Koen Kondo, Ren Osugi, Makiko Watanabe, Kumiko Aso', null, 'A down-and-out schoolteacher receives the calling to become the real life personification of an old television superhero, Zebraman.', 'A down-and-out schoolteacher receives the calling to become the real life personification of an old television superhero, Zebraman.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3kBangW2OBBNkqYyp48blW9cwE5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36223'),
  ('1123582296632063069', 'Zebraman 2: Attack on Zebra City', 2010, 'Action, Comedy, Music', 'Takashi Miike, Kazushige Tanaka', 'Kankuro Kudo', 'Show Aikawa, Riisa Naka, Guadalcanal Taka, Tsuyoshi Abe, Masahiro Inoue, Mei Nagano, Hideo Nakano, Mame Yamada', null, 'A post-apocalyptic humankind in 2025 finds a hero in the form of Zebraman. But the Zebra Queen steals his powers, making him lose his ability to survive Zebra Time. But he wants his powers back.', 'A post-apocalyptic humankind in 2025 finds a hero in the form of Zebraman. But the Zebra Queen steals his powers, making him lose his ability to survive Zebra Time. But he wants his powers back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zcHELtCxu7wGMy4oeIq1uxvQYuT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49608'),
  ('996470050427534724', 'Zee and Co.', 1972, 'Drama', 'Brian G. Hutton, Colin M. Brewer, Billy Williams', 'Edna O''Brien', 'Elizabeth Taylor, Michael Caine, Susannah York, Margaret Leighton, John Standing, Mary Larkin, Michael Cashman, Gino Melvazzi', 'R', 'The venomous and amoral wife of a wealthy architect tries, any way she can, to break up the blossoming romance between her husband and his new mistress; a good-natured young widow who holds a dark past.', 'The venomous and amoral wife of a wealthy architect tries, any way she can, to break up the blossoming romance between her husband and his new mistress; a good-natured young widow who holds a dark past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9jh2dEmg5n9xOKDRjaeq3pvhxJU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:120653'),
  ('218551083108053667', 'Zegen', 1987, 'Comedy, History', 'Shōhei Imamura, Takashi Miike, Masao Tochizawa', 'Kôta Okabe, Shōhei Imamura', 'Ken Ogata, Mitsuko Baisho, Ko Chun-Hsiung, Norihei Miki, Hiroyuki Konishi, Sanshō Shinsui, Tetta Sugimoto, Taiji Tonoyama', null, 'At the time between the World Wars, Japan is involved in empire-building throughout East and Southeast Asia. After a brief career as a low-level military adventurer, Iheiji sets up chains of brothels throughout Asia. As Japan''s power in the region grows, so does Iheiji''s prosperity and patriotism.', 'At the time between the World Wars, Japan is involved in empire-building throughout East and Southeast Asia. After a brief career as a low-level military adventurer, Iheiji sets up chains of brothels throughout Asia. As Japan''s power in the region grows, so does Iheiji''s prosperity and patriotism.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/WpU1FinnFSEuXyPv6AV74N0Ula.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:198458'),
  ('443751590710495979', 'Zeher', 2005, 'Thriller', 'Mohit Suri, Fuwad Khan', 'Mahesh Bhatt', 'Emraan Hashmi, Shamita Shetty, Udita Goswami, Sameer Kochhar, Ninad Kamat, Vishwajeet Pradhan', null, 'Siddharth and Sonia are happily married until Anna walks into Siddharth''s life. Things go from bad to worse, when Anna gets killed and Siddharth finds himself sinking in troubled waters.', 'Siddharth and Sonia are happily married until Anna walks into Siddharth''s life. Things go from bad to worse, when Anna gets killed and Siddharth finds himself sinking in troubled waters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ch9QmFsEmCKDvEWrDDY0jYCB8WM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:69346'),
  ('708612236630981146', 'Zehir Hafiye', 1989, 'Adventure, Comedy, Crime', 'Orhan Aksoy', 'Osman F. Seden, Orhan Aksoy', 'Kemal Sunal, Şemsi İnkaya, Mehmet Ali Akpınar, Turgut Özatay, Zafer Atlı, Nur Gürkan, Leman Çıdamlı, Leyla Çetinok', null, 'The story of a young man who loves crime fiction books, and the daugher of a mafia leader.', 'The story of a young man who loves crime fiction books, and the daugher of a mafia leader.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/eSitZfhBSkLX9tHZiP1ZCTBu7R6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157738'),
  ('247134254158315348', 'Zëiram', 1991, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Keita Amemiya, Hiroshi Kidokoro, Tamotsu Shinohara', 'Keita Amemiya, Hajime Matsumoto', 'Yûko Moriyama, Kunihiko Ida, Yukijiro Hotaru, Masakazu Handa, Mizuho Yoshida, Yukitomo Tochino, Riko Kurenai, Naomi Enami', null, 'Teppei and Kamiya, two average joes working in the electronic services industry, stumble upon the intergalactic bounty-hunter Ilia, and her partner, the artificial intelligence named Bob. Both men are accidentally transported to the Zone, a virtual reality in which Bob has trapped Ilia''s latest prey, a biological weapon named Zeram. The Earth natives must both survive the experience and help Ilia capture Zeram before the Zone disappears around them.', 'Teppei and Kamiya, two average joes working in the electronic services industry, stumble upon the intergalactic bounty-hunter Ilia, and her partner, the artificial intelligence named Bob. Both men are accidentally transported to the Zone, a virtual reality in which Bob has trapped Ilia''s latest prey, a biological weapon named Zeram. The Earth natives must both survive the experience and help Ilia capture Zeram before the Zone disappears around them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4mIQKfbmKe8E5XIg15Obwmox8ZV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27302'),
  ('7328903117730242', 'Zëiram 2', 1994, 'Action, Science Fiction, Horror', 'Keita Amemiya, Tamotsu Shinohara, Hiroshi Kidokoro', 'Hajime Matsumoto, Keita Amemiya', 'Yûko Moriyama, Kazuhiko Inoue, Mizuho Yoshida, SABU, Kunihiko Ida, Yukijiro Hotaru, Mitsuo Abe, Shuta Hiromoto', null, 'Intergalactic bounty hunters Iria and Bob return to track down an ancient mystical relic. When a second Zeiram unit shows up and goes berserk, it takes all of Iria''s resources to survive a deadly game of cat-and-mouse with the fearsome space creature.', 'Intergalactic bounty hunters Iria and Bob return to track down an ancient mystical relic. When a second Zeiram unit shows up and goes berserk, it takes all of Iria''s resources to survive a deadly game of cat-and-mouse with the fearsome space creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yPUlS9EYfNlVgwSKX1RQAnfsGOO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62877'),
  ('12970957268434729', 'Zeitgeist: Addendum', 2008, 'Documentary, History, War', 'Peter Joseph', null, 'Jacque Fresco, Roxanne Meadows, John Perkins, George Carlin, Jiddu Krishnamurti, Ron Paul', null, 'Zeitgeist: Addendum premiered at the 5th Annual Artivist Film Festival. Director Peter Joseph stated: "The failure of our world to resolve the issues of war, poverty, and corruption, rests within a gross ignorance about what guides human behavior to begin with. It address the true source of the instability in our society, while offering the only fundamental, long-term solution."', 'Zeitgeist: Addendum premiered at the 5th Annual Artivist Film Festival. Director Peter Joseph stated: "The failure of our world to resolve the issues of war, poverty, and corruption, rests within a gross ignorance about what guides human behavior to begin with. It address the true source of the instability in our society, while offering the only fundamental, long-term solution."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5zlBxoyWRyzPOHO7QmmAC1WG9bK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13180'),
  ('1122508399055786669', 'Zeitgeist: Moving Forward', 2011, 'Documentary', 'Peter Joseph', 'Peter Joseph', 'Robert Sapolsky, Gabor Maté, Richard G. Wilkinson, James Gilligan, John McMurtry, Michael Ruppert, Max Keiser, Jacque Fresco', null, 'A presentation of a case for a needed transition out of the current socioeconomic monetary paradigm which governs the entire world society. This subject matter will transcend the issues of cultural relativism and traditional ideology and move to relate the core, empirical ''life ground'' attributes of human and social survival, extrapolating those immutable natural laws into a new sustainable social paradigm called a ''Resource-Based Economy''.', 'A presentation of a case for a needed transition out of the current socioeconomic monetary paradigm which governs the entire world society. This subject matter will transcend the issues of cultural relativism and traditional ideology and move to relate the core, empirical ''life ground'' attributes of human and social survival, extrapolating those immutable natural laws into a new sustainable social paradigm called a ''Resource-Based Economy''.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/i4zMQlaVc4NCTj5RQTR4AhppPoC.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54293'),
  ('176378999271335925', 'Zeitgeist: The Movie', 2007, 'Documentary, History', 'Peter Joseph', null, 'Chögyam Trungpa, Jordan Maxwell, George Carlin, Bill Hicks, David Ray Griffin, Joseph Casaliggi', null, 'A documentary examining possible historical and modern conspiracies surrounding Christianity, the 9/11 terrorist attacks, and the Federal Reserve bank.', 'A documentary examining possible historical and modern conspiracies surrounding Christianity, the 9/11 terrorist attacks, and the Federal Reserve bank.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4eJQJ3tvnNO7CdxXT5awnd9ovGX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13016'),
  ('195904709079047503', 'Zejtune', 2026, 'Drama', 'Alex Camilleri, Quentin Devillers, Beppe Abela', 'Alex Camilleri', 'Michela Farrugia, Nenu Borg, Frida Cauchi, Michael Azzopardi, Seán James Sutton', null, 'Mar is ready to leave the tiny island of Malta behind, and her estranged mother''s death gives her the perfect way out: an inheritance of valuable farmland that she can sell. But when greedy relatives contest her claim, Mar''s plans hit a snag. As she fights to secure her future, Mar meets Nenu, a spirited troubadour whose vibrant folk songs, rooted in Malta''s ancient għana tradition, awaken emotions she''s long buried.', 'Mar is ready to leave the tiny island of Malta behind, and her estranged mother''s death gives her the perfect way out: an inheritance of valuable farmland that she can sell. But when greedy relatives contest her claim, Mar''s plans hit a snag. As she fights to secure her future, Mar meets Nenu, a spirited troubadour whose vibrant folk songs, rooted in Malta''s ancient għana tradition, awaken emotions she''s long buried.', 'https://images.plex.tv/photo?size=large-1280&url=https%3A%2F%2Fimage.tmdb.org%2Ft%2Fp%2Foriginal%2FLocCeo7mZ0PBibKioNjJwPHihb.jpg', 'plex:movie:zejtune'),
  ('906498107924800062', 'Zelary', 2003, 'Drama, Romance', 'Ondřej Trojan, Asen Šopov', 'Petr Jarchovský', 'Anna Geislerová, György Cserhalmi, Jaroslava Adamová, Miroslav Donutil, Jaroslav Dušek, Iva Bittová, Ivan Trojan, Jan Hrušínský', null, 'A nurse and her surgeon-lover are part of a resistance movement in 1940s Czechoslovakia. When they are discovered, her lover flees and she must find a place to hide. A patient whose life she saved, a man from a remote mountain village where time stopped 150 years ago, agrees to hide her as his wife.', 'A nurse and her surgeon-lover are part of a resistance movement in 1940s Czechoslovakia. When they are discovered, her lover flees and she must find a place to hide. A patient whose life she saved, a man from a remote mountain village where time stopped 150 years ago, agrees to hide her as his wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s4jFr3bnf8d5WYCSrf0N3e7G9ez.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19765'),
  ('861132409825396801', 'Zelig', 1983, 'Comedy', 'Gordon Willis, Woody Allen, Duncan Scott', 'Woody Allen', 'Woody Allen, Mia Farrow, Patrick Horgan, John Buckwalter, Marvin Chatinover, Stanley Swerdlow, Paul Nevens, Howard Erskine', 'PG', 'Fictional documentary about the life of human chameleon Leonard Zelig, a man who becomes a celebrity in the 1920s due to his ability to look and act like whoever is around him. Clever editing places Zelig in real newsreel footage of Woodrow Wilson, Babe Ruth, and others.', 'Fictional documentary about the life of human chameleon Leonard Zelig, a man who becomes a celebrity in the 1920s due to his ability to look and act like whoever is around him. Clever editing places Zelig in real newsreel footage of Woodrow Wilson, Babe Ruth, and others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bfs67JaV4B5xVBvtXd3O4R7nk9G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11030'),
  ('1059334893365455006', 'Zelly & Me', 1988, 'Drama', 'Tina Rathborne, Chitra F. Mojtabai, Richard Feury', 'Tina Rathborne', 'Alexandra Johnes, Isabella Rossellini, Glynis Johns, David Lynch, Joe Morton, Kaiulani Lee, Lynn Hallowell, Courtney Vickery', 'PG', 'A young orphan who lives with her grandmother in a large Virginian home infatuates herself with the voices of Joan d''Arc. Her French nanny seeks out the help of a rich suitor to take her and the orphan away when she realizes that the grandmother cannot offer the orphan the love that she needs.', 'A young orphan who lives with her grandmother in a large Virginian home infatuates herself with the voices of Joan d''Arc. Her French nanny seeks out the help of a rich suitor to take her and the orphan away when she realizes that the grandmother cannot offer the orphan the love that she needs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qTgUPEjX7s4PzQdcyzen9logiRL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41976'),
  ('48703340809524707', 'Zen', 2009, 'Drama, History', 'Banmei Takahashi, Noriyuki Mizuguchi', 'Banmei Takahashi', 'Kantarô Nakamura, Yuki Uchida, Ryushin Tei, Kengo Kora, Tatsuya Fujiwara, Jun Murakami, Masanobu Katsumura, Zheng Tianyong', null, 'In the early 1200s, Dogen brought Chinese Zen philosophy to Japan, and established the Japanese Zen school of Buddhism. He taught that a person was capable of realizing Buddhahood within himself, by way of Zazen. Zazen is extended hours of sitting and meditating to achieve a state of “Mu” (nothingness, or empty existence).', 'In the early 1200s, Dogen brought Chinese Zen philosophy to Japan, and established the Japanese Zen school of Buddhism. He taught that a person was capable of realizing Buddhahood within himself, by way of Zazen. Zazen is extended hours of sitting and meditating to achieve a state of “Mu” (nothingness, or empty existence).', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jv9dXTSZSEIUwFV5Wrsov41XKZ4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28632'),
