  ('1152860491064301541', 'Zenne Dancer', 2012, 'Drama', 'Caner Alper, Mehmet Binay', 'Caner Alper', 'Kerem Can, Erkan Avcı, Giovanni Arvaneh, Rüçhan Çalışkur, Tilbe Saran, Ünal Silver, Jale Arıkan, Esme Madra', null, 'German photographer Daniel Bert, who comes to Istanbul to do photo shoots, meets Can, who is a zenne at a nightclub, and Ahmet, who comes from a conservative eastern family.', 'German photographer Daniel Bert, who comes to Istanbul to do photo shoots, meets Can, who is a zenne at a nightclub, and Ahmet, who comes from a conservative eastern family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/14vy9LAXX2eJhjKi9bVgSgteVxg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:84070'),
  ('1032407087713938943', 'Zenobia', 1939, 'Comedy', 'Gordon Douglas, Karl Struss', 'Corey Ford', 'Oliver Hardy, Harry Langdon, Billie Burke, Alice Brady, James Ellison, Jean Parker, June Lang, Olin Howland', 'NR', 'A modest country doctor in the antebellum South has to contend with his daughter''s upcoming marriage and an affectionate medicine show elephant.', 'A modest country doctor in the antebellum South has to contend with his daughter''s upcoming marriage and an affectionate medicine show elephant.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l2RhJb7nwCTMlINFLpm6IkO08Bz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111317'),
  ('797965219293559125', 'Zenon: Girl of the 21st Century', 1999, 'Family, Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Kenneth Johnson, Ron Orieux', 'Stu Krieger', 'Kirsten Storms, Raven-Symoné, Stuart Pankin, Holly Fulger, Frederick Coffin, Bob Bancroft, Gregory Smith, Greg Thirloway', 'G', 'Zenon Kar, a 13-year-old girl who lives on a space station in the year 2049, gets into some trouble and is banished to Earth. With help from some Earth friends she must find her way back.', 'Zenon Kar, a 13-year-old girl who lives on a space station in the year 2049, gets into some trouble and is banished to Earth. With help from some Earth friends she must find her way back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ehahU4rOE2V02PKpgx8Fui3AZNQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34766'),
  ('79996396565957754', 'Zenon: The Zequel', 2001, 'Family, TV Movie, Adventure, Comedy, Science Fiction', 'Manny Coto, George Lyle, Neil James', null, 'Kirsten Storms, Shadia Simmons, Lauren Maltby, Susan Brady, Robert Curtis Brown, Phillip Rhys, Holly Fulger, Stuart Pankin', 'G', 'Zenon Kar is 15 and lives on a space station which the military has taken over and is dismantling. She receives a mysterious signal and must convince everyone that it''s from aliens who have come to help them.', 'Zenon Kar is 15 and lives on a space station which the military has taken over and is dismantling. She receives a mysterious signal and must convince everyone that it''s from aliens who have come to help them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ferJbm4T34YoVzfuSOKeUoI4cOF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:29742'),
  ('407762746538987479', 'Zenon: Z3', 2004, 'Family, TV Movie, Comedy, Adventure, Science Fiction', 'Steve Rash, Dave Aenmey, Jon-Luke Lourens', 'Stu Krieger', 'Kirsten Storms, Lauren Maltby, Alyson Morgan, Stuart Pankin, Holly Fulger, Glenn McMillan, Ben Easter, Nathan Anderson', null, 'Zenon Kar, a teenager living on a space station in the year 2054, competes in the first ever Galactic Teen Supreme contest.', 'Zenon Kar, a teenager living on a space station in the year 2054, competes in the first ever Galactic Teen Supreme contest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mnX94DJ9GVXEOmbdN97Yh5hGifT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34765'),
  ('1092539323605876433', 'Zeppelin', 1971, 'Adventure, Drama, War', 'Kip Gowans, Lesley De Pettit, Étienne Périer', 'Arthur Rowe, Donald Churchill', 'Michael York, Elke Sommer, Peter Carsten, Marius Goring, Anton Diffring, Andrew Keir, Rupert Davies, Alexandra Stewart', 'G', 'The outbreak of World War I places Scots officer Geoffrey Richter-Douglas in an uncomfortable position. Although his allegiance is to Britain, his mother was from an aristocratic Bavarian family, and he spent his summers in Germany as a child. When Geoffrey is approached by a German spy who offers him a chance to defect, he reports the incident to his superiors, but instead of arresting the spy they suggest that he accept her offer--and become an Allied agent. In Germany, among old friends, Geoffrey discovers that loyalty is more complicated than he expected, especially when he finds himself aboard the maiden voyage of a powerful new prototype Zeppelin, headed for Scotland on a secret mission that could decide the outcome of the war.', 'The outbreak of World War I places Scots officer Geoffrey Richter-Douglas in an uncomfortable position. Although his allegiance is to Britain, his mother was from an aristocratic Bavarian family, and he spent his summers in Germany as a child. When Geoffrey is approached by a German spy who offers him a chance to defect, he reports the incident to his superiors, but instead of arresting the spy they suggest that he accept her offer--and become an Allied agent. In Germany, among old friends, Geoffrey discovers that loyalty is more complicated than he expected, especially when he finds himself aboard the maiden voyage of a powerful new prototype Zeppelin, headed for Scotland on a secret mission that could decide the outcome of the war.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/441jRGFCrRyTzAuojMVXndCj8mM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49719'),
  ('73425041744582777', 'Zer', 2017, 'Drama', 'Kazım Öz', 'Kazım Öz', 'Nik Xhelilaj, Güler Ökten, Tomris İncer, Haleigh Ciel, Levent Özdilek, Füsun Demirel, Ahmet Aslan, José Ramón Rosario', null, 'Zer is the story of a song, whispered to Jan''s ear on his grandmother''s deathbed. A survivor of Dersim Massacre, Zarife hid her identity, her past in her memory of this song. Raised in NYC, Jan begins a journey through Kurdistan, searching for his grandma''s past and his own self.', 'Zer is the story of a song, whispered to Jan''s ear on his grandmother''s deathbed. A survivor of Dersim Massacre, Zarife hid her identity, her past in her memory of this song. Raised in NYC, Jan begins a journey through Kurdistan, searching for his grandma''s past and his own self.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/47BR4Oyq1IGBBdsWbXDWHrqtVzl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:468264'),
  ('827379405305001543', 'Zero', 2010, 'Animation, Drama', 'Christopher Kezelos, Matthew Horrex', 'Christopher Kezelos', 'Nicholas McKay', null, 'In a world that judges people by their number, Zero faces constant prejudice and persecution. He walks a lonely path until a chance encounter changes his life forever: he meets a female zero. Together they prove that through determination, courage, and love, nothing can be truly something.', 'In a world that judges people by their number, Zero faces constant prejudice and persecution. He walks a lonely path until a chance encounter changes his life forever: he meets a female zero. Together they prove that through determination, courage, and love, nothing can be truly something.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/biIwrulLNGntQ7McqN2iRVfiapt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75825'),
  ('45236462365169618', 'Zero', 2018, 'Romance, Drama, Comedy', 'Aanand L. Rai, Rahul Shanklya, Manu Anand', 'Himanshu Sharma', 'Shah Rukh Khan, Anushka Sharma, Katrina Kaif, Tigmanshu Dhulia, Abhay Deol, Sheeba Chaddha, Brijendra Kala, R. Madhavan', 'NR', 'Short in stature but big on love, a bachelor meets two very different women who broaden his horizons and help him find purpose in life.', 'Short in stature but big on love, a bachelor meets two very different women who broaden his horizons and help him find purpose in life.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5uLyqwq2swVns28TFPV2zUzBEd7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:496076'),
  ('679365718657711978', 'Zero', 2021, 'Thriller, Science Fiction, Crime', 'Jochen Alexander Freydank, Stefany Pohlmann, Jakob Wiessner', null, 'Heike Makatsch, Sabin Tambrea, Axel Stein, Matthias Weidenhöfer, Luise Emilie Tschersich, Pit Bukowski, Fabian Passamonte, Meriel Hinsching', null, 'Berlin in the near future: A secret meeting takes place between a board member of the dominant internet company "Freemee" and members of the government. Camera drones film it unauthorized and document the events live on the Internet. The anonymous net activist group "Zero" is publicly committed to the media attack. Online journalist Cynthia Bonsant, widow and single mother, has been asked to do background research on "Zero" by the head of the online magazine "Daily". The group is classified as a terrorist organization, but according to their own statements they fight the excessive influence on the population through the so-called "Act App", which contoles the lives of users. When a friend of Cynthia''s 17-year-old daughter Viola is shot dead in a hunt for a criminal, "Zero" contacts her and tries to recruit her for their own purposes. In the meantime, Cynthia has bad suspicions during her research, because soon a new version of the app will be released that will change everything.', 'Berlin in the near future: A secret meeting takes place between a board member of the dominant internet company "Freemee" and members of the government. Camera drones film it unauthorized and document the events live on the Internet. The anonymous net activist group "Zero" is publicly committed to the media attack. Online journalist Cynthia Bonsant, widow and single mother, has been asked to do background research on "Zero" by the head of the online magazine "Daily". The group is classified as a terrorist organization, but according to their own statements they fight the excessive influence on the population through the so-called "Act App", which contoles the lives of users. When a friend of Cynthia''s 17-year-old daughter Viola is shot dead in a hunt for a criminal, "Zero" contacts her and tries to recruit her for their own purposes. In the meantime, Cynthia has bad suspicions during her research, because soon a new version of the app will be released that will change everything.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oBTvBAJQ7Jwcb2fLFTm58IJOXt0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:891464'),
  ('155140113212351529', 'Zero', 2025, 'Action, Thriller', 'Jean Luc Herbulot, Grégory Turbellier', 'Jean Luc Herbulot, Hus Miller', 'Hus Miller, Cam McHarg, Gary Dourdan, Roger Felmont Sallah, Moran Rosenblatt, Annabelle Lengronne, Angelique Mendes, Willem Dafoe', 'NR', 'Two Americans wake up in Dakar, Senegal, with bombs strapped to their chests ticking down from ten hours. Guided by a threatening voice on the phone, these men complete a series of violent tasks that spark widespread protest against Western influence in the city.', 'Two Americans wake up in Dakar, Senegal, with bombs strapped to their chests ticking down from ten hours. Guided by a threatening voice on the phone, these men complete a series of violent tasks that spark widespread protest against Western influence in the city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5bo30pUJGUpvNP8XS75T3Al8V1R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:891644'),
  ('647291482906067726', 'Zero Contact', 2022, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Drama', 'Rick Dugdale', 'Cam Cannon', 'Anthony Hopkins, Chris Brochu, Aleks Paunovic, TJ Kayama, Martin Stenmarck, Rukiya Bernard, James C. Burns, Veronica Ferres', 'R', 'Produced in 17 different countries entirely virtually during the 2020 global pandemic, the film follows five characters based all over the world, connected only by their devotion to the late founder and tech titan Finley Hart. Forced to work together to shut down Hart’s most secret invention, a machine that is either the solution to mankind’s problems or the end of the earth.', 'Produced in 17 different countries entirely virtually during the 2020 global pandemic, the film follows five characters based all over the world, connected only by their devotion to the late founder and tech titan Finley Hart. Forced to work together to shut down Hart’s most secret invention, a machine that is either the solution to mankind’s problems or the end of the earth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/r7HHBpntE8ygag10eiglEbkFDi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:872170'),
  ('225882457809942402', 'Zero Dark Thirty', 2012, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Kathryn Bigelow, Greig Fraser, Rod McLean', 'Mark Boal', 'Jessica Chastain, Jason Clarke, Kyle Chandler, Jennifer Ehle, Mark Strong, Joel Edgerton, Chris Pratt, Edgar Ramírez', 'R', 'A chronicle of the decade-long hunt for al-Qaeda terrorist leader Osama bin Laden after the September 2001 attacks, and his death at the hands of the Navy S.E.A.L. Team 6 in May, 2011.', 'A chronicle of the decade-long hunt for al-Qaeda terrorist leader Osama bin Laden after the September 2001 attacks, and his death at the hands of the Navy S.E.A.L. Team 6 in May, 2011.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wNSdSSxowM3WIqmPJNg3RagYbwP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:97630'),
  ('222160571188869105', 'Zero Day', 2003, 'Crime, Drama', 'Ben Coccio', 'Christopher Coccio, Ben Coccio', 'Cal Robertson, Andre Keuck, Serataren Adragna, Melissa Banks, Joshua Bednarsky, Rachel Benichak, Carmine DiBenedetto, Chelsea Cipolla', null, 'Two troubled adolescents chronicle the events that ultimately lead up to a terrifying assault on their school.', 'Two troubled adolescents chronicle the events that ultimately lead up to a terrifying assault on their school.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vjGh2uiqLM6K0qleMswFylXpWUk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27090'),
  ('583842635909093591', 'Zero Days', 2016, 'Documentary', 'Alex Gibney, Antonio Rossi, Avner Shahaf', 'Alex Gibney', 'Yossi Melman, Ralph Langner, Emad Kiyaei, Richard A. Clarke, Eric Chien, Liam O''Murchu, George W. Bush, Hillary Clinton', 'PG-13', 'Alex Gibney explores the phenomenon of Stuxnet, a self-replicating computer virus discovered in 2010 by international IT experts. Evidently commissioned by the US and Israeli governments, this malware was designed to specifically sabotage Iran’s nuclear programme. However, the complex computer worm ended up not only infecting its intended target but also spreading uncontrollably.', 'Alex Gibney explores the phenomenon of Stuxnet, a self-replicating computer virus discovered in 2010 by international IT experts. Evidently commissioned by the US and Israeli governments, this malware was designed to specifically sabotage Iran’s nuclear programme. However, the complex computer worm ended up not only infecting its intended target but also spreading uncontrollably.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xwQVkRJGCH59jGNPR78Aw8wzyZg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:380808'),
  ('582486044143551146', 'Zero Effect', 1998, 'Comedy, Crime, Mystery', 'Jake Kasdan, Bill Pope', 'Jake Kasdan', 'Bill Pullman, Ben Stiller, Ryan O''Neal, Kim Dickens, Angela Featherstone, Hugh Ross, Sarah DeVincentis, Matt O''Toole', 'R', 'Daryl Zero is a private investigator and—along with his assistant, Steve Arlo—he solves impossible crimes and puzzles. Although Daryl''s a master investigator, he doesn''t know what to do with himself when he''s not working; he has no social skills, writes bad music and drives Steve crazy.', 'Daryl Zero is a private investigator and—along with his assistant, Steve Arlo—he solves impossible crimes and puzzles. Although Daryl''s a master investigator, he doesn''t know what to do with himself when he''s not working; he has no social skills, writes bad music and drives Steve crazy.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yFALvZFwqnh5ESarNoVd5KtizCo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16148'),
  ('431649308851717712', 'Zero Focus', 1961, 'Drama, Crime, Mystery', 'Yoshitarō Nomura, Takashi Kawamata, Jirō Sugioka', 'Yoshitarō Nomura', 'Yoshiko Kuga, Hizuru Takachiho, Ineko Arima, Kōji Nanbara, Kō Nishimura, Sadako Sawamura, Yoshi Katō, Mutsuko Sakura', null, 'One week into newlywed Teiko Uhara''s marriage, her husband, Kenichi, leaves on a short business trip and never returns. Teiko travels across Japan to search for him, and along the way discovers some surprising facts about her husband''s past. With only a pair of old photographs among his belongings to go off of, Teiko tries to figure out what has happened to him.', 'One week into newlywed Teiko Uhara''s marriage, her husband, Kenichi, leaves on a short business trip and never returns. Teiko travels across Japan to search for him, and along the way discovers some surprising facts about her husband''s past. With only a pair of old photographs among his belongings to go off of, Teiko tries to figure out what has happened to him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/seEfKtKiZoKFhreYB4ccI1gEZbu.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:115572'),
  ('1056603932811661702', 'Zero Focus', 2009, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Isshin Inudo, Atsushi Kaneshige, Takahiro Tsutai', 'Kenji Nakazono, Isshin Inudo', 'Hirosue Ryoko, Miki Nakatani, Tae Kimura, Hidetoshi Nishijima, Takeshi Kaga, Tetta Sugimoto, Hiromi Sakimoto, Toru Nomaguchi', null, 'Spurred by the disappearance of a newly-wed husband, three women in post-war Japan are drawn into a murder mystery.', 'Spurred by the disappearance of a newly-wed husband, three women in post-war Japan are drawn into a murder mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7yTM8x9PGk5oJRwPTlzJosANCA3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:51587'),
  ('1140231817156235448', 'Zero for Conduct', 1933, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Jean Vigo, Boris Kaufman, Pierre Merle', 'Jean Vigo', 'Jean Dasté, Robert le Flon, Du Verron, Delphin, Léon Larive, Madame Émile, Louis de Gonzague, Raphaël Diligent', 'NR', 'In a repressive boarding school with rigid rules of behavior, four boys decide to rebel against the director on a celebration day.', 'In a repressive boarding school with rigid rules of behavior, four boys decide to rebel against the director on a celebration day.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oQcGB9BGj9LPTWcEdij47McotKY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44494'),
  ('761233851978642701', 'Zero Fucks Given', 2022, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Julie Lecoustre, Emmanuel Marre, Olivier Boonjing', 'Julie Lecoustre, Emmanuel Marre, Mariette Désert', 'Adèle Exarchopoulos, Alexandre Perrier, Mara Taquin, Arthur Egloff, Tamara Al Saadi, David Martinez Pinon, Jean-Benoît Ugeux, Jonathan Sawdon', null, 'Cassandre, 26, is a flight attendant for a low-cost airline. Based in Lanzarote, she’s always willing to take on extra hours and carries out her duties with robotic efficiency. On the side, she just goes with the flow and floats between Tinder, parties and lazy days. When she suddenly gets dismissed, she is forced to return home.', 'Cassandre, 26, is a flight attendant for a low-cost airline. Based in Lanzarote, she’s always willing to take on extra hours and carries out her duties with robotic efficiency. On the side, she just goes with the flow and floats between Tinder, parties and lazy days. When she suddenly gets dismissed, she is forced to return home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yhd12Kew7wG7Kttap2X1JjgRooa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:833326'),
  ('887827076472539146', 'Zero Hour!', 1957, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Hall Bartlett, John F. Warren', 'John C. Champion, Arthur Hailey, Hall Bartlett', 'Dana Andrews, Linda Darnell, Sterling Hayden, Elroy ''Crazylegs'' Hirsch, Geoffrey Toone, Jerry Paris, Peggy King, Charles Quinlivan', 'NR', 'In 1950s Canada, during a commercial flight, the pilots and some passengers suffer food poisoning, thus forcing an ex-WW2 fighter pilot to try to land the airliner in heavy fog.', 'In 1950s Canada, during a commercial flight, the pilots and some passengers suffer food poisoning, thus forcing an ex-WW2 fighter pilot to try to land the airliner in heavy fog.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/e6gXYB0Le21hKhVQYYTacf2JfYK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:54541'),
  ('719934267763044466', 'Zero Kelvin', 1995, 'Drama, Thriller', 'Hans Petter Moland, Philip Øgaard', 'Hans Petter Moland', 'Stellan Skarsgård, Gard B. Eidsvold, Bjørn Sundquist, Camilla Martens, Paul-Ottar Haga, Johannes Joner, Erik Øksnes, Lars Andreas Larssen', 'NR', 'Larsen, an aspiring poet in ''20s Oslo, leaves his girlfriend to spend a year as a trapper in East Greenland. There he is teamed with a seemingly rough old sailor/trapper, Randbæk, and a scientist, Holm. Trapped in a tiny hut together as the Arctic winter sets in, a complex and intense love/hate relationship develops between Randbæk and Larsen, who are more similar than either would like to admit. A powerful psychological and physical drama set against stunningly bleak Arctic scenery.', 'Larsen, an aspiring poet in ''20s Oslo, leaves his girlfriend to spend a year as a trapper in East Greenland. There he is teamed with a seemingly rough old sailor/trapper, Randbæk, and a scientist, Holm. Trapped in a tiny hut together as the Arctic winter sets in, a complex and intense love/hate relationship develops between Randbæk and Larsen, who are more similar than either would like to admit. A powerful psychological and physical drama set against stunningly bleak Arctic scenery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ddvaQzv1w53kTfRzzZbfnisUMJq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85589'),
  ('186932456064801819', 'Zero Motivation', 2014, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Talya Lavie, Yaron Scharf', 'Talya Lavie', 'Dana Ivgy, Nelly Tagar, Shani Klein, Heli Twito, Meytal Gal, Tamara Klingon, Yonit Tobi, Yuval Segal', null, 'Filmmaker Talya Lavie steps into the spotlight with a dark comedy about everyday life for a unit of young female Israeli soldiers. The human resources office at a remote desert base serves as the setting for this cast of characters, who bide their time pushing paper, battling for the top score in Minesweeper, and counting down the minutes until they can return to civilian life. Amidst their boredom and clashing personalities, issues of commitment—from friendship to love and country—are handled with humor and sharp-edged wit.', 'Filmmaker Talya Lavie steps into the spotlight with a dark comedy about everyday life for a unit of young female Israeli soldiers. The human resources office at a remote desert base serves as the setting for this cast of characters, who bide their time pushing paper, battling for the top score in Minesweeper, and counting down the minutes until they can return to civilian life. Amidst their boredom and clashing personalities, issues of commitment—from friendship to love and country—are handled with humor and sharp-edged wit.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o47GwtgXRD6k8qxcJseQK2Fa9C0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261825'),
  ('808056386684468800', 'Zero Patience', 1993, 'Fantasy, Drama, Science Fiction, Music', 'John Greyson, Mirosław Baszak, Ian Robertson', 'John Greyson', 'John Robinson, Norman Fauteux, Dianne Heatherington, Richardo Keens-Douglas, Charlotte Boisjoli, Brenda Kamino, Michael Callen, Marla Lukofsky', 'NR', 'The ghost of "patient zero", who allegedly first brought AIDS to North America - materialises and tries to contact old friends. Meanwhile, the Victorian explorer Sir Richard Burton, who drank from the Fountain of Youth and now works as Chief Taxidermist at the Toronto Natural history Museum, is trying to organise an exhibition about the disease for the museum''s "Hall of Contagion".', 'The ghost of "patient zero", who allegedly first brought AIDS to North America - materialises and tries to contact old friends. Meanwhile, the Victorian explorer Sir Richard Burton, who drank from the Fountain of Youth and now works as Chief Taxidermist at the Toronto Natural history Museum, is trying to organise an exhibition about the disease for the museum''s "Hall of Contagion".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6l1gkVvQpsWcC4NAhKgPRsKS67Q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:85118'),
  ('393248920777447528', 'Zero to Hero', 2021, 'Drama', 'Tam Wai-Kai, Wan Chi-Man, Tiffany Ng Ka-Ching', 'Lo Man-Tsun', 'Sandra Ng Kwan-Yu, Louis Cheung, Leung Chung-Hang, Mason Fung Ho-Yeung, Tony Wu, Chin Siu-Ho, Yeung Wai-Lun, Ng Siu-Hin', null, 'Biopic tribute to So Wa Wai, Hong Kong''s first Paralympic athlete to win gold. Even if you start at a disadvantage, you can still be first across the finish line.', 'Biopic tribute to So Wa Wai, Hong Kong''s first Paralympic athlete to win gold. Even if you start at a disadvantage, you can still be first across the finish line.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zLO2uXFvic6tDQCvNFpZbJNCJGN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:741318'),
  ('177770193565001988', 'Zero to Hero', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy, Music', 'Marcelo Antunez, Rodrigo Graciosa, Vânia Ferreira', 'Felipe Folgosi', 'Lucas Lucco, Carla Diaz, Felipe Hintze, Paula Cohen, Charles Paraventi, Norival Rizzo, Serjão Loroza, Marcelo Flores', 'R', 'When a rock wannabe is forced to replace his famous sertanejo look-alike, he faces a life-changing choice — lose his own identity or follow his heart.', 'When a rock wannabe is forced to replace his famous sertanejo look-alike, he faces a life-changing choice — lose his own identity or follow his heart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itbvNJRF3NxIS6gysGEKeO1adSn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:999501'),
  ('436207583920935375', 'Zero Tolerance', 1994, 'Action, Thriller', 'Joseph Merhi, Ken Blakey, Alexander H. Gayner', 'Joe Hart', 'Robert Patrick, Titus Welliver, Mick Fleetwood, Miles O''Keeffe, Kristen Meadows, Jeffrey Anderson-Gunter, Gustav Vintas, Jed Allan', 'R', 'After surviving a sneak attack on himself and fellow agents Jimmy and Gene as they were transporting drug kingpin Raymond Manta out of a Mexican jail, FBI agent Jeff Douglas becomes an uwitting pawn of the White Hand drug cartel. Mistakenly told that his already murdered family is being held hostage, Jeff is forced to turn one-time courier for the White Hand, whose leaders are Manta and four others named Helmut Vitch, Milt Kowalski, Russ LaFleur, and Hansel Lee. After surviving a car-bombing in Las Vegas, Jeff learns the truth about his family being murdered, and he sets out to exterminate the White Hand cartel. Unofficially aided by an agent named Megan, whose mother was raped and murdered years ago, Jeff steals FBI files and begins his campaign of revenge on the White Hand cartel.', 'After surviving a sneak attack on himself and fellow agents Jimmy and Gene as they were transporting drug kingpin Raymond Manta out of a Mexican jail, FBI agent Jeff Douglas becomes an uwitting pawn of the White Hand drug cartel. Mistakenly told that his already murdered family is being held hostage, Jeff is forced to turn one-time courier for the White Hand, whose leaders are Manta and four others named Helmut Vitch, Milt Kowalski, Russ LaFleur, and Hansel Lee. After surviving a car-bombing in Las Vegas, Jeff learns the truth about his family being murdered, and he sets out to exterminate the White Hand cartel. Unofficially aided by an agent named Megan, whose mother was raped and murdered years ago, Jeff steals FBI files and begins his campaign of revenge on the White Hand cartel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/umV4jgOsz0AVhIVpx2WSQEIZXH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:128975'),
  ('283355906890933421', 'Zero Tolerance', 1999, 'Action, Thriller, Crime', 'Anders Nilsson, Jacob Jørgensen, Ingela Rohnström', 'Anders Nilsson, Joakim Hansson', 'Jakob Eklund, Peter Andersson, Marie Richardson, Jacqueline Ramel, Hanna Alsterlund, Fredrik Dolk, Lennart Hjulström, Torkel Petersson', null, 'Johan is a two-fisted Gothenburg cop who finds himself in a shoot-out with jewel robbers. After the smoke has cleared, one robber, shot by his accomplice, and an innocent bystander, are dead. Three witnesses, including Helen, identify thug extraordinaire Leo Gaut as being the dead crook''s trigger-happy colleague. Gaut soon threatens the three witnesses, and only Johan, the badge-wearing hero, can save them.', 'Johan is a two-fisted Gothenburg cop who finds himself in a shoot-out with jewel robbers. After the smoke has cleared, one robber, shot by his accomplice, and an innocent bystander, are dead. Three witnesses, including Helen, identify thug extraordinaire Leo Gaut as being the dead crook''s trigger-happy colleague. Gaut soon threatens the three witnesses, and only Johan, the badge-wearing hero, can save them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/O8wijji4u1dUaNAdmBOyrcP2ZR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:21072'),
  ('162795646577976605', 'Zero Tolerance', 2015, 'Thriller, Action, Crime', 'Wych Kaosayananda, Wych Kaosayananda', 'Wych Kaosayananda', 'Dustin Nguyễn, Sahajak Boonthanakit, Scott Adkins, Gary Daniels, Prinya Intachai, Kane Kosugi, Ammy Chanicha, Nicole Theriault', 'R', 'Johnny and Peter, former paramilitary operatives, search Bangkok - leaving carnage in their wake - to find the men who killed Johnny''s daughter, Angel.', 'Johnny and Peter, former paramilitary operatives, search Bangkok - leaving carnage in their wake - to find the men who killed Johnny''s daughter, Angel.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bjXxFoQ36m6E5zSWzY6pB09qejh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:273238'),
  ('179306901321084774', 'Zero Woman R', 2007, 'Drama, Action', 'Ken''ichi Fujiwara', 'Ken''ichi Fujiwara, Takahiro Tanaka', 'Atsuko Miura, Masaki Miura, Sasa Handa, Hiromitsu Kiba, Manzo Shinra, Masanori Machida, Keisaku Kimura, Youshio Hariu', null, 'A mysterious female spy is recruited to infiltrate the Japanese underworld and gather evidence for a clandestine secretive branch of the Tokyo Police Department.', 'A mysterious female spy is recruited to infiltrate the Japanese underworld and gather evidence for a clandestine secretive branch of the Tokyo Police Department.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dFpW71CLdrncVJSqHp33GkjAGvp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118285'),
  ('722298118159134676', 'Zero Woman Returns', 1999, 'Action, Thriller', 'Yasushi Saisyu, Hiroyuki Sunaga', 'Genjiro Kaneko', 'Saori Ono, Shigemitsu Ogi, Daisuke Ryū, Nao Eguchi, Norihide Goto, Makoto Inamiya, Kodan Nanbu, Hiroto Yoshimitsu', null, 'Rei, whose undercover role is so guarded that there is no written record of her identity, is well known for her accuracy in completing missions and her willingness to get naked if the situation calls for it. When she''s instructed to bust Kayama, who has been buying confiscated drugs from corrupt police officers, she finds herself in a sticky situation -- not only is she attracted to him, but Kayama, like Rei, does not officially exist.', 'Rei, whose undercover role is so guarded that there is no written record of her identity, is well known for her accuracy in completing missions and her willingness to get naked if the situation calls for it. When she''s instructed to bust Kayama, who has been buying confiscated drugs from corrupt police officers, she finds herself in a sticky situation -- not only is she attracted to him, but Kayama, like Rei, does not officially exist.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bsIycTeDAmVWwn2wtnTqbkGBhFk.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:44983'),
  ('38603556601183514', 'Zero Woman: Red Handcuffs', 1974, 'Thriller, Action, Crime, Drama', 'Yukio Noda, Yoshio Nakajima, Shinichiro Sawai', 'Fumio Kōnami, Hirō Matsuda', 'Miki Sugimoto, Eiji Gō, Tetsuro Tamba, Hideo Murota, Yōko Mihara, Ichiro Araki, Seiji Endō, Rokkō Toura', null, 'Agent Zero is a cop that uses her own methods for dealing with criminals. After she unlawfully kills a rapist in a violent fashion, she is sent to prison and stripped of her badge. But very soon after, a rich politician''s daughter is kidnapped by a ruthless gang. Agent Zero is let out of prison with the mission of going undercover to find the politician''s daughter and return her safely. Using her deadly red handcuffs, she disposes of the criminals one by one.', 'Agent Zero is a cop that uses her own methods for dealing with criminals. After she unlawfully kills a rapist in a violent fashion, she is sent to prison and stripped of her badge. But very soon after, a rich politician''s daughter is kidnapped by a ruthless gang. Agent Zero is let out of prison with the mission of going undercover to find the politician''s daughter and return her safely. Using her deadly red handcuffs, she disposes of the criminals one by one.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9JGdWSsQZfsA24kpBTPySwGBX3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62852'),
  ('164898958054660015', 'Zero Zone', 2020, 'Action, Drama', 'Kadri Beran Taşkın', null, 'Savaş Satış, Onur Akbay, Hiro Hami, Cengizhan Yurdutek, Burak Akyüz, Salih İnci, Hakan Aydın, İbrahim Coşkun', null, 'Sifir Bir tells the story of Savaş, Cihat and Azad who left their criminal lives in Adana and settled in İzmir. Adana gang leader Savaş, together with Cihat and Azad, decide to leave their violent past behind them. The three friends leave Adana, open a car wash and settle in Izmir to start a new life. However, when a little girl named Melek takes shelter with Savaş and his friends after all the bad things that have happened to her, the team takes action. They decided to chase after the men who hurt Melek and find themselves on a path of no return.', 'Sifir Bir tells the story of Savaş, Cihat and Azad who left their criminal lives in Adana and settled in İzmir. Adana gang leader Savaş, together with Cihat and Azad, decide to leave their violent past behind them. The three friends leave Adana, open a car wash and settle in Izmir to start a new life. However, when a little girl named Melek takes shelter with Savaş and his friends after all the bad things that have happened to her, the team takes action. They decided to chase after the men who hurt Melek and find themselves on a path of no return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5yUJTtMm0v92LltVlQNnrIiYuoU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:663209'),
  ('794593269671828503', 'Zero: An Investigation Into 9/11', 2008, 'Documentary', 'Francesco Trento, Franco Fracassi', 'Francesco Trento, Giulietto Chiesa, Thomas Torelli', 'Dario Fo, Gore Vidal, Tim Sparke, Nafeez Mossadeq Ahmed, Brian Clark, Louie Cacchioli, Les Jamieson, Kevin Ryan', null, 'ZERO: An Investigation into 9/11 has one central thesis: that the official version of the events surrounding the attacks on 9/11 cannot be true. This feature documentary explores the latest scientific evidence and reveals dramatic new witness testimony, which directly conflicts with the U.S. government''s account.', 'ZERO: An Investigation into 9/11 has one central thesis: that the official version of the events surrounding the attacks on 9/11 cannot be true. This feature documentary explores the latest scientific evidence and reveals dramatic new witness testimony, which directly conflicts with the U.S. government''s account.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wVVUWrVxLK8WfGEh3vlMGATso2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25204'),
  ('300680902847171411', 'Zerograd', 1988, 'Drama, Comedy', 'Karen Shakhnazarov, Nikolay Nemolyaev, Igor Mayorov', 'Aleksandr Borodyanskiy, Karen Shakhnazarov', 'Leonid Filatov, Oleg Basilashvili, Vladimir Menshov, Armen Dzhigarkhanyan, Aleksei Zharkov, Pyotr Shcherbakov, Evgeniy Evstigneev, Yuriy Sherstnyov', null, 'Going on a business trip, the hero of the film suddenly finds himself in a fantastic city. It is very similar to our world, only the hidden absurdity of everyday life here has become apparent.', 'Going on a business trip, the hero of the film suddenly finds himself in a fantastic city. It is very similar to our world, only the hidden absurdity of everyday life here has become apparent.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qZfKokBI7regpiHwjczym2oa4P.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74711'),
  ('41836442437774948', 'Zerophilia', 2005, 'Comedy, Romance', 'Martin Curland', 'Martin Curland', 'Taylor Handley, Dustin Seavey, Alison Folland, Kyle Schmid, Rebecca Mozo, Marieh Delfino, Gina Bellman, Rick Stear', null, 'Luke, a young man insecure about his masculinity, discovers he''s a Zerophiliac, with the ability to change sex at will. Join Luke as he journeys into the extraordinary world of Zerophilia where so many crazy questions arise, only one question matters: "Whom do you love?"', 'Luke, a young man insecure about his masculinity, discovers he''s a Zerophiliac, with the ability to change sex at will. Join Luke as he journeys into the extraordinary world of Zerophilia where so many crazy questions arise, only one question matters: "Whom do you love?"', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b8hjffkgD8MkvuY1aDPxzOPoigz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30548'),
  ('1007377686937295679', 'Zeros and Ones', 2021, 'War, Thriller', 'Giulio Donato, Sean Price Williams, Abel Ferrara', 'Abel Ferrara', 'Ethan Hawke, Cristina Chiriac, Phil Neilson, Valerio Mastandrea, Valeria Correale, Dounia Sichov, Babak Karimi, Korlan Rachmetova', 'R', 'Called to Rome to stop an imminent terrorist bombing, a soldier desperately seeks news of his imprisoned brother — a rebel with knowledge that could thwart the attack. Navigating the capital''s darkened streets, he races to a series of ominous encounters to keep the Vatican from being blown to bits.', 'Called to Rome to stop an imminent terrorist bombing, a soldier desperately seeks news of his imprisoned brother — a rebel with knowledge that could thwart the attack. Navigating the capital''s darkened streets, he races to a series of ominous encounters to keep the Vatican from being blown to bits.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a6balsDWCFMHPaPT6rFoBpNjR6z.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:762433'),
  ('1057262080557014752', 'Zeroville', 2019, 'Comedy, Drama', 'James Franco, Bruce Thierry Cheung', 'Paul Felten, Ian Olds', 'James Franco, Megan Fox, Seth Rogen, Joey King, Jacki Weaver, Dave Franco, Craig Robinson, Vince Jolivette', 'R', 'A young actor arrives in Hollywood in 1969 during a transitional time in the Industry.', 'A young actor arrives in Hollywood in 1969 during a transitional time in the Industry.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6LrlFzEOW45jrG84kTrGqlYKQHZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:291867'),
  ('460339028699269992', 'Zeta One', 1969, 'Comedy, Fantasy, Science Fiction', 'Michael Cort, Jack Atcheler', 'Michael Cort, Alistair McKenzie', 'James Robertson Justice, Charles Hawtrey, Robin Hawdon, Anna Gaël, Brigitte Skay, Dawn Addams, Valerie Leon, Lionel Murton', 'R', 'A race of sexy, other-dimensional specimens arrive to Earth to kidnap women to repopulate their planet.', 'A race of sexy, other-dimensional specimens arrive to Earth to kidnap women to repopulate their planet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5G7u1B1XlZ1CMyKOp4hvXIOCk5K.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118337'),
  ('433308756537356432', 'Zeta: Una Storia Hip-Hop', 2016, 'Drama, Music', 'Cosimo Alemà, Benedikte Salomon, Marcello Calvesi', 'Riccardo Brun, Paolo Bernardelli, Cosimo Alemà', 'Izi, Salvatore Esposito, Jacopo Olmo Antinori, Irene Vetere, Eradis Josende Oberto, Francesco Siciliano, Massimiliano Gallo, Gianluca Di Gennaro', null, 'In a Rome divided between the city center and the suburbs, rich and poor, famous and not, Alex, Gaia, and Marco are three friends in their early twenties who dream of escaping the future society has written for them. Street life, working at the market, poverty, small-time drug dealing, suburban tenements, and the dream of hip-hop are Alex''s life until his dream comes true and he finds himself catapulted into the world of rap, playing his part and proving his worth. Managing his own destiny, however, isn''t easy, and Alex makes many mistakes, leaving him alone, without a point of reference, and with fleeting success. He must then confront his demons, the harshness of the world, and his own confusion, to learn to love his anger and understand what he truly desires.', 'In a Rome divided between the city center and the suburbs, rich and poor, famous and not, Alex, Gaia, and Marco are three friends in their early twenties who dream of escaping the future society has written for them. Street life, working at the market, poverty, small-time drug dealing, suburban tenements, and the dream of hip-hop are Alex''s life until his dream comes true and he finds himself catapulted into the world of rap, playing his part and proving his worth. Managing his own destiny, however, isn''t easy, and Alex makes many mistakes, leaving him alone, without a point of reference, and with fleeting success. He must then confront his demons, the harshness of the world, and his own confusion, to learn to love his anger and understand what he truly desires.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1j9CZwu65EaRAisdypH4kUPUcbY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:393863'),
  ('332507605252006533', 'Zeus & Roxanne', 1997, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family, Romance', 'George T. Miller, David Connell, Frederic W. Brost', 'Tom Benedek', 'Steve Guttenberg, Kathleen Quinlan, Arnold Vosloo, Dawn McMillan, Jessica Howell, Duchess Tomasello, Shannon K. Foley, Jim R. Coleman', 'PG', 'Mary Beth is a marine biologist that gets annoyed when a dog called Zeus stows aboard her research boat. Nevertheless she is intrigued when the intrusive canine makes best-friends with her captive dolphin, Roxanne. She falls in love with Zeus''s owner, Terry, a musician who rides a bike.', 'Mary Beth is a marine biologist that gets annoyed when a dog called Zeus stows aboard her research boat. Nevertheless she is intrigued when the intrusive canine makes best-friends with her captive dolphin, Roxanne. She falls in love with Zeus''s owner, Terry, a musician who rides a bike.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/igyTJ9cFwjcuzMM5oa0lknRyvYv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:42424'),
  ('842414378122619806', 'Zhongkui: Snow Girl and the Dark Crystal', 2015, 'Action, Fantasy, Romance', 'Xi Zi, Peter Pau Tak-Hai, Tianyu Zhao', 'Guo Junli', 'Chen Kun, Li Bingbing, Bao Bei''er, Winston Chao, Yang Zishan, Huang Huan, Luo Wenbo, Hou Yidi', null, 'The story of Chinese legendary anti-hero Zhong Kui, a young man endowed with mysterious powers who is forced into a battle among the realms of Heaven, Earth and Hell in the course of his attempt to save his countrymen and the woman he loves.', 'The story of Chinese legendary anti-hero Zhong Kui, a young man endowed with mysterious powers who is forced into a battle among the realms of Heaven, Earth and Hell in the course of his attempt to save his countrymen and the woman he loves.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mqnmSE5OMzBKbQw8iyKnaQ6nVdI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:299822'),
  ('712436866186428279', 'Zhou Yu''s Train', 2002, 'Drama, Romance', 'Sun Zhou, Wang Yu', 'Cun Bei, Sun Zhou, Mei Zhang', 'Sun Honglei, Gong Li, Tony Leung Ka-fai, Zhang Heng, Sun Zhou', 'PG-13', 'Zhou Yu, a ceramic artisan in China''s rural Northwest, has a deep rapport with Chen Qing, a shy sensitive poet. Taking a long train ride every weekend just to make mad passionate love with him, her longing seems insatiable. Until one day, she meets the hedonistic vet Zhang Qiang and begins a torrid affair, which takes her to another train station, and another level of lust. Driven by the locomotive of love and desire, she hustles through a dark tunnel of no return.', 'Zhou Yu, a ceramic artisan in China''s rural Northwest, has a deep rapport with Chen Qing, a shy sensitive poet. Taking a long train ride every weekend just to make mad passionate love with him, her longing seems insatiable. Until one day, she meets the hedonistic vet Zhang Qiang and begins a torrid affair, which takes her to another train station, and another level of lust. Driven by the locomotive of love and desire, she hustles through a dark tunnel of no return.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/etTZFDdXUjGB0cagwyWIeHlx6Xb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61477'),
