  ('402207133567626639', 'Zidane: A 21st Century Portrait', 2006, 'Documentary', 'Douglas Gordon, Philippe Parreno, Darius Khondji', null, 'Zinédine Zidane, Ronaldo, David Beckham, Iker Casillas, Míchel Salgado, Roberto Carlos, Francisco Pavón, Raúl González', null, 'Halfway between a sports documentary and an conceptual art installation, "Zidane" consists in a full-length soccer game (Real Madrid vs. Villareal, April 23, 2005) entirely filmed from the perspective of soccer superstar Zinedine Zidane.', 'Halfway between a sports documentary and an conceptual art installation, "Zidane" consists in a full-length soccer game (Real Madrid vs. Villareal, April 23, 2005) entirely filmed from the perspective of soccer superstar Zinedine Zidane.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6zvoqWwSEYz3L7gnp9RHqbIoSJg.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:8421'),
  ('321585524016639791', 'Ziegfeld Follies', 1945, 'Music, Comedy', 'Vincente Minnelli, Charles Rosher, George J. Folsey', 'David Freedman, Hugh Martin, Ralph Blane', 'William Powell, Fred Astaire, Lucille Ball, Lucille Bremer, Fanny Brice, Judy Garland, Kathryn Grayson, Lena Horne', 'NR', 'The late, great impresario Florenz Ziegfeld looks down from heaven and ordains a new revue in his grand old style.', 'The late, great impresario Florenz Ziegfeld looks down from heaven and ordains a new revue in his grand old style.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aOEBNv8ddg6ZsroRSyv7k46xwHG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43176'),
  ('164706086479336032', 'Ziegfeld Girl', 1941, 'Drama, Music, Romance', 'Robert Z. Leonard, Busby Berkeley, Ray June', 'Sonya Levien, Marguerite Roberts', 'James Stewart, Judy Garland, Hedy Lamarr, Lana Turner, Tony Martin, Jackie Cooper, Ian Hunter, Charles Winninger', 'NR', 'Discovery by Flo Ziegfeld changes a girl''s life but not necessarily for the better, as three beautiful women find out when they join the spectacle on Broadway: Susan, the singer who must leave behind her ageing vaudevillian father; vulnerable Sheila, the working girl pursued both by a millionaire and by her loyal boyfriend from Flatbush; and the mysterious European beauty Sandra, whose concert violinist husband cannot endure the thought of their escaping from poverty by promenading her glamor in skimpy costumes.', 'Discovery by Flo Ziegfeld changes a girl''s life but not necessarily for the better, as three beautiful women find out when they join the spectacle on Broadway: Susan, the singer who must leave behind her ageing vaudevillian father; vulnerable Sheila, the working girl pursued both by a millionaire and by her loyal boyfriend from Flatbush; and the mysterious European beauty Sandra, whose concert violinist husband cannot endure the thought of their escaping from poverty by promenading her glamor in skimpy costumes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jzVzrPg5tFR9WbVL04aLWqz3lMv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:32619'),
  ('835257714776422807', 'Zift', 2008, 'Thriller, Crime, Drama', 'Javor Gardev, Emil Christov', 'Vladislav Todorov', 'Zahari Baharov, Tanya Ilieva, Vladimir Penev, Mihail Mutafov, Tsvetan Dimitrov, Djoko Rosic, Dimo Alexiev, Jordan Mutafov', null, 'Moth is freed on parole after spending time in prison on a wrongful conviction of murder. Jailed shortly before the Bulgarian communist coup of 1944, he now finds himself in a new and alien world— the totalitarian Sofia of the 60s. His first night of freedom draws the map of a diabolical city full of decaying neighborhoods, gloomy streets, and a bizarre parade of characters.', 'Moth is freed on parole after spending time in prison on a wrongful conviction of murder. Jailed shortly before the Bulgarian communist coup of 1944, he now finds himself in a new and alien world— the totalitarian Sofia of the 60s. His first night of freedom draws the map of a diabolical city full of decaying neighborhoods, gloomy streets, and a bizarre parade of characters.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lc1YoLe1VZ2jUvEy7dqIh176o03.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19152'),
  ('855132200378361480', 'Zig Zag', 2002, 'Drama', 'David S. Goyer, James L. Carter, Richard L. Fox', 'David S. Goyer', 'John Leguizamo, Wesley Snipes, Oliver Platt, Natasha Lyonne, Luke Goss, Sam Jones, Sherman Augustus, Michael Greyeyes', 'R', 'An autistic 15-year-old boy steals money from his boss to provide rent for his abusive father, who uses the money to repay a loan shark.', 'An autistic 15-year-old boy steals money from his boss to provide rent for his abusive father, who uses the money to repay a loan shark.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/l9h5A2iI5jAhQh8SQXyg9LCnhgD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13442'),
  ('184604362497584809', 'Zigeunerweisen', 1980, 'Mystery, Drama', 'Seijun Suzuki, Kazue Nagatsuka, Naoto Sakai', 'Yōzō Tanaka', 'Toshiya Fujita, Naoko Ohtani, Yoshio Harada, Michiyo Yasuda, Kirin Kiki, Akaji Maro, Sumie Sasaki, Hatsuo Yamaya', null, 'A surreal period film following a university professor and his eerie nomad friend as they go through loose romantic triangles and face death in peculiar ways.', 'A surreal period film following a university professor and his eerie nomad friend as they go through loose romantic triangles and face death in peculiar ways.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nDIGOxHXLb0Am3GtYgGj6wWlQSn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:110899'),
  ('89134215402703075', 'Ziggy Stardust and the Spiders from Mars', 1983, 'Music', 'D. A. Pennebaker', null, 'David Bowie, Mick Ronson, Trevor Bolder, Mick Woodmansey, Ken Fordham, Brian Wilshaw, Geoffrey MacCormack, John Hutchinson', 'PG', 'Hammersmith Odeon, London, July 3, 1973. British singer David Bowie performs his alter ego Ziggy Stardust for the very last time. A decadent show, a hallucinogenic collage of kitsch, pop irony and flamboyant excess: a musical symbiosis of feminine passion and masculine dominance that defines Bowie''s art and the glam rock genre.', 'Hammersmith Odeon, London, July 3, 1973. British singer David Bowie performs his alter ego Ziggy Stardust for the very last time. A decadent show, a hallucinogenic collage of kitsch, pop irony and flamboyant excess: a musical symbiosis of feminine passion and masculine dominance that defines Bowie''s art and the glam rock genre.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dz4erM8bFxDjMpZmKLWKS6ryHER.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34759'),
  ('678488153949683600', 'Ziggy: Soreyuke! R&R Band', 1991, 'Animation, Music, Action', 'Akio Saito, Tsukasa Sunaga, Chuji Nakajima', 'Ryoe Tsukimura', 'Koji Tsujitani, Shigeru Nakahara, Nobuo Tobita, Osamu Kobayashi, Ai Orikasa, Aya Hisakawa, Yasunori Matsumoto, Jun Hazumi', null, 'Japanese rock band Ziggy comes to London and gets attacked upon arrival at the hotel after a recording session. The musicians barely escape the attack; however, soon they learn that their producer has been murdered, and they are the suspects! Chased by police and some mysterious organization, they find shelter at a local rockers'' place and even give a performance there; but it is not too long before their pursuers appear again.', 'Japanese rock band Ziggy comes to London and gets attacked upon arrival at the hotel after a recording session. The musicians barely escape the attack; however, soon they learn that their producer has been murdered, and they are the suspects! Chased by police and some mysterious organization, they find shelter at a local rockers'' place and even give a performance there; but it is not too long before their pursuers appear again.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4LrWR7Xq4wtmwLbFmu5nTh8jXVH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:683415'),
  ('788653853454048436', 'Ziggy''s Gift', 1982, 'Family, TV Movie, Animation, Comedy', 'Richard Williams, Eric Goldberg', 'Tom Wilson', 'John Gibbons, Tony Giorgio, David Arias, Tom McGreevey, Frank Welker, Richard Williams, Perry Botkin Jr., Katrina Fried', null, 'Ziggy gets a job to be a street Santa on Christmas Eve from a crooked boss, but the magic of the season allows the lovable loser to do more good than anyone expects.', 'Ziggy gets a job to be a street Santa on Christmas Eve from a crooked boss, but the magic of the season allows the lovable loser to do more good than anyone expects.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rYhrnjXu3jlyLOxamIOuRvZFAbn.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50742'),
  ('224342995049549072', 'Zigzag of Success', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Eldar Ryazanov, Fyodor Khitruk, Eduard Nazarov', 'Emil Braginskiy, Eldar Ryazanov', 'Evgeni Leonov, Irina Skobtseva, Valentina Talyzina, Evgeniy Evstigneev, Aleksei Gribov, Gotlib Roninson, Georgi Burkov, Valentina Telichkina', null, 'Photo studio "Contemporary" in a provincial town lives with its everyday problems. The director is concerned over the failure to fulfill the planned targets, receptionist Alevtina wants to get married, and photographer Vladimir Oreshnikov dreams of becoming a professional photographer. But suddenly luck smiles on Oreshnikov. He takes 20 rubles form the worker''s mutual aid fund, buys a government lottery bond and wins 10,000 rubles. Oreshnikov wants to receive the win himself, but his colleagues object to him, because the money that he spent on the bond were public, hence the win should be divided equally among all workers. It creates a controversial situation, which is successfully resolved on the very eve of the New Year, under the chiming clock...', 'Photo studio "Contemporary" in a provincial town lives with its everyday problems. The director is concerned over the failure to fulfill the planned targets, receptionist Alevtina wants to get married, and photographer Vladimir Oreshnikov dreams of becoming a professional photographer. But suddenly luck smiles on Oreshnikov. He takes 20 rubles form the worker''s mutual aid fund, buys a government lottery bond and wins 10,000 rubles. Oreshnikov wants to receive the win himself, but his colleagues object to him, because the money that he spent on the bond were public, hence the win should be divided equally among all workers. It creates a controversial situation, which is successfully resolved on the very eve of the New Year, under the chiming clock...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1QD12JLugolx9YLi7IFkxgL2Qd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:46588'),
  ('1143580725468252478', 'Zila Ghaziabad', 2013, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Anand Kumar, N K Ekambaram', 'Vinay Sharma', 'Sanjay Dutt, Arshad Warsi, Vivek Oberoi, Minissha Lamba, Ashutosh Kaushik, Sadat Pervez, Ravi Kishan, Charmy Kaur', null, 'In the city of Ghaziabad, gang war breaks between two rival groups led by Satbir Singh and Fauji. Thakur Pritam Singh, a corrupt police officer, is transferred to the city to handle the situation.', 'In the city of Ghaziabad, gang war breaks between two rival groups led by Satbir Singh and Fauji. Thakur Pritam Singh, a corrupt police officer, is transferred to the city to handle the situation.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gUAbhLz7IqztYs7kSTeaAR2qPoP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:168243'),
  ('1045354377398948827', 'Zillion', 2022, 'Drama, Crime, Thriller', 'Robin Pront, Robrecht Heyvaert', 'Robin Pront, Kevin Meul, Robin Pront', 'Jonas Vermeulen, Charlotte Timmers, Matteo Simoni, Barbara Sarafian, Frank Vercruyssen, Geert Van Rampelberg, Dirk Roofthooft, Koen De Sutter', null, 'It''s 1997. Frank Verstraeten, a computer genius with a nose for business, a fascination for nightlife and an unhealthy urge to prove himself, only wants one thing: his own disco that not only outperforms the competition but simply humiliates it. The futuristic mega discotheque Zillion is a fact and Frank turns from computer dealer to the pivotal figure of the Antwerp nightlife. He parades with the most beautiful women in Belgium and forges an alliance with Dennis Black Magic, the porn king who provides the spicy extras. Unfortunately, beautiful songs don''t last long either.', 'It''s 1997. Frank Verstraeten, a computer genius with a nose for business, a fascination for nightlife and an unhealthy urge to prove himself, only wants one thing: his own disco that not only outperforms the competition but simply humiliates it. The futuristic mega discotheque Zillion is a fact and Frank turns from computer dealer to the pivotal figure of the Antwerp nightlife. He parades with the most beautiful women in Belgium and forges an alliance with Dennis Black Magic, the porn king who provides the spicy extras. Unfortunately, beautiful songs don''t last long either.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ns7LIqVWrPbO2FYPQ0ec6mfziSc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:678870'),
  ('56033380565414431', 'Zimmer Feri', 1998, 'Comedy, Crime', 'Péter Tímár', 'Péter Tímár', 'Gábor Reviczky, Judit Pogány, József Szarvas, Natália Nagy, Vanda Kovács, Louranda Bird Abreu, Miklós Galla, Norbert Növényi', null, 'The 50 years old Ferenc rents an apartment on the Balaton beach, but it has a lot of debt on it. His plan is to make it profitable.', 'The 50 years old Ferenc rents an apartment on the Balaton beach, but it has a lot of debt on it. His plan is to make it profitable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Apaat3IVaaQJ1z5HRSe47zt0hgh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159582'),
  ('27405913462238585', 'Zincirbozan', 2007, 'Drama, Crime, History', 'Atıl İnaç, Gökhan Tiryaki', 'Avni Özgürel', 'Bülent Emin Yarar, Suavi Eren, Haldun Boysan, Suna Selen, Ayşe Tunaboylu, Ege Aydan, Emre Karayel, İsmail İncekara', null, 'The political drama "Zincirbozan" was written by journalist Avni Özgürel, and depicted the period between 1979 and 1983, the most tumultous years in the recent Turkish history. Zincirbozan shows a chronology of the most significant events in this period , such as the assassination of the famous journalist Abdi İpekçi, the escalating terrorism in the run up to the 1980 military coup, the futile attempts of politicians to stop the turmoil and terror on the streets, the military taking over the government, and the exiling of the political figures, and depicts the period with new insights into its less known aspects. The movie is named after the Zincirbozan military complex in the city of Çanakkale, where the leading politicans of the period were interned.', 'The political drama "Zincirbozan" was written by journalist Avni Özgürel, and depicted the period between 1979 and 1983, the most tumultous years in the recent Turkish history. Zincirbozan shows a chronology of the most significant events in this period , such as the assassination of the famous journalist Abdi İpekçi, the escalating terrorism in the run up to the 1980 military coup, the futile attempts of politicians to stop the turmoil and terror on the streets, the military taking over the government, and the exiling of the political figures, and depicts the period with new insights into its less known aspects. The movie is named after the Zincirbozan military complex in the city of Çanakkale, where the leading politicans of the period were interned.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8hjcNepji2rzlj2azBpK9PTQGLd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:52150'),
  ('564002931461178961', 'Zinda', 2006, 'Action, Thriller', 'Sanjay Gupta, Sanjay F. Gupta', 'Park Chan-wook', 'Sanjay Dutt, John Abraham, Lara Dutta, Celina Jaitly, Mahesh Manjrekar, Raj Zutshi, Alisha Baig, Nitin Raghani', null, 'After being held imprisoned in a room for 14 years, Balajeet Roy is suddenly released. Thereafter, he goes on a quest to look for the people who wronged him.', 'After being held imprisoned in a room for 14 years, Balajeet Roy is suddenly released. Thereafter, he goes on a quest to look for the people who wronged him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8dnHugvmE4CV2BLGHBcajmzBWpB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:20971'),
  ('225134284964971573', 'Zindagi Na Milegi Dobara', 2011, 'Drama, Comedy, Romance', 'Zoya Akhtar, Carlos Catalán, Stojan Petrov', 'Zoya Akhtar, Reema Kagti', 'Hrithik Roshan, Abhay Deol, Farhan Akhtar, Katrina Kaif, Kalki Koechlin, Naseeruddin Shah, Ariadna Cabrol, Deepti Naval', null, 'Three friends who were inseparable in childhood decide to go on a three-week-long bachelor road trip to Spain, in order to re-establish their bond and explore thrilling adventures, before one of them gets married. What will they learn of themselves and each other during the adventure?', 'Three friends who were inseparable in childhood decide to go on a three-week-long bachelor road trip to Spain, in order to re-establish their bond and explore thrilling adventures, before one of them gets married. What will they learn of themselves and each other during the adventure?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hKO9O715wYxjkQSEv47giCYcyO8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:61202'),
  ('837453891741523434', 'Zindy, the Swamp Boy', 1973, 'Drama, Action, Adventure', 'René Cardona Jr., Miguel Araña', 'Carlos Valdemar, René Cardona Jr.', 'René Cardona III, Lindy Fields, Chucho-Chucho, René Cardona, René Barrera, Gloria Chávez, René Figueroa', null, 'The story is about a fugitive who lives apart from society in a jungle area with the company of his grandson', 'The story is about a fugitive who lives apart from society in a jungle area with the company of his grandson', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2v6P2kobyavRkRAQHkOzBrWsa4A.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:117871'),
  ('527427766119168454', 'Zing', 2011, 'Animation, Fantasy', 'Cynthia Collins, Kyra Buschor', null, 'Katharina Dietschmann, Anselm Roser', null, 'Day in, day out, Mr. Grimm is busy with his job as the Reaper, harvesting people''s lives. One day, his monotonous existence is interrupted by the doorbell. It''s a little girl. She wants her cat back. Little does she know that she''s the next life on Mr. Grimm''s list.', 'Day in, day out, Mr. Grimm is busy with his job as the Reaper, harvesting people''s lives. One day, his monotonous existence is interrupted by the doorbell. It''s a little girl. She wants her cat back. Little does she know that she''s the next life on Mr. Grimm''s list.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sjzVJfmuGbmdd8ltLfPzuIjNj24.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:442849'),
  ('1017850831610217826', 'Zingo', 1998, 'Comedy', 'Henrik Jongdahl, Christjan Wegner, Matthew Allen', 'Santiago Gil', 'Björn Kjellman, Helena af Sandeberg, Per Morberg, Thomas Hellberg, Tommy Andersson, Jarmo Mäkinen, Madeleine Elfstrand, Hans Henriksson', null, 'A comedy about a young man with a tendency to screw things up. After years of unhealthy living he is looking for calm and rest. But first he has to deal with a drug-dealing debt. He teams up with his cousin, who has spent five years writing a film script, and turns into a film producer. One of the problems is that the German financiers expect a porn film...', 'A comedy about a young man with a tendency to screw things up. After years of unhealthy living he is looking for calm and rest. But first he has to deal with a drug-dealing debt. He teams up with his cousin, who has spent five years writing a film script, and turns into a film producer. One of the problems is that the German financiers expect a porn film...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h6r3RnFGWiOisVJ6lZ2lHc63Jw7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:35382'),
  ('287422425083806596', 'Zion', 2018, 'Documentary', 'Floyd Russ, Gregory J. Wilson', null, 'Zion Clark', null, 'A portrait of Zion Clark, a young wrestler who was born without legs and grew up in foster care.', 'A portrait of Zion Clark, a young wrestler who was born without legs and grew up in foster care.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/JAWGWp0WGRfxpObPAM1yp5akVp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:507389'),
  ('1032773628506550876', 'Zion', 2025, 'Thriller, Action', 'Martin Laugery, Nelson Foix, Laurent Cirany', 'Nelson Foix, Nicolas Peufaillit, Perrine Margaine', 'Sloan Decombes, Philippe Calodat, Cedrick Valier, Saint-Eloi Dominique, Axelle Delisle, Youri Christophe, Lucile Kancel, Anthony Castagne', null, 'In Guadeloupe, Chris divides his time between deals, one-night stands and motorcycle rodeos. Spotted by Odell, the boss of the neighboring neighborhood, Chris is entrusted with a risky delivery. Despite his best friend’s warning, he accepts the mission. But on the day of delivery, he discovers that a baby has been left at his door. Then begins for him, a hellish race which will lead him to a crucial choice…', 'In Guadeloupe, Chris divides his time between deals, one-night stands and motorcycle rodeos. Spotted by Odell, the boss of the neighboring neighborhood, Chris is entrusted with a risky delivery. Despite his best friend’s warning, he accepts the mission. But on the day of delivery, he discovers that a baby has been left at his door. Then begins for him, a hellish race which will lead him to a crucial choice…', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tNWgTWRc7TtkOQx9udS4lcazmxL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1119542'),
  ('690492620917938366', 'Zip ''n Snort', 1961, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Mel Blanc, Paul Julian', null, 'Wile E. Coyote tries to catch the Road Runner using a sling shot, a grenade in a toy airplane whose propeller detaches and leaves the plane behind.', 'Wile E. Coyote tries to catch the Road Runner using a sling shot, a grenade in a toy airplane whose propeller detaches and leaves the plane behind.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rX9AdUwQrZf5UGOmEQt9LIRTjLA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:234708'),
  ('933146275620110496', 'Zip & Zap and the Captain''s Island', 2016, 'Adventure, Comedy', 'Oskar Santos, Daniel Sosa Segura, Rosa Morales', 'Oskar Santos, Jorge Lara', 'Elena Anaya, Teo Planell, Toni Gómez, Iria Castellano, Goizalde Núñez, Fermí Reixach, Jorge Bosch, Carolina Lapausa', null, 'Naughty brothers Zip and Zap finds themselves in a home for lost children that might just be haunted. Will they ever escape?', 'Naughty brothers Zip and Zap finds themselves in a home for lost children that might just be haunted. Will they ever escape?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vqeO8ad4NfAziYvswcazTDyrxTY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:366499'),
  ('653637171881307050', 'Zip & Zap and the Marble Gang', 2013, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'Oskar Santos, Josu Inchaustegui', 'Francisco Roncal, Jorge Lara', 'Claudia Vega, Javier Gutiérrez, Álex Angulo, Marcos Ruiz, Santi Ugalde, Christian Mulas, Raúl Rivas, Daniel Cerezo', 'G', 'Mischevious twins Zip and Zap are placed in Esperanza, a school where games are prohibited. There, they found the Club of Marble, a resistance to challenge authority. Thanks to intelligence, courage, and unwavering faith in friendship, Zip, Zap and the club will discover a mysterious secret hidden deep in the school and live the most exciting adventure of their lives.', 'Mischevious twins Zip and Zap are placed in Esperanza, a school where games are prohibited. There, they found the Club of Marble, a resistance to challenge authority. Thanks to intelligence, courage, and unwavering faith in friendship, Zip, Zap and the club will discover a mysterious secret hidden deep in the school and live the most exciting adventure of their lives.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lFFnJ8ELKzuoDpBQQOab72uYPXj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:159774'),
  ('124271957354253370', 'Zipper', 2015, 'Thriller, Drama', 'Mora Stephens, Antonio Calvache', 'Mora Stephens, Joel Viertel', 'Patrick Wilson, Lena Headey, Richard Dreyfuss, Ray Winstone, John Cho, Dianna Agron, Elena Satine, Alexandra Breckenridge', 'R', 'Sam Ellis is a man on the rise — a hot-shot federal prosecutor on the cusp of a bright political future. But what was meant to be a one-time experience with an escort turns into a growing addiction — a new demon threatening to destroy his life, family, and career.', 'Sam Ellis is a man on the rise — a hot-shot federal prosecutor on the cusp of a bright political future. But what was meant to be a one-time experience with an escort turns into a growing addiction — a new demon threatening to destroy his life, family, and career.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qHQbXfdYhh3CRtIufoiD4AxPWi0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309503'),
  ('628927391370324555', 'Zipperface', 1992, 'Horror, Mystery, Thriller', 'F. Smith Martin, Mansour Pourmand, Valerie Finkel', 'Ralph Lucas, Barbara Bishop', 'Dona Adams, Jonathan Mandell, David Clover, Trisha Melynkov, Bruce Brown, Harold Cannon, Richard Vidan, Rikki Brando', null, 'Lisa Ryder is a young policewoman recently promoted to detective when she has her first case in tracking down and identifying a serial killer in her small California town.', 'Lisa Ryder is a young policewoman recently promoted to detective when she has her first case in tracking down and identifying a serial killer in her small California town.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/Z1hN8dd8YXDMb5ozdCgb9O2hj9.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101720'),
  ('811740124110280770', 'Zipping Along', 1953, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Paul Julian, Mel Blanc', 'NR', 'Hypnosis doesn''t help the Coyote catch the Road Runner, nor do a clutch of string-controlled rifles or dozens of mousetraps, but they all manage to backfire on him, naturally.', 'Hypnosis doesn''t help the Coyote catch the Road Runner, nor do a clutch of string-controlled rifles or dozens of mousetraps, but they all manage to backfire on him, naturally.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wYJkpmI4DNpihGEz2S9QBefRZLh.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118313'),
  ('1095237432023863501', 'Zitti e mosca', 1991, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Alessandro Benvenuti, Cristiano Pogany, Luigi Vallini', 'Alessandro Benvenuti, Ugo Chiti', 'Athina Cenci, Massimo Ghini, Alessandro Benvenuti, Novello Novelli, Mariella Di Lauro, Pina Cei, Alida Valli, Ughino Benci', null, 'In a small Tuscan village that''s waiting for the local festival to commence, amidst confusion about the fall of Communism, the lives of some dazed characters intertwine.', 'In a small Tuscan village that''s waiting for the local festival to commence, amidst confusion about the fall of Communism, the lives of some dazed characters intertwine.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vAW67qRiWE46qn5brsuCr1IMc3B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:154063'),
  ('737771162048102659', 'Žižek!', 2005, 'Documentary', 'Astra Taylor', 'Astra Taylor', 'Slavoj Žižek, Astra Taylor', null, 'ŽIŽEK! trails the thinker as he crisscrosses the globe, racing from New York City lecture halls, through the streets of Buenos Aires, and even stopping at home in Ljubljana, Slovenia. All the while Žižek obsessively reveals the invisible workings of ideology through his unique blend of Lacanian psychoanalysis, Marxism, and critique of pop culture.', 'ŽIŽEK! trails the thinker as he crisscrosses the globe, racing from New York City lecture halls, through the streets of Buenos Aires, and even stopping at home in Ljubljana, Slovenia. All the while Žižek obsessively reveals the invisible workings of ideology through his unique blend of Lacanian psychoanalysis, Marxism, and critique of pop culture.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uInmp8gcdIZksJJMTPIGDOE5MIM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16190'),
  ('691664537498043303', 'ZMD: Zombies of Mass Destruction', 2010, 'Horror', 'Kevin Hamedani, John Guleserian, Michael Ragen', 'Kevin Hamedani, Ramon Isao', 'Janette Armand, Doug Fahl, Cooper Hopkins, Russell Hodgkinson, Cornelia Moore, James Mesher, Bill Johns, Ali Hamedani', null, 'An idyllic peninsula town is under attack by that most invasive of pests: zombies! Port Gamble is being overrun with braineaters, and the people seem powerless to stave them off. But wait, a ragtag band of rebels is trying to turn the tide and push the invading hordes of undead back!', 'An idyllic peninsula town is under attack by that most invasive of pests: zombies! Port Gamble is being overrun with braineaters, and the people seem powerless to stave them off. But wait, a ragtag band of rebels is trying to turn the tide and push the invading hordes of undead back!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3K80OoyUb93qhx5jMUsNuKlV3IT.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34592'),
  ('1144788394537266498', 'Zoando na TV', 1999, 'Fantasy, Comedy, Family', 'José Alvarenga Jr.', 'Maria Carmem Barbosa, Mauro Wilson, José Alvarenga Jr.', 'Angélica, Márcio Garcia, Palomma Duarte, Danielle Winits, Nicette Bruno, Oscar Magrini, Bussunda, Miguel Falabella', null, 'Angel works in a wedding dress store. Ulisses, her boyfriend, works as personal trainer. They are swallowed for the television and, to leave, need to discover how to use the Ulisses'' ring.', 'Angel works in a wedding dress store. Ulisses, her boyfriend, works as personal trainer. They are swallowed for the television and, to leave, need to discover how to use the Ulisses'' ring.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4Y9rX4gsgeiXppnRuGTGDyUsPN4.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:129679'),
  ('791012736282813784', 'Zodi and Téhu: Princes of the Desert', 2023, 'Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Eric Barbier, Mobsitte Saad, Thierry Arbogast', 'Farid Lahouassa, Jennifer Devoldère, Eric Barbier', 'Yassir Drief, Alexandra Lamy, Youssef Hajdi, Said Bey, Antonythasan Jesuthasan, Pierre Hancisse, Nadia Benzakour, Amine Ennaji', null, 'Zodi, a 12 years old nomad, find an orphan baby dromedary in the desert. He takes in the animal, feeds it, calls it Téhu and becomes its best friend.', 'Zodi, a 12 years old nomad, find an orphan baby dromedary in the desert. He takes in the animal, feeds it, calls it Téhu and becomes its best friend.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rMzFkJflzwVhmAI6XfCDnt7hdMK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1000521'),
  ('1112647217058591981', 'Zodiac', 2007, 'Crime, Mystery, Thriller', 'Harris Savides, David Fincher, Sally Sue Beisel', 'James Vanderbilt', 'Jake Gyllenhaal, Mark Ruffalo, Anthony Edwards, Robert Downey Jr., Chloë Sevigny, Elias Koteas, John Carroll Lynch, Brian Cox', 'R', 'Over the course of a decade, editors of the San Francisco Chronicle entice themselves in the murders of the Zodiac Killer. However, as time runs its course, interest in the case dwindles in the eyes of the professionals. The Killer stops interacting with the public. However, believing he has the answers, an amateur cartoonist from the initial sightings races against time to prevent what he believes is another murder.', 'Over the course of a decade, editors of the San Francisco Chronicle entice themselves in the murders of the Zodiac Killer. However, as time runs its course, interest in the case dwindles in the eyes of the professionals. The Killer stops interacting with the public. However, believing he has the answers, an amateur cartoonist from the initial sightings races against time to prevent what he believes is another murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6YmeO4pB7XTh8P8F960O1uA14JO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1949'),
  ('365130013020425596', 'Zodiac', 2014, 'Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'W.D. Hogan, Anthony C. Metchie, Tim Sereda', 'David Sanderson', 'Joel Gretsch, Aaron Douglas, Reilly Dolman, Emily Holmes, Andrea Brooks, Ben Cotton, Christopher Lloyd, Doug Chapman', 'NR', 'Global disasters begin to occur after archaeologists unearth a 2,000-year-old astrology artifact. A rogue scientist is the key to deciphering the artifact to avert the end of the world.', 'Global disasters begin to occur after archaeologists unearth a 2,000-year-old astrology artifact. A rogue scientist is the key to deciphering the artifact to avert the end of the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sczgdIDuzYZqZOoQ29BRM3O5nU8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:285135'),
