  ('563982005526041180', 'Zoetrope', 1999, 'Science Fiction', 'James Hawkinson, Charlie Deaux', 'Charlie Deaux', 'Nigel Bonfield, Michael Bradley, Robert Deacon', null, 'Zoetrope is a haunting and surreal film set in an apocalyptic, decaying world. Based on Franz Kafka’s “In the Penal Colony”, a man is imprisoned for an unnamed crime and tortured by a nameless sadistic bureaucrat. As the chilling nightmare unfolds, the prisoner peels away the layers of his own metaphysical existence, inching ever closer to his inescapable fate.', 'Zoetrope is a haunting and surreal film set in an apocalyptic, decaying world. Based on Franz Kafka’s “In the Penal Colony”, a man is imprisoned for an unnamed crime and tortured by a nameless sadistic bureaucrat. As the chilling nightmare unfolds, the prisoner peels away the layers of his own metaphysical existence, inching ever closer to his inescapable fate.', null, 'tmdb:movie:46253'),
  ('487520804653223764', 'Zoey 102', 2023, 'Romance, Comedy', 'Nancy Hower, Jamie Snow', 'Madeline Whitby, Monica Sherer', 'Jamie Lynn Spears, Sean Flynn, Erin Sanders, Christopher Massey, Matthew Underwood, Abby Wilde, Dean Geyer, Owen Thiele', 'R', 'Pacific Coast Academy alumni return to Malibu for an over-the-top wedding that turns into a high school reunion for the books.', 'Pacific Coast Academy alumni return to Malibu for an over-the-top wedding that turns into a high school reunion for the books.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/liVS0KJMviz4iOfbrZkLqdCzBIp.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1073170'),
  ('1037588172033886355', 'Zoey''s Extraordinary Christmas', 2021, 'TV Movie, Comedy, Music, Drama', 'Richard Shepard', 'Austin Winsberg', 'Jane Levy, Skylar Astin, Alex Newell, John Clarence Stewart, Andrew Leeds, Alice Lee, Michael Thomas Grant, Kapil Talwalkar', 'PG-13', 'On her first holiday without her father, Zoey attempts to create a magical Christmas for her family just like the ones Mitch used to do.', 'On her first holiday without her father, Zoey attempts to create a magical Christmas for her family just like the ones Mitch used to do.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wDuQ4pX2FZe3tYdR4urm1HgGyXy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:872130'),
  ('857771623294427456', 'Zog and the Flying Doctors', 2021, 'Animation, Family, TV Movie, Fantasy', 'Sean Mullen', null, 'Lenny Henry, Patsy Ferran, Daniel Ings, Hugh Skinner, Alexandra Roach, Mark Bonnar, Lucian Msamati, Rob Brydon', null, 'Pearl and Gadabout are now a flying doctor trio, caring for creatures including a mermaid, a unicorn and a sneezy lion. However when bad weather forces them to land at the palace, Pearl is locked up by her uncle, the king.', 'Pearl and Gadabout are now a flying doctor trio, caring for creatures including a mermaid, a unicorn and a sneezy lion. However when bad weather forces them to land at the palace, Pearl is locked up by her uncle, the king.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aow2SrU1nKY1onSTjHhhLW8Ndd6.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:779611'),
  ('115449277321183783', 'Zola', 2021, 'Comedy, Crime, Drama', 'Eric Scott Williamson, Ricky R. Weaver, Mary Florence Brown', 'Janicza Bravo, Jeremy O. Harris', 'Taylour Paige, Riley Keough, Colman Domingo, Nicholas Braun, Ari''el Stachel, Nelcie Souffrant, Nasir Rahim, Jason Mitchell', 'R', 'A waitress agrees to accompany an exotic dancer, her put-upon boyfriend, and her mysterious and domineering roommate on a road trip to Florida to seek their fortune at a high-end strip club.', 'A waitress agrees to accompany an exotic dancer, her put-upon boyfriend, and her mysterious and domineering roommate on a road trip to Florida to seek their fortune at a high-end strip club.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bJLCPROp9bmNndurwZpVnOioVpB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:539565'),
  ('358570570077689399', 'Zom 100: Bucket List of the Dead', 2023, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Yusuke Ishida, Taro Kawazu, Yuji Shimomura', 'Tatsuro Mishima', 'Eiji Akaso, Mai Shiraishi, Shuntaro Yanagi, Kazuki Kitamura, Yui Ichikawa, Mayo Kawasaki, Akari Hayami, Yo Takahashi', 'R', 'Bullied by his boss, worked around the clock, he''s nothing more than a corporate drone. All it takes is a zombie outbreak for him to finally feel alive!', 'Bullied by his boss, worked around the clock, he''s nothing more than a corporate drone. All it takes is a zombie outbreak for him to finally feel alive!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hV5S6D56BPZ27FSaVEojkvViS3N.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1070514'),
  ('765481689605024860', 'Zombeavers', 2014, 'Horror, Action, Comedy', 'Dylan Matlock, Dave Halls, Jonathan Hall', 'Jordan Rubin, Jon Kaplan, Al Kaplan', 'Rachel Melvin, Cortney Palm, Lexi Atkins, Hutch Dano, Jake Weary, Peter Gilroy, Rex Linn, Brent Briscoe', 'NR', 'College friends find their weekend of sex and debauchery ruined when deadly zombie beavers swarm their riverside cabin.', 'College friends find their weekend of sex and debauchery ruined when deadly zombie beavers swarm their riverside cabin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gdb7v5GCfijrCjOjzbziGMGs6JA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:254474'),
  ('988926104997056922', 'Zombi Child', 2019, 'Fantasy, Horror, Drama', 'Ife Day, Barbara Canale, Bertrand Bonello', 'Bertrand Bonello', 'Louise Labèque, Wislanda Louimat, Katiana Milfort, Mackenson Bijou, Adilé David, Ninon François, Mathilde Riu, Ginite Popote', 'NR', 'Haiti, 1962: A man is brought back from the dead only to be sent to the living hell of the sugarcane fields. In Paris, 55 years later, at the prestigious Légion d’honneur boarding school, a Haitian girl confesses an old family secret to a group of new friends - never imagining that this strange tale will convince a heartbroken classmate to do the unthinkable.', 'Haiti, 1962: A man is brought back from the dead only to be sent to the living hell of the sugarcane fields. In Paris, 55 years later, at the prestigious Légion d’honneur boarding school, a Haitian girl confesses an old family secret to a group of new friends - never imagining that this strange tale will convince a heartbroken classmate to do the unthinkable.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hCm2mO44BRTGdUrnywzqHUJfNpM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554311'),
  ('275858941740068009', 'Zombie 108', 2012, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Joe Chien Jen-Hao, Yu-Tang Lin, Puck Tsai', 'Joe Chien Jen-Hao', 'Yvonne Yao Cai-Ying, Tai Bo, Jack Kao, Dennis To Yu-Hang, Chu Mu-Yen, Lena Lin, Joe Chien Jen-Hao, Jackson Liu', null, 'A virus gets loose in Taipei Army and SWAT teams oversee evacuation but in Ximending the gangs don''t want the police They attack the military but when both find themselves under attack by zombies there is an alliance as they try and escape.', 'A virus gets loose in Taipei Army and SWAT teams oversee evacuation but in Ximending the gangs don''t want the police They attack the military but when both find themselves under attack by zombies there is an alliance as they try and escape.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vcLGF45UpxEWzDTTgBUroJyZTUJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:119471'),
  ('719370057450322102', 'Zombie 90: Extreme Pestilence', 1991, 'Horror', 'Andreas Schnaas', 'Andreas Schnaas', 'Mathias Kerl, Ralf Hess, Marc Trinkhaus, Wolfgang Hinz, Christian Biallas', null, 'Two doctors are trying to stop a rampant epidemic of zombieism. They fend off zombies spilling many a gallon of blood in the process.', 'Two doctors are trying to stop a rampant epidemic of zombieism. They fend off zombies spilling many a gallon of blood in the process.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pleREieQYbtILB0t1uRnjyYoild.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:192186'),
  ('1000012483106176626', 'Zombie and the Ghost Train', 1991, 'Drama, Comedy, Music', 'Mika Kaurismäki, Olli Varja, Pauli Pentti', 'Mika Kaurismäki', 'Silu Seppälä, Marjo Leinonen, Matti Pellonpää, Vieno Saaristo, Juhani Niemelä, Kauko Laurikainen, Sakke Järvenpää, Mato Valtonen', null, 'Antti "Zombie" Autiomaa does two things well: play the bass guitar and drink. After several months'' sleeping on the streets of Istanbul, he returns to Helsinki where he''s called into the army but discharged on mental health grounds after adding turpentine to the officers'' soup. Zombie lives bleary-eyed in an apartment off his parents'' house where his lonely, unemployed father suffers from heart disease. His girl-friend Marjo has taken up with a hairdresser but comes back to Zombie. His friend Harri hires him as a roadie for his band "Harry and the Mulefukkers" then gives him a chance as a bass player. He has his girl and he has a gig, but can Zombie put the bottle down?', 'Antti "Zombie" Autiomaa does two things well: play the bass guitar and drink. After several months'' sleeping on the streets of Istanbul, he returns to Helsinki where he''s called into the army but discharged on mental health grounds after adding turpentine to the officers'' soup. Zombie lives bleary-eyed in an apartment off his parents'' house where his lonely, unemployed father suffers from heart disease. His girl-friend Marjo has taken up with a hairdresser but comes back to Zombie. His friend Harri hires him as a roadie for his band "Harry and the Mulefukkers" then gives him a chance as a bass player. He has his girl and he has a gig, but can Zombie put the bottle down?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5NUu1VycRGipz8dZxSUVeE2UFfD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60409'),
  ('493049908107957542', 'Zombie Apocalypse', 2011, 'Action, Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'Nick Lyon, Christopher Ray', 'Brooks Peck, Craig Eagle', 'Ving Rhames, Taryn Manning, Johnny Pacar, Lesley-Ann Brandt, Gary Weeks, Gerald Webb, Eddie Steeples, Anya Monzikova', 'R', 'Months after a zombie plague has wiped out 90 percent of the American population, a small group of survivors fight their way cross-country to a rumored refuge on the island of Catalina.', 'Months after a zombie plague has wiped out 90 percent of the American population, a small group of survivors fight their way cross-country to a rumored refuge on the island of Catalina.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vaOFYHJns2S3aOMTGNeJs49QNBN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:75735'),
  ('276971512665715810', 'Zombie Ass: Toilet of the Dead', 2012, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Noboru Iguchi, Yasutaka Nagano', 'Noboru Iguchi, Ao Murata, Jun Tsugita', 'Arisa Nakamura, Mayu Sugano, Asana Mamoru, Yûki, Danny, Kentaro Kishi, Demo Tanaka, Asami', 'NR', 'Wracked with guilt over her younger sister''s suicide, pretty young karate student Megumi accompanies a group of older friends on a camping trip into the woods, where they''re attacked by feces covered undead.', 'Wracked with guilt over her younger sister''s suicide, pretty young karate student Megumi accompanies a group of older friends on a camping trip into the woods, where they''re attacked by feces covered undead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sKJ1uRFB8eFUD40uVOqGl9MXAoY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:101733'),
  ('354178577896009698', 'Zombie Bloodbath', 1993, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Todd Sheets, Jerry Angell', 'Todd Sheets, Roger Williams', 'Chris Harris, Auggi Alvarez, Frank Dunlay, Jerry Angell, Cathy Metz, Cheryl Metz, Tonia Monahan, Jody Rovick', 'NR', 'A meltdown at a nuclear power plant turns a bunch of folks into lethal shambling flesh-eating zombies who go on a gory rampage.', 'A meltdown at a nuclear power plant turns a bunch of folks into lethal shambling flesh-eating zombies who go on a gory rampage.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hmIKJvHVPGJ0gmZXfM1ADDe38KH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27877'),
  ('689495459572467520', 'Zombie Brigade', 1988, 'Horror, Drama, Fantasy, Thriller, Science Fiction, War', 'Barrie Pattison, Carmelo Musca', 'Carmelo Musca, Barrie Pattison', 'John Moore, Khym Lam, Geoffrey Gibbs, Leslie Wright, Ian Paul Cassidy, Robert Faggetter, Adam A. Wong, Michael Fuller', null, 'When an amusement park is built on the grounds of an old cemetery, the dead rise to take revenge.', 'When an amusement park is built on the grounds of an old cemetery, the dead rise to take revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3TB1iSzIGgHsIjX4qrinZCN2mpi.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:209182'),
  ('980129089757631062', 'Zombie Cop', 1991, 'Horror, Action, Comedy', 'J.R. Bookwalter, J.R. Bookwalter', 'Matthew Jason Walsh', 'Michael Kemper, Ken Jarosz, James Black, Bill Morrison, James L. Edwards, Christina M. Bookwalter, Bogdan Pecic, Scott P. Plummer', 'NR', 'During a drug raid, a narcotics officer confronts a strange Voodoo priest named Dr. Death, who is chanting. The officer and the priest shoot it out and they both wind up dead. Later, the two rise from their graves and return to the land of the living as zombies. Dr. Death is resurrected with a new mission in mind, to take over the world. The "zombie" cop enlists the aid of his old police buddies to stop the mad priest.', 'During a drug raid, a narcotics officer confronts a strange Voodoo priest named Dr. Death, who is chanting. The officer and the priest shoot it out and they both wind up dead. Later, the two rise from their graves and return to the land of the living as zombies. Dr. Death is resurrected with a new mission in mind, to take over the world. The "zombie" cop enlists the aid of his old police buddies to stop the mad priest.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rdbAegstb52EyRcuMgjgB4cxJW7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:68306'),
  ('789059096882703674', 'Zombie Dawn', 2012, 'Horror, War', 'Lucio A. Rojas, Cristian Toledo, Nicolás Ugarte', 'Cristian Toledo', 'Sebastián Accorsi, Guillermo Alfaro, Martin Bohte, Felipe Lobos, Jorge Magni, Cristian Ramos, Pamela Rojas, Ignacia Uribe', null, '2006, a mysterious mining accident in a remote territory unleashes an unspeakable horror that creates a zombie horde with an appetite for human flesh. It decimates large portions of the country. The only course of action is to rapidly enclose the infected areas and seal them off from the rest of the remaining, living population. NOW. 15 years later the tattered remains of the government and the mining corporation responsible where the initial event took place commit themselves to finding out what may have happened at the mining complex. The solution is to send in a group of mercenaries and scientists into the quarantined zone to find answers.', '2006, a mysterious mining accident in a remote territory unleashes an unspeakable horror that creates a zombie horde with an appetite for human flesh. It decimates large portions of the country. The only course of action is to rapidly enclose the infected areas and seal them off from the rest of the remaining, living population. NOW. 15 years later the tattered remains of the government and the mining corporation responsible where the initial event took place commit themselves to finding out what may have happened at the mining complex. The solution is to send in a group of mercenaries and scientists into the quarantined zone to find answers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fF3qExqCBpfm2O5JQqx6pWwxQ7B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:106634'),
  ('1128255987450168764', 'Zombie Death House', 1988, 'Drama, Horror, Science Fiction', 'John Saxon', 'Kate Wittcomb, William Selby, Devin Frazer', 'Dennis Cole, Anthony Franciosa, John Saxon, Tane McClure, Ron O''Neal, Michael Pataki, Salvatore Richichi, Dana Lis Mason', 'NR', 'A renegade federal agent uses a new drug to create an army of unbeatable warriors.', 'A renegade federal agent uses a new drug to create an army of unbeatable warriors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/z6QEnt5ZKz3pzjpI3GgR9oQ4W40.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30377'),
  ('175686619791017198', 'Zombie Farm', 2009, 'Horror', 'Ricardo Islas', 'Ricardo Islas', 'Adriana Cataño, Rosa Isela Frausto, Karla Garcia, Eduardo Ibarrola, Nair Kuzmik, Eugene Kwarteng, Roberto Montesinos, Monika Munoz', null, 'A small town in the South is terrorized when Zombies and Voodoo collide.', 'A small town in the South is terrorized when Zombies and Voodoo collide.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5GxvZeG8LVYhD12iRAykEWjGDhE.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:62714'),
  ('740959626626856404', 'Zombie Fight Club', 2014, 'Action, Horror', 'Joe Chien Jen-Hao, Yu-Tang Lin', 'Joe Chien Jen-Hao', 'Andy On Chi-Kit, Jessica Cambensy, Jack Kao, Michael Wong, Terence Yin Chi-Wai, Abby Fung, MC Hotdog, Derek Tsang Kwok-Cheung', null, 'It''s the end of the century at a corner of the city in a building riddled with crime - Everyone in the building has turned into zombies. After Jenny''s boyfriend is killed in a zombie attack, she faces the challenge of surviving in the face of adversity. In order to stay alive, she struggles with Andy to flee danger.', 'It''s the end of the century at a corner of the city in a building riddled with crime - Everyone in the building has turned into zombies. After Jenny''s boyfriend is killed in a zombie attack, she faces the challenge of surviving in the face of adversity. In order to stay alive, she struggles with Andy to flee danger.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oAk3sPcDYiDfsiQv8bPzntv4s8f.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:289732'),
  ('753852118765460775', 'Zombie Flesh Eaters', 1979, 'Horror', 'Lucio Fulci, Sergio Salvati, Roberto Giandalia', 'Elisa Briganti', 'Tisa Farrow, Ian McCulloch, Richard Johnson, Olga Karlatos, Al Cliver, Auretta Gay, Stefania D''Amario, Ugo Bologna', 'R', 'After an abandoned boat sails into New York harbor with a zombie aboard, a reporter teams up with the daughter of the boat''s missing owner to investigate the island where he was last seen conducting research—the site of an alleged zombie outbreak.', 'After an abandoned boat sails into New York harbor with a zombie aboard, a reporter teams up with the daughter of the boat''s missing owner to investigate the island where he was last seen conducting research—the site of an alleged zombie outbreak.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jc17a3PqDnQeBzT7GbK0dp8TDvx.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:7219'),
  ('527138378424654182', 'Zombie Flesh Eaters 2', 1988, 'Horror, Action, Science Fiction', 'Lucio Fulci, Claudio Fragasso, Riccardo Grassetti', 'Rossella Drudi, Claudio Fragasso', 'Deran Sarafian, Beatrice Ring, Ottaviano Dell''Acqua, Massimo Vanni, Ulli Reinthaler, Marina Loi, Deborah Bergamini, Luciano Pigozzi', 'R', 'When a terrorist''s body, infected with a stolen chemical, is recovered by the US military, the corpse is cremated, unintentionally releasing a virus and bacteria into the atmosphere over a small island.', 'When a terrorist''s body, infected with a stolen chemical, is recovered by the US military, the corpse is cremated, unintentionally releasing a virus and bacteria into the atmosphere over a small island.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wrDsu509h1gIZdtna9rmpGaOLdy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:34814'),
  ('389144944229829303', 'Zombie for Sale', 2019, 'Comedy, Horror, Drama', 'Lee Gil-gyu, Lee Min-jae, Cho Hyoung-rae', 'Jeong Seo-in, Lee Min-jae', 'Jung Jae-young, Kim Nam-gil, Uhm Ji-won, Lee Soo-kyung, Jung Ga-ram, Park In-hwan, Shin Jung-keun, Kim Ki-cheon', null, 'When a pharmaceutical company''s illegal experiments inadvertently create a zombie, the strange Park family finds it and tries to profit from it.', 'When a pharmaceutical company''s illegal experiments inadvertently create a zombie, the strange Park family finds it and tries to profit from it.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/62WZ0RkSwTakEf0fPEy4ai5VXlX.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:572151'),
  ('266067147427413268', 'Zombie High', 1987, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Ron Link, David Lux, Brian Coyne', 'Aziz Ghazal, Elizabeth Passarelli, Tim Doyle', 'Virginia Madsen, Richard Cox, James Wilder, Sherilyn Fenn, Paul Feig, Scott Coffey, Paul Williams, Henry Sutton', 'R', 'A freshman begins to notice that students at her new school are losing their individuality. She discovers that the faculty are operating on the students'' brains to make them docile and productive.', 'A freshman begins to notice that students at her new school are losing their individuality. She discovers that the faculty are operating on the students'' brains to make them docile and productive.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/a49DawYmrilzmSITTozQWoG2yQm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:55539'),
  ('538194138752230573', 'Zombie Honeymoon', 2004, 'Horror', 'David Gebroe', 'David Gebroe', 'Tracy Coogan, Graham Sibley, Tonya Cornelisse, David M. Wallace, Neal Jones, Maria Iadonisi, Louis Fattell, Nate Meyer', null, 'Zombie Honeymoon is a gore-soaked exploration of how far the boundaries of true love can be pushed without reaching a breaking point.', 'Zombie Honeymoon is a gore-soaked exploration of how far the boundaries of true love can be pushed without reaching a breaking point.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/uy1SqoVGXuH8G9QfMaeU9ZgqNv3.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25060'),
  ('348840377590545770', 'Zombie Hunter', 2013, 'Comedy, Action, Science Fiction, Thriller', 'Kevin King', 'Kevin King, Kurt Knight', 'Martin Copping, Clare Niederpruem, Jade Regier, Danny Trejo, Terry Guthrie, Jake Suazo, Jason K. Wixom, Jeff Kirkham', 'NR', 'When a street drug turns junkies into an army of zombies, a man named Hunter finds himself with nothing but a beat-up car and a trunk full of guns and booze, until he stumbles across a small band of survivors.', 'When a street drug turns junkies into an army of zombies, a man named Hunter finds himself with nothing but a beat-up car and a trunk full of guns and booze, until he stumbles across a small band of survivors.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9FkPEWRpuMbOArFrklObdvxN099.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:206213'),
  ('670942379984704777', 'Zombie Hunter Rika', 2008, 'Horror, Comedy, Action', 'Ken''ichi Fujiwara', 'Ken''ichi Fujiwara', 'Risa Kudo, Tsugumi Nagasawa, Mina Arai, Lemon Hanazawa, Kôtarô Kamijô, Ryunosuke Kawai, Eiichi Kikuchi, Kêsuke', null, 'When typical Japanese high school student Rika skips school to visit her grandfather, she fails to take into account the fact that his remote village is infested with the living dead.', 'When typical Japanese high school student Rika skips school to visit her grandfather, she fails to take into account the fact that his remote village is infested with the living dead.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jn25dGdIc9gQ1Lm4WV4lhAjx1Ph.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27880'),
  ('675610348706412335', 'Zombie Island Massacre', 1984, 'Horror', 'Sara Hyde Hamlet, Dwight Williams, Harvey Portee', 'William Stoddard, Logan O’Neill', 'David Broadnax, Rita Jenrette, George Peters, Debbie Ewing, Ralph Monaco, Tom Fitzsimmons, Tom Cantrell, Diane Clayre Holub', 'R', 'Americans on vacation in the Caribbean take a tour of a nearby island at night and watch a local voodoo ritual. Soon after, they find themselves stranded on the island and under attack by unseen foes. One by one they meet violent ends.', 'Americans on vacation in the Caribbean take a tour of a nearby island at night and watch a local voodoo ritual. Soon after, they find themselves stranded on the island and under attack by unseen foes. One by one they meet violent ends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xuxXePMmZ7Xptepi7jtx0w04MLD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:27881'),
  ('306960295461800571', 'Zombie Lake', 1981, 'Horror', 'Jean Rollin, Max Monteillet, Julian de Laserna', 'Jesús Franco', 'Howard Vernon, Pierre-Marie Escourrou, Anouchka, Nadine Pascal, Antonio Mayans, Youri Radionow, Marcia Sharif, Yvonne Dany', null, 'In a small village, somewhere in France, German soldiers, killed and thrown into the lake by the Resistance during WWII, come back.', 'In a small village, somewhere in France, German soldiers, killed and thrown into the lake by the Resistance during WWII, come back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ui0yDzDLKVB3dQnZoy59RXCgsTc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:22130'),
  ('1084026435124453799', 'Zombie Massacre', 2013, 'Action, Horror', 'Marco Ristori, Luca Boni', 'Luca Boni, Marco Ristori', 'Christian Boeving, Mike Mitchell, Tara Cardinal, Ivy Corbin, Carl Wharton, Jon Campling, Daniel Vivian, Gerry Shanahan', null, 'A bacteriological weapon developed by the US Government to create a super soldier - spreads an epidemic in a quiet little town in the middle of Eastern Europe. All citizens have been turned into infected zombies. The plan is to bring an atomic bomb into the city''s nuclear plant to pretend a terrible accident occurred. No one has to know the truth. A team of mercenaries is hired to complete the mission. The battle is on. Hordes of monsters against the team. Who will survive?', 'A bacteriological weapon developed by the US Government to create a super soldier - spreads an epidemic in a quiet little town in the middle of Eastern Europe. All citizens have been turned into infected zombies. The plan is to bring an atomic bomb into the city''s nuclear plant to pretend a terrible accident occurred. No one has to know the truth. A team of mercenaries is hired to complete the mission. The battle is on. Hordes of monsters against the team. Who will survive?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iVAuzh1gMuqjCuLBaGajY4lAsgL.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:153509'),
  ('830120392390200602', 'Zombie Nation', 2004, 'Horror', 'Ulli Lommel, Christian Behm', 'Ulli Lommel', 'Gunter Ziegler, Brandon Dean, Axel Montgomery, Phil Lander, David Hess, Ulli Lommel, Carsten Frank, Jed Rowen', 'R', 'A psycho cop has a habit for pulling over random women and taking them to an abandoned warehouse, where he tortures and kills them. He gets what''s coming to him when a pack of zombie women rise from their graves in order to get proper revenge.', 'A psycho cop has a habit for pulling over random women and taking them to an abandoned warehouse, where he tortures and kills them. He gets what''s coming to him when a pack of zombie women rise from their graves in order to get proper revenge.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ytseovnJpFlHkLZVlfOk67OrsBv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:25061'),
  ('134549335406129729', 'Zombie Night', 2013, 'Horror', 'John Gulager, Christopher Ray', 'Keith Allan, Delondra Williams', 'Daryl Hannah, Anthony Michael Hall, Rachel Fox, Alan Ruck, Shirley Jones, Jennifer Bini Taylor, Tia Robinson, Zoe Canner', 'NR', 'Zombies come out at night and two families must survive until morning.', 'Zombies come out at night and two families must survive until morning.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iS1tYFialjnYQ1pDLYN7gX3TG0J.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:219247'),
  ('930199767489095874', 'Zombie Nightmare', 1987, 'Horror', 'Jack Bravman, Roger Racine, John Fasano', 'David Wellington', 'Adam West, Jon Mikl Thor, Tia Carrere, Manuska Rigaud, Frank Dietz, Linda Singer, Tony Blauer, Mark Kulik', 'R', 'Tony Washington is killed in a hit-and-run after saving the local bodega clerk from robbers. Molly Mokembe is a Haitian voodou practitioner who brings him back as a zombi from a debt owed by Tony''s late dad in an act of sacrifice that saved her. Jimbo, the kid that iced Tony, is embracing some new sadistic feelings. What follows is a revenge that can only be sated once all of those who were with Jimbo that night have had their due.', 'Tony Washington is killed in a hit-and-run after saving the local bodega clerk from robbers. Molly Mokembe is a Haitian voodou practitioner who brings him back as a zombi from a debt owed by Tony''s late dad in an act of sacrifice that saved her. Jimbo, the kid that iced Tony, is embracing some new sadistic feelings. What follows is a revenge that can only be sated once all of those who were with Jimbo that night have had their due.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4jC4ghLWYnnmh5auuY0Hj90288c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:31385'),
  ('90223234511868767', 'Zombie Self-Defense Force', 2006, 'Horror', 'Naoyuki Tomomatsu, Mitsuaki Fujimoto', 'Naoyuki Tomomatsu, Chisato Ōgawara', 'Miyû Watase, Jun Yamasaki, Mihiro, Kenji Arai, Dai Asaki, Norman England, Yuka Kojima, Yusuke Miura', 'NR', 'When a UFO crashes and releases radiation, the dead begin to rise in a cannibalistic frenzy. A group of soldiers and civilians make their way to a hotel and must fend off the zombie hordes.', 'When a UFO crashes and releases radiation, the dead begin to rise in a cannibalistic frenzy. A group of soldiers and civilians make their way to a hotel and must fend off the zombie hordes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/k92d0KtpULqzQ2NFLvEb8V4IjMS.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16785'),
  ('267483524968922900', 'Zombie Shark', 2015, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie, Action', 'Lynnette M. Myers, Adam Darragh, Sean O''Regan', 'Greg Mitchell', 'Cassie Steele, Jason London, Laura Cayouette, Roger J. Timber, Ross Britz, Sloane Coe, Becky Andrews, Ladson Deyne', null, 'A perfect getaway weekend turns into a nightmare for four friends who find themselves fighting for their lives against an experimental shark. In order to survive they must fight sharks, zombies, and shark zombies.', 'A perfect getaway weekend turns into a nightmare for four friends who find themselves fighting for their lives against an experimental shark. In order to survive they must fight sharks, zombies, and shark zombies.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/agGwR9RRScBS7DwBg4SU81tzvud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:347849'),
  ('654960733751484146', 'Zombie Strippers!', 2008, 'Comedy, Horror, Science Fiction', 'Jay Lee, Jay Lee, Dennis McHugh', 'Jay Lee', 'Jenna Jameson, Robert Englund, Roxy Saint, John T. Woods, Penny Drake, Whitney Anderson, Jennifer Holland, Shamron Moore', 'R', 'In the not too distant future a secret government re-animation chemo-virus gets released into conservative Sartre, Nebraska and lands in an underground strip club. As the virus begins to spread, turning the strippers into "Super Zombie Strippers" the girls struggle with whether or not to conform to the new "fad" even if it means there''s no turning back.', 'In the not too distant future a secret government re-animation chemo-virus gets released into conservative Sartre, Nebraska and lands in an underground strip club. As the virus begins to spread, turning the strippers into "Super Zombie Strippers" the girls struggle with whether or not to conform to the new "fad" even if it means there''s no turning back.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iQcOzXCpewM9pbEwLoIrHLjpMvB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:13009'),
  ('641815168012031491', 'Zombie Tidal Wave', 2019, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, Horror, Thriller', 'Eric Gustavo Petersen, Anthony C. Ferrante', 'Darby Parker, Josh LeBlanc, Anthony C. Ferrante', 'Ian Ziering, Erich Chikashi Linzbichler, Shelton Jolivette, Cheree Cassidy, Tatum Chiniquy, Angie Teodora Dick, Randy Charach, Eliza Matengu', null, 'A fisherman contends with an ocean-borne outbreak that threatens his seaside island community.', 'A fisherman contends with an ocean-borne outbreak that threatens his seaside island community.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bdlWPVFMsBchv07HxF2khcdCEwZ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:623464'),
  ('79944655029187857', 'Zombie Town', 2023, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Rudolf Blahacek, Peter Lepeniotis', 'Michael Schwartz, Dean Wilkinson, Michael Samonek', 'Chevy Chase, Dan Aykroyd, Henry Czerny, Brenna Coates, Bruce McCulloch, Scott Thompson, Madi Monroe, Marlon Kazadi', 'PG-13', 'Amy and Mike unearth a centuries-old curse when they decide to watch an exclusive film reel. The duo must track down an infamous filmmaker and navigate a town of hungry zombies to save the world.', 'Amy and Mike unearth a centuries-old curse when they decide to watch an exclusive film reel. The duo must track down an infamous filmmaker and navigate a town of hungry zombies to save the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hzPVOPGWoWUuaZbE2QLRcL0SAPR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1019444'),
  ('1101655082842924965', 'Zombie vs. Ninja', 1987, 'Horror, Action, Comedy', 'Lee Chiu, Raymond Chang', 'Godfrey Ho', 'Pierre Kirby, Edowan Bersma, Yong Wan, Kim Wuk, Ryong Wang, Patrick Frzebar, Elton Jeong Jin-Hwa, Dewey Bosworth', null, 'Ethan, a young man, is beaten while his father is killed by a group of thieves. With the help of an undertaker, Ethan trains in kung fu by fighting the dead. Meanwhile, an American Ninja, Dragon, must fend off against the thieves and their ninja henchmen. It is soon that Dragon and Ethan team up to defeat the thieves and the ninjas. Hong Kong cut and paste edit of the 1983 Korean Horror Martial Arts Film "소화성 장의사" (The Undertaker in Sohwa Province) with new ninja scenes.', 'Ethan, a young man, is beaten while his father is killed by a group of thieves. With the help of an undertaker, Ethan trains in kung fu by fighting the dead. Meanwhile, an American Ninja, Dragon, must fend off against the thieves and their ninja henchmen. It is soon that Dragon and Ethan team up to defeat the thieves and the ninjas. Hong Kong cut and paste edit of the 1983 Korean Horror Martial Arts Film "소화성 장의사" (The Undertaker in Sohwa Province) with new ninja scenes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/o819Hj9P1FpjVKoTHMVqoKueGcG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:36209'),
  ('548497747479185459', 'Zombie Wars', 2007, 'Horror', 'David A. Prior, John-Michael Thomas', 'David A. Prior', 'Adam Mayfield, Alissa Koenig, Jim Hazelton, Kristi Pearce, Jack Forcinito, Wendy Valdez, Joslyn Kramer', null, 'Fifty years after a world-wide zombie epidemic had begun, a small group of rebel soldiers learn that intelligent zombies have begun breeding humans for food. The soldiers plan an all-out war to rid the Earth of the flesh-eating monsters for good, as the rest of the surviving world''s population struggles to survive against the zombie hordes.', 'Fifty years after a world-wide zombie epidemic had begun, a small group of rebel soldiers learn that intelligent zombies have begun breeding humans for food. The soldiers plan an all-out war to rid the Earth of the flesh-eating monsters for good, as the rest of the surviving world''s population struggles to survive against the zombie hordes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/epObbHTtsXfCpJSlXyax0x51u1B.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28602'),
  ('588208223207834756', 'Zombieland', 2009, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Ruben Fleischer, G.A. Aguilar, Heather Wusterbarth', 'Rhett Reese, Paul Wernick', 'Jesse Eisenberg, Woody Harrelson, Emma Stone, Abigail Breslin, Amber Heard, Bill Murray, Derek Graf, Elle Alexander', 'R', 'Columbus has made a habit of running from what scares him. Tallahassee doesn''t have fears. If he did, he''d kick their ever-living ass. In a world overrun by zombies, these two are perfectly evolved survivors. But now, they''re about to stare down the most terrifying prospect of all: each other.', 'Columbus has made a habit of running from what scares him. Tallahassee doesn''t have fears. If he did, he''d kick their ever-living ass. In a world overrun by zombies, these two are perfectly evolved survivors. But now, they''re about to stare down the most terrifying prospect of all: each other.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dUkAmAyPVqubSBNRjRqCgHggZcK.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19908'),
  ('915882926571422121', 'Zombieland: Double Tap', 2019, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Ruben Fleischer, Paul D. Kelly, Chung Chung-hoon', 'David Callaham, Rhett Reese, Paul Wernick', 'Woody Harrelson, Jesse Eisenberg, Emma Stone, Abigail Breslin, Zoey Deutch, Avan Jogia, Rosario Dawson, Luke Wilson', 'R', 'Columbus, Tallahassee, Wichita, and Little Rock move to the American heartland as they face off against evolved zombies, fellow survivors, and the growing pains of the snarky makeshift family.', 'Columbus, Tallahassee, Wichita, and Little Rock move to the American heartland as they face off against evolved zombies, fellow survivors, and the growing pains of the snarky makeshift family.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dtRbVsUb5O12WWO54SRpiMtHKC0.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:338967'),
  ('44703707231538868', 'Zombiepura', 2018, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Jacen Tan, Amandi Wong', 'Jacen Tan', 'Benjamin Heng, Alaric Tay, Richard Low, Joey Pink Lai, Rayve Tay, Haresh Tilani, Crispian Chan, Chen Xiuhuan', null, 'When a mysterious virus breaks out in an isolated army camp, a lazy reservist soldier and his tough commander must work together to survive, and learn what it means to be real soldiers.', 'When a mysterious virus breaks out in an isolated army camp, a lazy reservist soldier and his tough commander must work together to survive, and learn what it means to be real soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1Gqc6PQbQyGI8GwcnAuHhnRJ5Cq.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:554647'),
  ('274887688282823149', 'Zombies', 2016, 'Horror, Action, Thriller, Mystery', 'Hamid Torabpour', 'Hamid Torabpour', 'Amanda Day, Raina Hein, Tony Todd, Heidi Fellner, Ava Acres, Aundrea Smith, Steven Luke, Amber Rhodes', null, 'When the world is in shambles, plagued by a zombie outbreak, only the strong will survive, but just how much determination will it take? Will Luke and his crew have enough ambition and ammunition to stay alive long enough to save the human race?', 'When the world is in shambles, plagued by a zombie outbreak, only the strong will survive, but just how much determination will it take? Will Luke and his crew have enough ambition and ammunition to stay alive long enough to save the human race?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9DKBXrxD4K3TJlH76bJ8IEtbOqN.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472876'),
  ('922585936549416879', 'Zombies of Mora Tau', 1957, 'Adventure, Horror', 'Edward L. Cahn, Benjamin H. Kline', 'Bernard Gordon', 'Gregg Palmer, Autumn Russell, Marjorie Eaton, Joel Ashley, Allison Hayes, Morris Ankrum, Gene Roth, Karl ''Killer'' Davis', null, 'A fortune hunter leads a search for diamonds guarded by undead sailors off the coast of Africa.', 'A fortune hunter leads a search for diamonds guarded by undead sailors off the coast of Africa.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y5lqz0pzqN4wTpeemzqqmJDxsVA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38120'),
  ('816054483207954280', 'Zombies of the Stratosphere', 1952, 'Science Fiction', 'Fred C. Brannon', 'Ronald Davidson', 'Judd Holdren, Aline Towne, Lane Bradford, Stanley Waxman, Wilson Wood, John Crawford, Ray Boyle, Leonard Nimoy', null, 'Martians come to Earth to build an H-bomb strong enough to blast Earth out of orbit so that Mars can be moved into its place in closer proximity to the sun. Super-scientist Larry Martin, inventor of the first stratospheric-flight spaceship as well as a jet-powered personal flying suit with helmet, is called upon by the government to investigate ramped-up UFO reports occasioned by the Martians'' spaceships. The Martians, meanwhile, led by Marex, engage a renegade earth scientist and a gaggle of gangsters to help them steal supplies, operate a menacing robot, and build their bomb. This movie serial in 12 chapters was originally planned as a sequel to "Radar Men From The Moon" with Commando Cody as the hero but at the last moment the main characters'' names were changed and all other references to that serial removed from the script.', 'Martians come to Earth to build an H-bomb strong enough to blast Earth out of orbit so that Mars can be moved into its place in closer proximity to the sun. Super-scientist Larry Martin, inventor of the first stratospheric-flight spaceship as well as a jet-powered personal flying suit with helmet, is called upon by the government to investigate ramped-up UFO reports occasioned by the Martians'' spaceships. The Martians, meanwhile, led by Marex, engage a renegade earth scientist and a gaggle of gangsters to help them steal supplies, operate a menacing robot, and build their bomb. This movie serial in 12 chapters was originally planned as a sequel to "Radar Men From The Moon" with Commando Cody as the hero but at the last moment the main characters'' names were changed and all other references to that serial removed from the script.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iGppZUjWuQwa47q3kW8Vv2px1HO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118636'),
  ('771346843965699019', 'Zombies on Broadway', 1945, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Gordon Douglas, Jack MacKenzie, Sam Ruman', 'Lawrence Kimble', 'Wally Brown, Alan Carney, Bela Lugosi, Anne Jeffreys, Sheldon Leonard, Frank Jenks, Russell Hopton, Joseph Vitale', 'NR', 'Two bumbling press agents must search for a zombie to fulfill a commitment to their ex-gangster boss''s new nightclub or face the consequences.', 'Two bumbling press agents must search for a zombie to fulfill a commitment to their ex-gangster boss''s new nightclub or face the consequences.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4l2bYIwRDfe9gfT7yVoowXP8koY.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:30183'),
  ('453671867713141192', 'Zombies: The Beginning', 2007, 'Action, Horror', 'Bruno Mattei', 'Antonio Tentori, Giovanni Paolucci', 'Yvette Yzon, Alvin Anson, Paul Holmes, James Gregory Paolleli, Miguel Faustmann, Dyane Craystan, B.B. Johnson, Gerhard Acao', null, 'A woman floating on a raft in the middle of the Pacific. She was found by a rescue team and taken ashore. Once there, she tells a story of how she escaped from an island full of zombies. She was persuaded to lead a commando unit to the island to explore.', 'A woman floating on a raft in the middle of the Pacific. She was found by a rescue team and taken ashore. Once there, she tells a story of how she escaped from an island full of zombies. She was persuaded to lead a commando unit to the island to explore.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/m5CSnXIRtRAjI6qYtvdDSmzY8Dm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:105989'),
  ('313785853468949319', 'Zombies! Zombies! Zombies!', 2008, 'Horror, Comedy', 'Jason Murphy, Kenny Beaumont', 'Anthony Steven Giordano', 'Jessica Monet Barton, Hollie Winnard, Lyanna Tumaneng, Sean Harriman, Anthony Headen, Valensky Sylvain, Juliet Reeves London, Landon Ashworth', 'NR', 'A drug experiment gone wrong produces a league of blood-thirsty zombies. It is up to a small band of exotic dancers trapped in a gentleman''s club to fight back. Together they must rely on their wits and skills to survive the night, and pray that they don''t become victims of the flesh-eating zombies!', 'A drug experiment gone wrong produces a league of blood-thirsty zombies. It is up to a small band of exotic dancers trapped in a gentleman''s club to fight back. Together they must rely on their wits and skills to survive the night, and pray that they don''t become victims of the flesh-eating zombies!', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/XYJGHTHJ3mbMaXlRbz08t4Ftzz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:24948'),
  ('851631842150981305', 'Zombillénium', 2017, 'Comedy, Animation, Fantasy', 'Alexis Ducord, Arthur de Pins', 'Arthur de Pins', 'Fily Keita, Emmanuel Curtil, Maelys Ricordeau, Alexis Tomassian, Arthur de Pins, Alain Choquet, Mat Bastard, Emmanuel Jacomy', 'PG', 'Zombillenium, the Halloween theme park, happens to be the one place on earth where real monsters can hide in plain sight. When Hector, a human, threatens to disclose the true identity of his employees, the Vampire Park Manager has no other choice but to hire him. To see his daughter, Hector must escape from his zombie and werewolf co-workers.', 'Zombillenium, the Halloween theme park, happens to be the one place on earth where real monsters can hide in plain sight. When Hector, a human, threatens to disclose the true identity of his employees, the Vampire Park Manager has no other choice but to hire him. To see his daughter, Hector must escape from his zombie and werewolf co-workers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nqchkfd2LaFFRvpjWPYPUNMQOQR.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:454549'),
  ('239496327244766280', 'Zona del silencio: Paralelo 27', 2004, 'Science Fiction', 'Alesso Martínez, Marcos Almada', null, 'Harry Geithner, Eduardo Zayas, Angélica Soler, Andrés García Jr., Andreas Pears, Tato Gardel, Mario Almada', null, 'In 1970, a missile veers off course and crashes inside the Zona del silencio. Two locals watch Americans recover the missile, but when they go in after them, something goes terribly wrong. Thirty years later, scientists arrive to investigate all the unexplained phenomena in the region.', 'In 1970, a missile veers off course and crashes inside the Zona del silencio. Two locals watch Americans recover the missile, but when they go in after them, something goes terribly wrong. Thirty years later, scientists arrive to investigate all the unexplained phenomena in the region.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aSR75RHqDzeSpKXZcYppKINhYOD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:546202'),
  ('661848038588868364', 'Zona J', 1998, 'Crime, Drama, Romance', 'Leonel Vieira, Carles Gusi', 'Rui Cardoso Martins, Luís Pedro Nunes', 'Núria Madruga, Ivo Canelas, Ana Bustorff, José Pedro Gomes, Carlos Santos, Joaquim Nicolau, Almeno Gonçalves, Félix Fontoura', null, 'Tó, a black boy from Zona J, a tough neighborhood in Lisbon, falls in love with a white girl, Carla. Tó dreams of living in Angola and taking Carla with him. However, the reality the two teens are in complicates their plans...', 'Tó, a black boy from Zona J, a tough neighborhood in Lisbon, falls in love with a white girl, Carla. Tó dreams of living in Angola and taking Carla with him. However, the reality the two teens are in complicates their plans...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dsw9i0MIHEXZXFVZ5gIN9ljP4Ta.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:164952'),
  ('52240173649353059', 'Zonad', 2010, 'Comedy', 'John Carney, Kieran Carney', 'John Carney, Kieran Carney', 'Bernie Butler, Janice Byrne, Simon Delaney, Donna Dent, David Pearse, Rory Keenan, David Murray, Geoff Minogue', 'NR', 'Zonad (Simon Delaney) is from space…probably. Or so the Cassidy family assume when they discover an apparent alien in a shiny red space suit and helmet passed out on the living room floor beside the drinks cabinet. The Cassidys and the people of Ballymoran make the intriguing visitor feel very welcome (and in the case of mother Mary, Donna Dent, and teenage minx Jenny, Janice Byrne, they make him feel very welcome indeed). At first, Zonad tries to evade the warm welcome of the villagers, although the procession of wanton women and free beer gets the better of him. Why give up on a good thing?', 'Zonad (Simon Delaney) is from space…probably. Or so the Cassidy family assume when they discover an apparent alien in a shiny red space suit and helmet passed out on the living room floor beside the drinks cabinet. The Cassidys and the people of Ballymoran make the intriguing visitor feel very welcome (and in the case of mother Mary, Donna Dent, and teenage minx Jenny, Janice Byrne, they make him feel very welcome indeed). At first, Zonad tries to evade the warm welcome of the villagers, although the procession of wanton women and free beer gets the better of him. Why give up on a good thing?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xkwi9mhl5WjiDv7rOj3l2HHDbSH.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:50598'),
  ('848267178889520328', 'Zone', 1995, 'Animation, Horror', 'Takashi Ito', null, null, null, 'This is a film about a man without a face. His arms and legs, bound with ropes, the disabled man is still without even a shudder in a white room. A series of unusual scenes in this room expresses what lies between memories, nightmares, and violent images.', 'This is a film about a man without a face. His arms and legs, bound with ropes, the disabled man is still without even a shudder in a white room. A series of unusual scenes in this room expresses what lies between memories, nightmares, and violent images.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7qL7eyteA4khKBZPoafEVIpL1qQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269580'),
  ('62430340372437308', 'Zone 39', 1996, 'Science Fiction', 'Brendan Campbell, Christian Robinson, Emma Jamvold', 'Deborah Parsons', 'Peter Phelps, Carolyn Bock, William Zappa, Bradley Byquar, Alex Menglet, Jeff Kovski, Warwick Sadler, Simon Wilton', null, 'In a time of misery and fear two enemies come together to prevent an apocalypse conspired by their leaders. 40 years of war between the Federated Republics and the New Territories Union has taken its toll. The cities are overcrowded, farming land is riddled with unexploded mines -- and still there is no hope of peace. In this hostile, decaying world of the future on thing remains constant for Lieutenant Leo Megaw; his love for his pregnant wife. Her access to classified information makes her an increasing liability for the government. When she''s ambushed, Leo is forced into exile. As a border patrolman on the isolated outpost of Zone 39, ordered to kill anyone that tries to cross the border, he comes to understand that ultimate catastrophe forced upon his world by his government. The real enemy is not looming across the border but standing right behind him. Now he must reach across the border into enemy territory and form an alliance to save his world.', 'In a time of misery and fear two enemies come together to prevent an apocalypse conspired by their leaders. 40 years of war between the Federated Republics and the New Territories Union has taken its toll. The cities are overcrowded, farming land is riddled with unexploded mines -- and still there is no hope of peace. In this hostile, decaying world of the future on thing remains constant for Lieutenant Leo Megaw; his love for his pregnant wife. Her access to classified information makes her an increasing liability for the government. When she''s ambushed, Leo is forced into exile. As a border patrolman on the isolated outpost of Zone 39, ordered to kill anyone that tries to cross the border, he comes to understand that ultimate catastrophe forced upon his world by his government. The real enemy is not looming across the border but standing right behind him. Now he must reach across the border into enemy territory and form an alliance to save his world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3Hful9RfqJm4M4swEnAAW89iZKt.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67067'),
  ('652225929447515102', 'Zone 414', 2021, 'Science Fiction, Thriller, Mystery', 'James Mather, Andrew Baird', 'Bryan Edward Hill', 'Guy Pearce, Matilda Lutz, Travis Fimmel, Jonathan Aris, Colin Salmon, Jóhannes Haukur Jóhannesson, Ned Dennehy, Antonia Campbell-Hughes', 'R', 'In the near future on a colony of state-of-the-art robots, a private investigator is hired by the colony''s creator to bring his missing daughter home.', 'In the near future on a colony of state-of-the-art robots, a private investigator is hired by the colony''s creator to bring his missing daughter home.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjtlMqX1QfiMvk8IgkKJR1vXzZ7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:675319'),
  ('426071798454589111', 'Zone of Silence', 1990, 'Mystery, Horror', 'Rodolfo de Anda', 'Gilberto de Anda', 'Mario Almada, Rodolfo de Anda, Olivia Collins, Jorge Russek, Jorge Luke, Ernesto Gómez Cruz', null, 'Several fantastic stories occur in the Mexican "Zone of Silence." It begins in the 1920s when a man steals a train and then flees to enter the present. Another man finds a colonizer guarded by a ghost treasure, two girls are attacked by an evil car and finally a man steals money, then he flees to enter the past.', 'Several fantastic stories occur in the Mexican "Zone of Silence." It begins in the 1920s when a man steals a train and then flees to enter the present. Another man finds a colonizer guarded by a ghost treasure, two girls are attacked by an evil car and finally a man steals money, then he flees to enter the past.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pgqyCr3RDsxCGVxNNdoY2IIXMpa.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:418835'),
  ('40326364151322265', 'Zone of the Dead', 2011, 'Horror, Action', 'Milan Konjević, Milan Todorović, Jovan Vladimir Borka', 'Milan Konjević, Milan Todorović, Vukota Brajović', 'Ken Foree, Kristina Klebe, Emilio Roso, Miodrag ''Miki'' Krstović, Vukota Brajović, Bojan Dimitrijević, Ariadna Cabrol, Steve Agnew', 'R', 'A police-escorted prisoner transport supervised by Interpol sets off to Belgrade. The route leads the transport through Pančevo, where they encounter an ecological disaster and infected people who are trying to kill them. Interpol agents Mortimer Reyes and Mina Milius soon realize that their only chance for escape from the zombie hordes lies in allying with the dangerous, mysterious prisoner.', 'A police-escorted prisoner transport supervised by Interpol sets off to Belgrade. The route leads the transport through Pančevo, where they encounter an ecological disaster and infected people who are trying to kill them. Interpol agents Mortimer Reyes and Mina Milius soon realize that their only chance for escape from the zombie hordes lies in allying with the dangerous, mysterious prisoner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/foKgf8xnIzvw7THHzjqmdzC8rWF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:28925'),
  ('353516118604950367', 'Zone Pro Site: The Moveable Feast', 2013, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Chen Yu-hsun, Chienn Hsiang', 'Chen Yu-hsun', 'Tony Yang, Lin Mei-shiu, Hsia Yu-chiao, Bamboo Chen, Wu Nien-jen, Ko I-chen, King Jieh-wen, Tuo Hsien', null, 'More than 20 years ago, there were three "Ban Dou" master chefs who dominated the catering business in Taiwan. However, the street banquet business has been in decline since Taiwan''s economic boom. Master Fly Spirit wants to pass the family recipes and culinary skills on to his only child, Wan, but she desperately wants to run away from the family business and to become a film star.', 'More than 20 years ago, there were three "Ban Dou" master chefs who dominated the catering business in Taiwan. However, the street banquet business has been in decline since Taiwan''s economic boom. Master Fly Spirit wants to pass the family recipes and culinary skills on to his only child, Wan, but she desperately wants to run away from the family business and to become a film star.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qoM4XRMJhXfFRlDpM5f3Z2XYobQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:214674'),
  ('1007065871141660356', 'Zone Troopers', 1985, 'Action, Adventure, Science Fiction, War', 'Danny Bilson, Luciano Sacripanti, Mac Ahlberg', 'Danny Bilson, Paul De Meo', 'Tim Thomerson, Tim Van Patten, Art LaFleur, Biff Manard, William Paulson, Peter Boom, Max Turilli, Eugene Brell', 'PG', 'American soldiers, led by The Sarge, are stuck behind Nazi enemy lines. As they make their way across the Italian countryside, they come across an alien spaceship that has crash-landed in the woods. The alien pilot is dead, but one of the ship''s passengers is on the loose. As the GIs hunt down the alien by splitting into smaller groups, they''re not only tracked by the Nazis, but also a whole host of other aliens come to save their stranded party.', 'American soldiers, led by The Sarge, are stuck behind Nazi enemy lines. As they make their way across the Italian countryside, they come across an alien spaceship that has crash-landed in the woods. The alien pilot is dead, but one of the ship''s passengers is on the loose. As the GIs hunt down the alien by splitting into smaller groups, they''re not only tracked by the Nazis, but also a whole host of other aliens come to save their stranded party.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mCaBGD745uvbBvfdG1Mdl8hUDi2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:17790'),
  ('1128877070296643785', 'Zontar: The Thing from Venus', 1967, 'Horror, Science Fiction, TV Movie', 'S.F. Brownrigg, Larry Buchanan, Robert B. Alcott', 'Hillman Taylor, Larry Buchanan', 'John Agar, Susan Bjurman, Tony Huston, Pat Delaney, Neil Fletcher, Warren Hammack, Colleen Carr, Jeff Alexander', null, 'A misguided scientist enables an alien from Venus named Zontar to come to earth in order to "help solve man''s problems". However, as soon as Zontar arrives on Earth, it quickly becomes obvious that the three-eyed, bat-winged, skeletal black creature has a hidden agenda.', 'A misguided scientist enables an alien from Venus named Zontar to come to earth in order to "help solve man''s problems". However, as soon as Zontar arrives on Earth, it quickly becomes obvious that the three-eyed, bat-winged, skeletal black creature has a hidden agenda.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2YY7c3dws5XU7FX4G41kcnJRlaQ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:41302'),
  ('511812844695620853', 'Zonzon', 1998, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Gilles Henry, Laurent Bouhnik', 'Patrick Delassagne, Laurent Bouhnik', 'Pascal Greggory, Gaël Morel, Jamel Debbouze, Fabienne Babe, Élodie Bouchez, François Levantal, Serge Blumental, Zakariya Gouram', null, 'In a French prison, three men are coming to terms with the emotional and physical torment which their incarceration brings them. Arnaud is serving a six-month sentence for drug smuggling; he protests his innocence and will do anything to secure an early release. Francky is a hardened criminal who has all but lost his wife and family and who seeks comfort in self-inflicted abuse. Kader is in prison for theft; he is the most philosophical of the three men, he is growing accustomed to prison life and seems to prefer it to the world outside.', 'In a French prison, three men are coming to terms with the emotional and physical torment which their incarceration brings them. Arnaud is serving a six-month sentence for drug smuggling; he protests his innocence and will do anything to secure an early release. Francky is a hardened criminal who has all but lost his wife and family and who seeks comfort in self-inflicted abuse. Kader is in prison for theft; he is the most philosophical of the three men, he is growing accustomed to prison life and seems to prefer it to the world outside.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/b3ykp7xsK7igkeg1EsrH2VaNzeV.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49916'),
  ('340746100824452533', 'Zoo', 1961, 'Documentary', 'Bert Haanstra', 'Bert Haanstra', null, null, 'A perfect, fast and hilarious montage. Using images from Artis (Amsterdam Zoo), Bert Haanstra shows that a couple of similarities can be discovered between human and animal. Particularly the manner in which human and ape are confronted with each other, is significant. The images speak for themselves, human voices or commentary is absent. The ironic music of Pim Jacobs does add an extra dimension to the whole. With regards to human and animal Haanstra limits himself for the time being to this short film, recorded with a hidden camera. Later on, in several big films, he would return to this subject.', 'A perfect, fast and hilarious montage. Using images from Artis (Amsterdam Zoo), Bert Haanstra shows that a couple of similarities can be discovered between human and animal. Particularly the manner in which human and ape are confronted with each other, is significant. The images speak for themselves, human voices or commentary is absent. The ironic music of Pim Jacobs does add an extra dimension to the whole. With regards to human and animal Haanstra limits himself for the time being to this short film, recorded with a hidden camera. Later on, in several big films, he would return to this subject.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mbuE6RNMkAQoLM3UKYQf1SKhQZU.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:113354'),
  ('572818160203205775', 'Zoo', 2005, 'Horror, Animation', 'Jumpei Mizusaki, Komiya Masatetsu, Hiroshi Ando', 'Usamaru Furuya', 'Patrick Harlan, Yui Ichikawa, Ryunosuke Kamiki, Ryoko Kobayashi, Miyuki Matsuda, Sakamatsu Mei, Jun Murakami, Kato Rubi', null, 'Five different directors adapt the works of Japanese author Otsuichi in this collection of unconventional live-action and animated shorts. A woman is murdered under odd circumstances in the title film, "Zoo"; twin sisters are treated differently in "Kazari and Yoko"; two siblings find themselves trapped in "Seven Rooms"; a survivor learns about life and death in "When the Sun Shines"; and parents lose the ability to see each other in "So Far."', 'Five different directors adapt the works of Japanese author Otsuichi in this collection of unconventional live-action and animated shorts. A woman is murdered under odd circumstances in the title film, "Zoo"; twin sisters are treated differently in "Kazari and Yoko"; two siblings find themselves trapped in "Seven Rooms"; a survivor learns about life and death in "When the Sun Shines"; and parents lose the ability to see each other in "So Far."', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/60xxux4F1qc7tJ1J6J6IufPl4MD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:60860'),
  ('530773809899095617', 'Zoo', 2007, 'Documentary', 'Robinson Devor', 'Charles Mudede', null, null, 'Through interviews and recreation, Zoo tells the story of "zoos," or men who "love" animals, through a group of men involved in the fatal incident involving man-horse love.', 'Through interviews and recreation, Zoo tells the story of "zoos," or men who "love" animals, through a group of men involved in the fatal incident involving man-horse love.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ycX4mJHFqfnot7IEyjtgzhnGQbs.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18902'),
  ('244280401954205696', 'Zoo', 2018, 'Family, War, History', 'Colin McIvor, Damien Elliott', 'Colin McIvor', 'Art Parkinson, Emily Flain, Toby Jones, Ian O''Reilly, Ian McElhinney, Penelope Wilton, James Stockdale, Damian O''Hare', 'PG', 'Young Tom and his misfit friends fight to save ''Buster'' the baby elephant during the German air raid bombings of Belfast in 1941.', 'Young Tom and his misfit friends fight to save ''Buster'' the baby elephant during the German air raid bombings of Belfast in 1941.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/tUlO39EcZzPlKS4JOhlUansgKFJ.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:472553'),
  ('1149804466672996062', 'Zoo in Budapest', 1933, 'Drama, Romance', 'Rowland V. Lee, Lee Garmes', 'Melville Baker, Jack Kirkland', 'Loretta Young, Gene Raymond, O. P. Heggie, Wally Albright, Paul Fix, Murray Kinnell, Ruth Warren, Roy Stewart', 'NR', 'Zani is an unusual young man who has spent his entire life in a zoo in Budapest. His only true friends are the zoo''s animals. When Zani meets Eve, a young orphan girl, they fall in love. To be together Eve must somehow escape from her strict orphan school. When she does she and Zani must hide overnight in the zoo - where everyone is looking to find them.', 'Zani is an unusual young man who has spent his entire life in a zoo in Budapest. His only true friends are the zoo''s animals. When Zani meets Eve, a young orphan girl, they fall in love. To be together Eve must somehow escape from her strict orphan school. When she does she and Zani must hide overnight in the zoo - where everyone is looking to find them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/kiwMoYxs9tCthQ8aRbP048l5UoW.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:122709'),
  ('550168372752329552', 'Zoo zéro', 1979, 'Science Fiction, Drama, Mystery', 'Alain Fleischer, Claire Denis, Bruno Nuytten', 'Alain Fleischer', 'Catherine Jourdan, Klaus Kinski, Pierre Clémenti, Lisette Malidor, Rufus, Piéral, Alida Valli, Christine Chappey', null, 'Eva is a singer in a Noah''s Ark themed nightclub, where the guests wear animal masks. She is approached by a stranger who claims to know her and to remember her singing Mozart.', 'Eva is a singer in a Noah''s Ark themed nightclub, where the guests wear animal masks. She is approached by a stranger who claims to know her and to remember her singing Mozart.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pDx50v3xEmLhQbQt4VgZWoYBlVz.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:67430'),
  ('490924744926527866', 'Zookeeper', 2011, 'Comedy, Romance, Family', 'Frank Coraci, David Mendoza, Michele Panelli-Venetis', 'Nick Bakay, Kevin James, Jay Scherick', 'Kevin James, Rosario Dawson, Leslie Bibb, Joe Rogan, Nat Faxon, Ken Jeong, Steffiana De La Cruz, Thomas Gottschalk', 'PG', 'Kindhearted Griffin Keyes is one of the best-loved caretakers at the Franklin Park Zoo, but he''s more comfortable with the animals than with females of his own species as proven by his failed marriage proposal to the self-absorbed Stephanie several years ago. The animals have listened to Griffin pine over her for years and, after she reappears in his life, they decide to help Griffin rekindle the relationship and become the alpha male she wants him to be. They inadvertently reveal their secret ability to talk and, after Griffin''s initial shock, teach him the rules of courtship, animal-style. Surprisingly, the animals'' advice really works and Griffin is about to get everything he''s ever dreamed of--or is he?', 'Kindhearted Griffin Keyes is one of the best-loved caretakers at the Franklin Park Zoo, but he''s more comfortable with the animals than with females of his own species as proven by his failed marriage proposal to the self-absorbed Stephanie several years ago. The animals have listened to Griffin pine over her for years and, after she reappears in his life, they decide to help Griffin rekindle the relationship and become the alpha male she wants him to be. They inadvertently reveal their secret ability to talk and, after Griffin''s initial shock, teach him the rules of courtship, animal-style. Surprisingly, the animals'' advice really works and Griffin is about to get everything he''s ever dreamed of--or is he?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/y3b4AYw8dr4hIKTfEAjxUxx0z8G.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38317'),
  ('465828427891873876', 'Zoolander', 2001, 'Comedy', 'Ben Stiller, Barry Peterson, Kyung W. Chang', 'Ben Stiller, Drake Sather, John Hamburg', 'Ben Stiller, Owen Wilson, Christine Taylor, Will Ferrell, Milla Jovovich, Jerry Stiller, David Duchovny, Jon Voight', 'PG-13', 'Clear the runway for Derek Zoolander, VH1''s three-time male model of the year. His face falls when hippie-chic Hansel scooters in to steal this year''s award. The evil fashion guru Mugatu seizes the opportunity to turn Derek into a killing machine. It''s a well-designed conspiracy and only with the help of Hansel and a few well-chosen accessories like Matilda can Derek make the world safe for male models everywhere.', 'Clear the runway for Derek Zoolander, VH1''s three-time male model of the year. His face falls when hippie-chic Hansel scooters in to steal this year''s award. The evil fashion guru Mugatu seizes the opportunity to turn Derek into a killing machine. It''s a well-designed conspiracy and only with the help of Hansel and a few well-chosen accessories like Matilda can Derek make the world safe for male models everywhere.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qdrbSneHZjJG2Dj0hhBxzzAo4HB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:9398'),
  ('671433869913389208', 'Zoolander 2', 2016, 'Comedy, Adventure, Action', 'David H. Venghaus Jr., Dan Mindel, Edoardo Petti', 'Justin Theroux, Ben Stiller, Nicholas Stoller', 'Ben Stiller, Owen Wilson, Will Ferrell, Penélope Cruz, Kristen Wiig, Fred Armisen, Kyle Mooney, Milla Jovovich', 'PG-13', 'Derek and Hansel are modelling again when an opposing company attempts to take them out from the business.', 'Derek and Hansel are modelling again when an opposing company attempts to take them out from the business.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/n8AJzALlTPBwe9Tkv3tdxbiAr9i.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:329833'),
  ('1084512708536344055', 'Zoom', 2006, 'Family, Comedy, Adventure, Action, Science Fiction', 'Peter Hewitt, Meaghan Lynch, Jennifer Heimpel', 'J. David Stem, David N. Weiss', 'Tim Allen, Courteney Cox, Chevy Chase, Spencer Breslin, Kevin Zegers, Kate Mara, Michael Cassidy, Ryan Whitney', 'PG', 'Jack Shepard is an out-of-shape auto shop owner, far removed from the man who once protected the world''s freedom. Reluctantly called back into action by the government, Jack is tasked with turning a ragtag group of kids with special powers into a new generation of superheroes to save the world from certain destruction.', 'Jack Shepard is an out-of-shape auto shop owner, far removed from the man who once protected the world''s freedom. Reluctantly called back into action by the government, Jack is tasked with turning a ragtag group of kids with special powers into a new generation of superheroes to save the world from certain destruction.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/v4rSFmiy0v9D7qmKkaUVJn5UhZ1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14113'),
  ('979815647532892257', 'Zoom', 2016, 'Animation, Comedy, Drama', 'Pedro Morelli, Adrian Teijido', 'Matt Hansen', 'Gael García Bernal, Alison Pill, Mariana Ximenes, Jason Priestley, Tyler Labine, Don McKellar, Jennifer Irwin, Michael Eklund', 'NR', 'A multi-dimensional interface between a comic book artist, a novelist, and a film director. Each lives in a separate reality but authors a story about one of the others.', 'A multi-dimensional interface between a comic book artist, a novelist, and a film director. Each lives in a separate reality but authors a story about one of the others.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gbyJSsrJyIOyr9o12B5A2Zsix4T.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:351065'),
  ('247786017704375057', 'Zoom and Bored', 1957, 'Animation, Comedy', 'Chuck Jones', null, 'Paul Julian', 'NR', 'Wile E. Coyote uses a bottle full of bees, a brick wall, a boulder in a catapult, and a harpoon gun in his attempts to catch the Road Runner.', 'Wile E. Coyote uses a bottle full of bees, a brick wall, a boulder in a catapult, and a harpoon gun in his attempts to catch the Road Runner.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/f4jpn8tpHP1G3CvNt8JVu37e8EO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118498'),
