  ('304304550760779823', 'Zoom In: Rape Apartments', 1980, 'Horror, Drama, Mystery', 'Naosuke Kurosawa, Masaru Mori, Seisaku Kimura', 'Chiho Katsura', 'Erina Miyai, Yōko Azusa, Yûko Ôsaki, Yūko Katagiri, Keijirō Shiga, Miki Yamaji, Beniko Iida, Hidetoshi Kageyama', 'NR', 'A housewife is brutally assaulted by a masked man nearby her apartment complex. From there, a web of suspicion, burning violence and repressed desires rapidly unfolds.', 'A housewife is brutally assaulted by a masked man nearby her apartment complex. From there, a web of suspicion, burning violence and repressed desires rapidly unfolds.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iYiq7Do293XbLliwp99U0MJNUX7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:118402'),
