  ('712701368158856533', 'Zoom Up: Sexual Crime Report', 1981, 'Crime, Horror, Thriller', 'Katsuhiko Fujii, Shōhei Andō, Hiroyuki Nasu', 'Akio Ido', 'Yuki Kazamatsuri, Maki Kawamura, Rie Hirase, Eimei Esumi, Kenji Kasai', null, 'The wife of a prominent businessman works as a late-night radio personality. One night on her way to the radio station, she is raped by a motorcycle gang without knowing the reason...', 'The wife of a prominent businessman works as a late-night radio personality. One night on her way to the radio station, she is raped by a motorcycle gang without knowing the reason...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2AWW590pdJVRVzCQYjFzRbVeVR8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:579739'),
  ('791552074735655961', 'Zoom Up: The Beaver Book Girl', 1981, 'Drama, Mystery', 'Takashi Kanno, Junichi Suzuki, Nobumasa Mizunoo', 'Takashi Ishii', 'Junko Mabuki, Kumiko Hayano, Yoshiko Sasaki, Takuya Hiramitsu, Toshiyuki Kitami, Ryoichi Kusanagi', null, 'A sexually perverse mystery set within the adult magazine industry. A woman is brutally assaulted in an abandoned factory, and her assailant escapes into the darkness after dropping a wad of money. A few years later, a photographer specializing in schoolgirl panty shots meets his match when a mysterious femme fatale volunteers to be his new model. This woman used to be the “queen” of the skin magazines, but she is also hiding a terrible secret and may be a wanted fugitive. Will the photographer escape her sexual grasp?', 'A sexually perverse mystery set within the adult magazine industry. A woman is brutally assaulted in an abandoned factory, and her assailant escapes into the darkness after dropping a wad of money. A few years later, a photographer specializing in schoolgirl panty shots meets his match when a mysterious femme fatale volunteers to be his new model. This woman used to be the “queen” of the skin magazines, but she is also hiding a terrible secret and may be a wanted fugitive. Will the photographer escape her sexual grasp?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/xN1PIBTiVTRfsKe1cwFXQbtmHV2.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:111620'),
  ('699982953623148130', 'Zoombies', 2016, 'Science Fiction, Action, Horror', 'Glenn Miller, Bryan Koss, Buzz Hughes', 'Scotty Mullen', 'Ione Butler, Andrew Asper, Aaron Groben, LaLa Nestor, Kim Nielsen, Marcus Anderson, Brianna Joy Chomer, Michael Delgado', null, 'When a strange virus quickly spreads through a safari park and turns all the zoo animals undead, those left in the park must stop the creatures before they escape and zombify the whole city.', 'When a strange virus quickly spreads through a safari park and turns all the zoo animals undead, those left in the park must stop the creatures before they escape and zombify the whole city.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fjWcnrJq38AIZrWVbZtGJA05WNB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385320'),
  ('706218677764848155', 'Zoot Suit', 1981, 'Drama, Music', 'Luis Valdez, David Myers', 'Luis Valdez', 'Daniel Valdez, Edward James Olmos, Charles Aidman, Tyne Daly, John Anderson, Abel Franco, Mike Gomez, Alma Martinez', 'R', 'Part fact and part fiction, Zoot Suit is the film version of Luis Valdez''s critically acclaimed play, based on the actual Sleepy Lagoon murder case and the zoot suit riots of 1940s Los Angeles. Henry Reyna is the leader of a group of Mexican-Americans being sent to San Quentin without substantial evidence for the death of a man at Sleepy Lagoon. As part of the defense committee, Alice Bloomfield and George Shearer fight the blatant miscarriage of justice for the freedom of Henry and his friends.', 'Part fact and part fiction, Zoot Suit is the film version of Luis Valdez''s critically acclaimed play, based on the actual Sleepy Lagoon murder case and the zoot suit riots of 1940s Los Angeles. Henry Reyna is the leader of a group of Mexican-Americans being sent to San Quentin without substantial evidence for the death of a man at Sleepy Lagoon. As part of the defense committee, Alice Bloomfield and George Shearer fight the blatant miscarriage of justice for the freedom of Henry and his friends.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/itSXh6MxBZWvQ7xhSxusk2RwjfM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:76397'),
  ('1087469430540971760', 'Zootopia', 2016, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy', 'Byron Howard, Rich Moore, Jared Bush', 'Phil Johnston, Jared Bush', 'Ginnifer Goodwin, Jason Bateman, Idris Elba, Jenny Slate, Nate Torrence, Bonnie Hunt, Don Lake, Tommy Chong', 'PG', 'Determined to prove herself, Officer Judy Hopps, the first bunny on Zootopia''s police force, jumps at the chance to crack her first case - even if it means partnering with scam-artist fox Nick Wilde to solve the mystery.', 'Determined to prove herself, Officer Judy Hopps, the first bunny on Zootopia''s police force, jumps at the chance to crack her first case - even if it means partnering with scam-artist fox Nick Wilde to solve the mystery.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/hlK0e0wAQ3VLuJcsfIYPvb4JVud.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:269149'),
  ('1557667176342969', 'Zootopia 2', 2025, 'Animation, Family, Mystery, Adventure, Comedy, Action', 'Jared Bush, Byron Howard, Tyler J. Kupferer', 'Jared Bush', 'Ginnifer Goodwin, Jason Bateman, Ke Huy Quan, Fortune Feimster, Andy Samberg, David Strathairn, Idris Elba, Shakira', 'PG', 'After cracking the biggest case in Zootopia''s history, rookie cops Judy Hopps and Nick Wilde find themselves on the twisting trail of a great mystery when Gary De''Snake arrives and turns the animal metropolis upside down. To crack the case, Judy and Nick must go undercover to unexpected new parts of town, where their growing partnership is tested like never before.', 'After cracking the biggest case in Zootopia''s history, rookie cops Judy Hopps and Nick Wilde find themselves on the twisting trail of a great mystery when Gary De''Snake arrives and turns the animal metropolis upside down. To crack the case, Judy and Nick must go undercover to unexpected new parts of town, where their growing partnership is tested like never before.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oJ7g2CifqpStmoYQyaLQgEU32qO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1084242'),
  ('160008013538790423', 'Zootopia 3', null, 'Animation, Adventure, Family, Comedy', null, null, 'Ginnifer Goodwin, Jason Bateman', null, 'The third installment in the franchise. Plot TBA.', 'The third installment in the franchise. Plot TBA.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gramV8L8bzYnd3jHFmf8QKOMW86.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1591771'),
  ('916071059046622207', 'Zora la vampira', 2000, 'Comedy, Horror', 'Antonio Manetti, Marco Manetti, Federico Schlatter', 'Antonio Manetti, Marco Manetti', 'Toni Bertorelli, Micaela Ramazzotti, Chef Ragoo, Carlo Verdone, Raffaele Vannoli, G-Max, Sandro Ghiani, Lory Bofta', null, 'Count Dracula trades Transylvania for Italy in search of fresh blood and Western standards of living, but finds instead his ancient love Zora, reincarnated as a young graffiti artist from the Roman hip-hop scene.', 'Count Dracula trades Transylvania for Italy in search of fresh blood and Western standards of living, but finds instead his ancient love Zora, reincarnated as a young graffiti artist from the Roman hip-hop scene.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/wIR3FgC4y75447W7t3bpoV4zDmF.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43586'),
  ('674324917899154836', 'Zoran: My Nephew the Idiot', 2013, 'Comedy', 'Matteo Oleotto, Mariagiulia Bocchini Padiglione, Giulia Cignolini', 'Marco Pettenello, Matteo Oleotto, Pier Paolo Piciarelli', 'Giuseppe Battiston, Teco Celio, Rok Prasnikar, Roberto Citran, Marjuta Slamič, Sylvain Chomet, Peter Musevski, Riccardo Maranzana', null, 'Paolo, 40 years old, lives in a small Friulian town close to the north-eastern border. Unreliable and with a passion for good wine, he spends his days at the local tavern and stubbornly stalks his ex-wife.', 'Paolo, 40 years old, lives in a small Friulian town close to the north-eastern border. Unreliable and with a passion for good wine, he spends his days at the local tavern and stubbornly stalks his ex-wife.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lvVHTqEtz4bHOl8rf10MbN9CkDf.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:231565'),
  ('303276961967002321', 'Zorba the Greek', 1964, 'Drama', 'Mihalis Kakogiannis, Walter Lassally', 'Mihalis Kakogiannis', 'Anthony Quinn, Alan Bates, Irene Papas, Lila Kedrova, Sotiris Moustakas, Anna Kyriakou, Takis Emmanuel, Eleni Anousaki', 'NR', 'An uptight English writer traveling to Crete on a matter of business finds his life changed forever when he meets the gregarious Alexis Zorba.', 'An uptight English writer traveling to Crete on a matter of business finds his life changed forever when he meets the gregarious Alexis Zorba.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jAYOY38TRDprIgu7vgES0FFJJSl.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10604'),
  ('49725608636339220', 'Zorn', 1994, 'Drama', 'Gunnar Hellström, Jörgen Persson', 'Lasse Helgesson, Gunnar Hellström', 'Gunnar Hellström, Linda Kozlowski, Liv Ullmann, Jarl Kulle, Stig Grybe, Rikard Wolff, Ulf Eklund, Birgitte Söndergaard', null, 'Swedish painter Anders Zorn gained notoriety for his nudes. His works are currently worth millions. The film is set in the time when Zorn, already respected for his art, was commissioned to paint a portrait of the Swedish king. Though an excellent painter, Zorn''s personal life is dreadful. A boozer and a womanizer who frequently cheats on his wife, Zorn constantly seeks approval for his art. When he travels to the U.S. for a tour he meets Emilie Bartlett the wife of sculptor Paul W. Bartlett with whom he begins a sporadic affair. After Paul commits suicide, Zorn and Emilie move to Sweden. Zorn disregards his wife''s feelings and openly displays his affections for Emilie.', 'Swedish painter Anders Zorn gained notoriety for his nudes. His works are currently worth millions. The film is set in the time when Zorn, already respected for his art, was commissioned to paint a portrait of the Swedish king. Though an excellent painter, Zorn''s personal life is dreadful. A boozer and a womanizer who frequently cheats on his wife, Zorn constantly seeks approval for his art. When he travels to the U.S. for a tour he meets Emilie Bartlett the wife of sculptor Paul W. Bartlett with whom he begins a sporadic affair. After Paul commits suicide, Zorn and Emilie move to Sweden. Zorn disregards his wife''s feelings and openly displays his affections for Emilie.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/jcRYenQK8e7LHI0813wGTwLdisM.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:160879'),
  ('1136285711942972354', 'Zorns Lemma', 1970, 'Documentary', 'Hollis Frampton', null, 'Robert Huot, Rosemarie Castoro, Marcia Steinbrecher, Twyla Tharp, Joyce Wieland', 'NR', 'Zorns Lemma is a 1970 American structuralist film by Hollis Frampton. It is named after Zorn''s lemma (also known as the Kuratowski–Zorn lemma), a proposition of set theory formulated by mathematician Max Zorn in 1935. Zorns Lemma is prefaced with a reading from an early grammar textbook. The remainder of the film, largely silent, shows the viewer an evolving 24-part "alphabet" (where i & j and u & v are interchanged) which is cycled through, replaced and expanded upon. The film''s conclusion shows a man, woman and dog walking through snow as several voices read passages from On Light, or the Ingression of Forms by Robert Grosseteste.', 'Zorns Lemma is a 1970 American structuralist film by Hollis Frampton. It is named after Zorn''s lemma (also known as the Kuratowski–Zorn lemma), a proposition of set theory formulated by mathematician Max Zorn in 1935. Zorns Lemma is prefaced with a reading from an early grammar textbook. The remainder of the film, largely silent, shows the viewer an evolving 24-part "alphabet" (where i & j and u & v are interchanged) which is cycled through, replaced and expanded upon. The film''s conclusion shows a man, woman and dog walking through snow as several voices read passages from On Light, or the Ingression of Forms by Robert Grosseteste.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8z0EwuhLyyTuZwN2bXTsdoyWbZI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:88276'),
  ('1047476879176837564', 'Zorrita Martínez', 1975, 'Comedy, Drama', 'Vicente Escrivá, Sinesio Isla, Raúl Pérez Cubero', 'Vicente Escrivá', 'Nadiuska, José Luis López Vázquez, Alberto de Mendoza, Bárbara Rey, Manuel Zarzo, Rafael Alonso, Fernando Santos, Jesús Guzmán', null, 'Zorrita Martínez is the stage name of Lydia Martínez, a Venezuelan artist based in Spain. Zorrita, however, runs into an unexpected problem: she cannot stay in the country any longer if she does not marry a man of Spanish nationality.', 'Zorrita Martínez is the stage name of Lydia Martínez, a Venezuelan artist based in Spain. Zorrita, however, runs into an unexpected problem: she cannot stay in the country any longer if she does not marry a man of Spanish nationality.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zpKmTbeSF8PPHBa9yVcyiHZvVHD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:259146'),
  ('452567669259577150', 'Zorro', 1975, 'Adventure, Action, Comedy, Western', 'Duccio Tessari, Marco Risi, Mario Forges Davanzati', 'Giorgio Arlorio', 'Alain Delon, Ottavia Piccolo, Moustache, Enzo Cerusico, Giampiero Albertini, Stanley Baker, Marino Masé, Adriana Asti', 'G', 'A newly arrived governor finds his province under the control of the corrupt Colonel Huerta. To avoid assassination by Huerta, he pretends to be weak and indecisive so Huerta will believe he poses no threat. But secretly he masquerades as Zorro, and joins the monk Francisco and the beautiful aristocrat Hortensia in their fight for justice against Huerta and his soldiers.', 'A newly arrived governor finds his province under the control of the corrupt Colonel Huerta. To avoid assassination by Huerta, he pretends to be weak and indecisive so Huerta will believe he poses no threat. But secretly he masquerades as Zorro, and joins the monk Francisco and the beautiful aristocrat Hortensia in their fight for justice against Huerta and his soldiers.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/1jB0iFZEUQqDjY77WU6IsKj1LM8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18450'),
  ('315938547297350661', 'Zorro, The Gay Blade', 1981, 'Western, Action, Comedy, Adventure, Romance', 'Peter Medak, John A. Alonzo, Michael D. Moore', 'Hal Dresner', 'George Hamilton, Lauren Hutton, Brenda Vaccaro, Ron Leibman, Donovan Scott, James Booth, Helen Burns, Clive Revill', 'PG', 'In 19th century Mexico, legendary swordsman Zorro has passed on his weapon and his sense of duty to his noble son, Diego, a dashing swashbuckler like his father. But after an injury sidelines Diego, he is forced to hand the mask over to his twin, Ramon.', 'In 19th century Mexico, legendary swordsman Zorro has passed on his weapon and his sense of duty to his noble son, Diego, a dashing swashbuckler like his father. But after an injury sidelines Diego, he is forced to hand the mask over to his twin, Ramon.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/qNrJKDXx0hPKPKcNFRXMI7MjPSD.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:19317'),
  ('712705685422032293', 'Zotz!', 1962, 'Comedy, Fantasy', 'William Castle, Gordon Avil', 'Ray Russell', 'Tom Poston, Julia Meade, Jim Backus, Fred Clark, Cecil Kellaway, Zeme North, Margaret Dumont, James Millhollin', 'NR', 'Jonathan Jones, a professor of ancient languages, comes into possession of an ancient coin. He translates its inscription, which gives him three powers: to inflict pain, slow down time or kill. Soon, he''s pursued by enemy spies who have learned about the magic coin.', 'Jonathan Jones, a professor of ancient languages, comes into possession of an ancient coin. He translates its inscription, which gives him three powers: to inflict pain, slow down time or kill. Soon, he''s pursued by enemy spies who have learned about the magic coin.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/s6wPLalkgkZi6ptUA8kATBkLTfd.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:74924'),
  ('724602545313577604', 'Zouzou', 1934, 'Comedy, Music, Romance', 'Marc Allégret, Boris Kaufman, Jacques Mercanton', 'Carlo Rim', 'Josephine Baker, Jean Gabin, Pierre Larquey, Yvette Lebon, Illa Meery, Pierre Palau, Madeleine Guitty, Claire Gérard', null, 'Zou Zou tries to help her childhood friend prove his innocence after he''s accused of murder.', 'Zou Zou tries to help her childhood friend prove his innocence after he''s accused of murder.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/3pZ81H83nCjBOzVWMc2clSWdnNb.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:43603'),
  ('112421972664423092', 'Zouzou', 2014, 'Comedy, Drama, Family', 'Blandine Lenoir, Kika Ungaro', 'Blandine Lenoir, Jean-Luc Gaget', 'Olivier Broche, Laure Calamy, Jeanne Ferron, Nanou Garcia, Florence Muller, Sarah Grappin, Elisa Lifshitz, Anouk Delbart', null, 'Solange, in her sixties, her 3 daughters, and Zouzou, her 14 year-old granddaughter, spend a few days in the country. An opportunity for Solange to announce the news: she has a new man in her life. And the sexual side of the relationship, should they discuss it or ignore it?', 'Solange, in her sixties, her 3 daughters, and Zouzou, her 14 year-old granddaughter, spend a few days in the country. An opportunity for Solange to announce the news: she has a new man in her life. And the sexual side of the relationship, should they discuss it or ignore it?', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7cJCtb9tHlx63le7M61U84zHn9d.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:309360'),
  ('722052467098343123', 'Zozo', 2005, 'Drama', 'Josef Fares, Aril Wretblad', 'Josef Fares', 'Imad Creidi, Antoinette Turk, Elias Gergi, Carmen Lebbos, Viktor Axelsson, Charbel Iskandar, Yasmine Awad, Jad Stephan', null, 'A Lebanese boy gets separated from his family during the civil war and ends up in Sweden.', 'A Lebanese boy gets separated from his family during the civil war and ends up in Sweden.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/sQx60M59HMcarRH6IL8x21KwOD7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:49220'),
  ('606021886088378261', 'Zu Warriors', 2001, 'Fantasy, Action', 'Tsui Hark, Herman Yau, Poon Hang-Sang', 'Lee Man-Choi, Tsui Hark', 'Ekin Cheng Yee-Kin, Louis Koo, Cecilia Cheung, Kelly Lin Hsi-Lei, Zhang Ziyi, Wu Jing, Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Lau Shun', null, 'King Sky, the sole disciple of the Kun Lun Sect, falls in love with his master Dawn. Dawn is killed when Insomnia destroys the Kin Lun Mountain. King Sky waits for two hundred years and meets Enigma, who is the reincarnation of Dawn, and in love with her again. However, Insomnia''s Blood Clouds is ready to destroy Zu.', 'King Sky, the sole disciple of the Kun Lun Sect, falls in love with his master Dawn. Dawn is killed when Insomnia destroys the Kin Lun Mountain. King Sky waits for two hundred years and meets Enigma, who is the reincarnation of Dawn, and in love with her again. However, Insomnia''s Blood Clouds is ready to destroy Zu.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/6WeNAgPpwhXFw3RPLkoXNXX5sg1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16321'),
  ('293542027977453819', 'Zu: Warriors from the Magic Mountain', 1983, 'Fantasy, Action, Adventure, Comedy', 'Tsui Hark, Bill Wong Chung-Piu, Yeung Wa', 'Shui Chung-Yuet, Sze-To Cheuk-Hon', 'Sammo Hung Kam-Bo, Yuen Biao, Adam Cheng Siu-Chow, Brigitte Lin, Moon Lee Choi-Fung, Judy Ongg, Corey Yuen, Damian Lau Chung-Yan', null, '5th century western China: As constant civil wars scars the nation, to evade death, Ti, a young scout, jumps through a crevice in the Zu mountains where he becomes entangled in a great battle against the Blood Demon, a supernatural entity seeking to wreak havoc upon the world.', '5th century western China: As constant civil wars scars the nation, to evade death, Ti, a young scout, jumps through a crevice in the Zu mountains where he becomes entangled in a great battle against the Blood Demon, a supernatural entity seeking to wreak havoc upon the world.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9vJi1xPMlC4qb41h08kvKZQXyFj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:38155'),
  ('634800084739555869', 'Zubeidaa', 2001, 'Romance, Drama, History, Music', 'Shyam Benegal', 'Khalid Mohammed', 'Karisma Kapoor, Manoj Bajpayee, Rekha, Rajit Kapoor, Amrish Puri, Surekha Sikri, Farida Jalal, Shakti Kapoor', null, 'Zubeidaa, an aspiring Muslim actress, marries a Hindu prince to become his second wife. Her tumultuous relationship with her husband, and her inner demons lead her to a decision which has fatal consequences for them all.', 'Zubeidaa, an aspiring Muslim actress, marries a Hindu prince to become his second wife. Her tumultuous relationship with her husband, and her inner demons lead her to a decision which has fatal consequences for them all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mLKbYm0qhjmRbK5lu28mI5Xi3dy.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:262120'),
  ('678839500975127788', 'Zübük', 1980, 'Comedy', 'Kartal Tibet', 'Atıf Yılmaz', 'Kemal Sunal, Nevra Serezli, Metin Serezli, Bülent Kayabaş, Kadir Savun, Osman Alyanak, Ali Şen, Nejat Gürçen', null, 'This is the story of the politician named Zübük. He gets expelled from the political party that he is a member of, due to corruption. The journalist Yaşar wants to make a news story about his case and investigates Zübük''s doings. Yaşar gets baffled at the sly tricks Zübük played on his village people. In the end, he feels sorry about Zübük''s present situation, however, as things happen he becomes aware that Zübük has been tricking him.', 'This is the story of the politician named Zübük. He gets expelled from the political party that he is a member of, due to corruption. The journalist Yaşar wants to make a news story about his case and investigates Zübük''s doings. Yaşar gets baffled at the sly tricks Zübük played on his village people. In the end, he feels sorry about Zübük''s present situation, however, as things happen he becomes aware that Zübük has been tricking him.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/gmRXqXgyCbuC50mAs2Q32wdUjxO.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:157737'),
  ('1011287640264103661', 'Zulu', 1964, 'Action, Drama, History, War', 'Cy Endfield, Stephen Dade', 'Cy Endfield, John Prebble', 'Stanley Baker, Jack Hawkins, Ulla Jacobsson, James Booth, Michael Caine, Nigel Green, Paul Daneman, Patrick Magee', 'NR', 'In 1879, during the Anglo-Zulu War, man-of-the-people Lt. Chard and snooty Lt. Bromhead are in charge of defending the isolated and vastly outnumbered Natal outpost of Rorke''s Drift from tribal hordes.', 'In 1879, during the Anglo-Zulu War, man-of-the-people Lt. Chard and snooty Lt. Bromhead are in charge of defending the isolated and vastly outnumbered Natal outpost of Rorke''s Drift from tribal hordes.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9V7tl1kIb67ZPRRNlUdy3JvqEiA.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:14433'),
  ('413384802891661962', 'Zulu', 2013, 'Crime, Drama, Thriller', 'Jérôme Salle, Denis Rouden', 'Julien Rappeneau, Jérôme Salle', 'Orlando Bloom, Forest Whitaker, Conrad Kemp, Inge Beckmann, Tinarie Van Wyk-Loots, Regardt van den Bergh, Randall Majiet, Iman Isaacs', 'R', 'As a child, Ali Neuman narrowly escaped being murdered by Inkhata, a militant political party at war with Nelson Mandela''s African National Congress. Only he and his mother survived the carnage of those years. But as with many survivors, the psychological scars remain.', 'As a child, Ali Neuman narrowly escaped being murdered by Inkhata, a militant political party at war with Nelson Mandela''s African National Congress. Only he and his mother survived the carnage of those years. But as with many survivors, the psychological scars remain.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/h5OZD7pVkIKR5jf4lGFzQQrLmLc.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:185567'),
  ('627256019372851557', 'Zulu Dawn', 1979, 'Adventure, Drama, History, War', 'Douglas Hickox, Ousama Rawi, Peter MacDonald', 'Cy Endfield, Anthony Story', 'Burt Lancaster, Peter O''Toole, John Mills, Denholm Elliott, Simon Ward, Nigel Davenport, Michael Jayston, Peter Vaughan', 'PG', 'In 1879, the British suffer a great loss at the Battle of Isandlwana due to incompetent leadership.', 'In 1879, the British suffer a great loss at the Battle of Isandlwana due to incompetent leadership.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dGFmC4gRYUMcbVktIgM9kyqNqk8.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:18061'),
  ('777173788300748611', 'Zum Teufel mit der Penne', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Werner Jacobs, Wolf Wirth', 'Franz Seitz Junior', 'Peter Alexander, Hansi Kraus, Hannelore Elsner, Theo Lingen, Willy Millowitsch, Balduin Baas, Rudolf Schündler, Sabine Bethmann', null, 'Pepe Notnagel (who inexplicably had his name changed from the first movie''s Nietnagel) and his classmates scheme to get around doing any actual school work by cheating or sending their teachers to the sanatorium. A Swiss documentary film maker disguises himself as his brother in law, who got a position as an exchange teacher, to aid his project of making a movie about the current youth.', 'Pepe Notnagel (who inexplicably had his name changed from the first movie''s Nietnagel) and his classmates scheme to get around doing any actual school work by cheating or sending their teachers to the sanatorium. A Swiss documentary film maker disguises himself as his brother in law, who got a position as an exchange teacher, to aid his project of making a movie about the current youth.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/29C8K70rL3QkLkFtVBul8LHS6fv.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:11043'),
  ('220225767809005760', 'Zur Hölle mit den Paukern', 1968, 'Comedy', 'Werner Jacobs, Heinz Hölscher', 'Franz Seitz Junior', 'Hansi Kraus, Uschi Glas, Theo Lingen, Gila von Weitershausen, Günther Schramm, Hannelore Elsner, Georg Thomalla, Rudolf Schündler', null, 'Pepe Nietnagel and his fellow students of the Mommsen school come up with all kinds of ideas to get out of doing any actual school work. This includes simulating suicides, setting off the air-raid sirens and abusing the school director''s new broadcasting system. They succeed in sending their teacher to a sanatorium and get a replacement that turns out to not be so bad after all.', 'Pepe Nietnagel and his fellow students of the Mommsen school come up with all kinds of ideas to get out of doing any actual school work. This includes simulating suicides, setting off the air-raid sirens and abusing the school director''s new broadcasting system. They succeed in sending their teacher to a sanatorium and get a replacement that turns out to not be so bad after all.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zQTyFuNYJWr6Lu2VFZKxWwCG2sj.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:10977'),
  ('754613205559770779', 'Zus & Zo', 2002, 'Comedy', 'Paula van der Oest, Bert Pot', 'Paula van der Oest', 'Jacob Derwig, Halina Reijn, Monic Hendrickx, Sylvia Poorta, Jaap Spijkers, Pieter Embrechts, Annet Malherbe, Jeroen van Koningsbrugge', null, 'Three wacky sisters try to save their inheritance from their supposedly gay brother, who suddenly appears with a fiancé in tow. If he gets married, their father''s will stipulates that he gets the family hotel in Portugal. So the sisters put aside their personal differences and set out to stop the wedding at all costs.', 'Three wacky sisters try to save their inheritance from their supposedly gay brother, who suddenly appears with a fiancé in tow. If he gets married, their father''s will stipulates that he gets the family hotel in Portugal. So the sisters put aside their personal differences and set out to stop the wedding at all costs.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/pmStxhCvk7iN3HUK73JZKByRhEB.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:16539'),
  ('254015417089254508', 'Zuzu Angel', 2006, 'Drama, History', 'Sérgio Rezende, Cris Azzi, Maritza Caneca', 'Sérgio Rezende, Marcos Bernstein', 'Patricia Pillar, Daniel de Oliveira, Leandra Leal, Alexandre Borges, Luana Piovani, Aramis Trindade, Ângela Vieira, Flávio Bauraqui', null, 'Covering the last years of the famous Brazilian fashion designer in her doomed quest for justice, Zuzu Angel follows the case of her activist son Stuart''s arrest, torture, murder, and subsequent corpse disposal by the military forces in early 1970s Rio de Janeiro, during the darkest era of Brazilian military regime and media censorship.', 'Covering the last years of the famous Brazilian fashion designer in her doomed quest for justice, Zuzu Angel follows the case of her activist son Stuart''s arrest, torture, murder, and subsequent corpse disposal by the military forces in early 1970s Rio de Janeiro, during the darkest era of Brazilian military regime and media censorship.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zqeNZIMZN7xNUn0h46LLthH1s5R.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:73169'),
  ('584827143567411209', 'Zvanì - Il romanzo famigliare di Giovanni Pascoli', 2025, 'Drama, History', 'Giuseppe Piccioni, Elisa Becchere, Michele D''Attanasio', 'Sandro Petraglia, Eleonora Bordi, Lorenzo Bagnatori', 'Federico Cesari, Benedetta Porcaroli, Liliana Bottone, Luca Vannuccini, Sandra Ceccarelli, Riccardo Scamarcio, Margherita Buy, Chiara Ferrara', null, '1912. Giovanni Pascoli has died, and a train leaves from Bologna for his funeral. On board, students, officials, and family, including his sister Maria, called Mariù. It is a journey of national mourning, with people from all social classes paying homage to the poet. In Mariù’s recollections, we learn how Giovanni lived: his father’s assassination, his poverty as a youth, his political activism and fraught ties to Giosuè Carducci.', '1912. Giovanni Pascoli has died, and a train leaves from Bologna for his funeral. On board, students, officials, and family, including his sister Maria, called Mariù. It is a journey of national mourning, with people from all social classes paying homage to the poet. In Mariù’s recollections, we learn how Giovanni lived: his father’s assassination, his poverty as a youth, his political activism and fraught ties to Giosuè Carducci.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ocmjtIr62OEi0GEOk4NL2B2WQfo.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1506703'),
  ('215389046094171583', 'Zvenyhora', 1928, 'Drama, Fantasy', 'Oleksandr Dovzhenko, Boris Zavelev, Lazar Bodik', 'Maik Yohansen, Yuri Tyutyunnyk, Oleksandr Dovzhenko', 'Mykola Nademskyi, Semen Svashenko, Les Podorozhniy, Polina Skliar-Otava, Heorhiy Astafyev, Leonid Barbe, Nikolay Charov, Vladimir Lanskoy', null, 'The momentous film stars Mykola Nademskyi as the grandfather of Tymish, whom he alerts to the secret treasure buried in the mountains of Zvenygora – a treasure that rightfully belongs to his homeland. The film wonderfully blends both lyricism and politics and uses its central construct to build a montage praising Ukrainian industrialization, attacking the bourgeoisie, celebrating the beauty of the Ukrainian steppe and retelling ancient folklore. Sergei Eisenstein said of the film, "As the lights went on, we felt that we had just witnessed a memorable event in the development of the cinema".', 'The momentous film stars Mykola Nademskyi as the grandfather of Tymish, whom he alerts to the secret treasure buried in the mountains of Zvenygora – a treasure that rightfully belongs to his homeland. The film wonderfully blends both lyricism and politics and uses its central construct to build a montage praising Ukrainian industrialization, attacking the bourgeoisie, celebrating the beauty of the Ukrainian steppe and retelling ancient folklore. Sergei Eisenstein said of the film, "As the lights went on, we felt that we had just witnessed a memorable event in the development of the cinema".', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iuQBwLMXwxT1N5GmF49anbdGJ0r.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:82088'),
  ('255221822570633872', 'Zwei Herzen und ein Thron', 1955, 'Comedy', 'Hans Schott-Schöbinger, Klaus von Rautenfeld', 'Rudolf L. Körner', 'Elma Karlowa, Hans von Borsody, Herta Staal, Gunther Philipp, Paul Löwinger, Fritz Imhoff, Rudolf Vogel, Rudolf Carl', null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dkAfKjH81XnXVqHHUt7UbpYYgx5.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:261878'),
  ('1022953210521610767', 'Zwei Nasen tanken Super', 1984, 'Comedy', 'Franz Xaver Lederle, Dieter Pröttel', 'Thomas Gottschalk, Mike Krüger', 'Thomas Gottschalk, Mike Krüger, Simone Brahmann, Sonja Tuchmann, Thea Gottschalk, Karl Spiehs, András Fricsay, Achim Gunske', null, 'Tommy and Mike, again without a job and without money, are looking for a public toilet at a motor show.', 'Tommy and Mike, again without a job and without money, are looking for a public toilet at a motor show.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vRjdNQpAmikwFYBx9wBLWuXp3Zm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:12098'),
  ('1044913008894882249', 'Zwigato', 2023, 'Drama', 'Nandita Das, Nisith Sahasransu Ray, Kshira Sagar Nag', 'Samir Patil, Nandita Das', 'Kapil Sharma, Shahana Goswami, Sayani Gupta, Swanand Kirkire, Gul Panag, Abhishek Giri, Prasanjeet Mohapatra, Ashiwin Ray Mohapatra', null, 'Manas, an ex-factory floor manager loses his job during the pandemic. He is then forced to work as a food delivery rider, grappling with the app and the world of ratings and incentives. Life is relentless for him, but not without shared moments of joy with his wife, Pratima. The film captures the life of invisible ''ordinary'' people, hidden in plain sight.', 'Manas, an ex-factory floor manager loses his job during the pandemic. He is then forced to work as a food delivery rider, grappling with the app and the world of ratings and incentives. Life is relentless for him, but not without shared moments of joy with his wife, Pratima. The film captures the life of invisible ''ordinary'' people, hidden in plain sight.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cy5prmLqNUVOqfEqa0ArhqIRDB1.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1014060'),
  ('615201044897580616', 'Zwischen uns', 2022, 'Drama, Family', 'Vasco Viana, Peter Fuchs, Max Fey', 'Michael Gutmann, Max Fey', 'Jona Eisenblätter, Liv Lisa Fries, Thure Lindhardt, David Zimmerschied, Max Rothbart, Gonca de Haas, Agnes Kiyomi Decker, Christian Ammermüller', null, 'Eva is struggling to live happily with her autistic son Felix. The two are inseparable, but Felix''s frequent outbursts of anger, the constant problems at school and his fear of strangers are almost impossible for Eva to cope with. One day when Felix accidentally seriously injured Eva, suddenly nothing is the same as it used to be.', 'Eva is struggling to live happily with her autistic son Felix. The two are inseparable, but Felix''s frequent outbursts of anger, the constant problems at school and his fear of strangers are almost impossible for Eva to cope with. One day when Felix accidentally seriously injured Eva, suddenly nothing is the same as it used to be.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rrENwZjkwzxPfbijFpGZFAc80YG.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:794315'),
  ('802178499163877445', 'Zwischen uns die Mauer', 2019, 'Drama, Romance', 'Norbert Lechner', 'Susanne Fülscher, Antonia Rothe-Liermann, Norbert Lechner', 'Lea Freund, Tim Bülow, Franziska Weisz, Fritz Karl, Götz Schubert, Henriette Heinze, Lukas Zumbrock, Leon Blaschke', null, 'In 1986, Anna from West Germany and the GDR citizen Philipp meet at a church youth exchange in East Berlin. It''s love at first sight. But it is also an impossible love, because between them stands the wall.', 'In 1986, Anna from West Germany and the GDR citizen Philipp meet at a church youth exchange in East Berlin. It''s love at first sight. But it is also an impossible love, because between them stands the wall.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/oDPZ80rZbtX03Di88CbjTIBYd5q.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:628587'),
  ('941262320881373025', 'Zygote', 2017, 'Horror, Science Fiction', 'Neill Blomkamp, Justin van der Merwe, Mannie Ferreira', 'Neill Blomkamp, Thomas Sweterlitsch, Terri Tatchell', 'Dakota Fanning, Jose Pablo Cantillo', null, 'The two remaining crew members of a mining operation in the Arctic Circle fight to survive against an alien creature.', 'The two remaining crew members of a mining operation in the Arctic Circle fight to survive against an alien creature.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lowSe0hdmFdtEuIA6aOVfkPjk1c.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:464111'),
  ('1028792689312308026', 'Ένας τρελλός τρελλός αεροπειρατής', 1973, 'Comedy', 'Kostas Karagiannis, Angelos Roussos', 'Asimakis Gialamas, Costas Pretederis', 'Kostas Voutsas, Nikos Rizos, Ketty Papanika, Giannis Vogiatzis, Stavros Xenidis, Elia Kalligeraki, Marika Krevata, Elsa Rizou', null, 'Two apartments of an apartment building with common balcony, living two same-sex couples. At one resident Stephen with Fanny and the other Myrto with Tatiana. But other things show and others are as well in the apartments live two married couples. Stephen with Myrto and Fanis with Tatiana, who keep hidden their marriages, because women working as hostesses in an airline that does not allow their marriage...', 'Two apartments of an apartment building with common balcony, living two same-sex couples. At one resident Stephen with Fanny and the other Myrto with Tatiana. But other things show and others are as well in the apartments live two married couples. Stephen with Myrto and Fanis with Tatiana, who keep hidden their marriages, because women working as hostesses in an airline that does not allow their marriage...', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/iWVpE8SP5jI0FTF3ZjLFC4KskzP.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:392797'),
  ('923875160355301472', 'Τα Τσακάλια', 1981, 'Action, Crime, Drama', 'Giannis Dalianidis', 'Giannis Dalianidis', 'Panos Mihalopoulos, Sofia Aliberti, Stamatis Gardelis, Athina Tsilyra, Yorgos Rigas, Pavlos Kontoyannidis, Melpo Zarokosta, Spyros Kalogirou', null, 'In a television program dedicated to the problem of drugs, George tells the story of his life which was immersed in the mire of drugs and crime. The troubled relationship with his family, robberies, drugs will revive and the narrative will give an answer to whether love can finally save.', 'In a television program dedicated to the problem of drugs, George tells the story of his life which was immersed in the mire of drugs and crime. The troubled relationship with his family, robberies, drugs will revive and the narrative will give an answer to whether love can finally save.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7sXLbcppg5Ot7Xj0lNuG6MNsxYm.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:385906'),
  ('149545194308207782', 'Возвращение мамонтенка', 2025, 'Animation', 'Anton Vereschagin', 'Ivan Petukhov', 'Sergey Burunov, Timofey Tribuntsev, Regina Todorenko, Evgeniy Kulik', null, 'In the new story, a brave mammoth, the son of a grown-up hero, embarks on a journey full of dangers from Africa to the North in order to find a real mother for his father.', 'In the new story, a brave mammoth, the son of a grown-up hero, embarks on a journey full of dangers from Africa to the North in order to find a real mother for his father.', null, 'tmdb:movie:1218370'),
  ('1041017060932741386', 'Ку-ка-ре-ку', 1963, 'Animation', 'Teodor Bunimovich, Anatoliy Karanovich', 'Yuri Yakovlev', null, null, 'No description available yet.', 'No description available yet.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fSGNAxcqS1x56nipAdHASWqtwl7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:440494'),
  ('693363442774061365', 'شباب البومب 3', 2026, 'Adventure, Comedy, Family', 'حازم فودة', 'Abdullah Al-Walidi, أحمد الزهراني', 'Faisal Al-Essa, Mohammed Al-Dosari, Abdulaziz Al-Forehi, Muhannad Al-Jamaily, Suliman Almoqitib, علي المدفع, Shafika Yousif, Tarfa Al-Shareef', 'PG-13', 'Amer plans to travel with his friends this summer, but his desire clashes with his family''s insistence on accompanying them as well. The problem seems minor at first, but it pales in comparison to the surprises that await them upon their arrival.', 'Amer plans to travel with his friends this summer, but his desire clashes with his family''s insistence on accompanying them as well. The problem seems minor at first, but it pales in comparison to the surprises that await them upon their arrival.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vbQ3ikGeeL6A2bVsfbTra1magYI.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1653459'),
