  ('308096244945739647', '森中有林', 2026, 'Drama, Romance, Crime', 'Zhi Zheng, Piao Songri', 'Zhi Zheng', 'Yu Hewei, Gao Yuanyuan, Han Geng, Zhang Tian''ai, Qiao Shan, Xia Zhiguang, Chloe Xie, Wu Jiakai', null, 'The story chronicles four decades in the lives of a family deeply rooted in the soil of Northeast China. Through times of prosperity and hardship, they navigate cycles of love and hatred, fortune and misfortune. Though buffeted by the twists of fate, they never relinquish their steadfast guardianship of one another and the profound commitment to this ancestral land that sustains them.', 'The story chronicles four decades in the lives of a family deeply rooted in the soil of Northeast China. Through times of prosperity and hardship, they navigate cycles of love and hatred, fortune and misfortune. Though buffeted by the twists of fate, they never relinquish their steadfast guardianship of one another and the profound commitment to this ancestral land that sustains them.', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lauBwkkT3dNqnLYAmd8YtRj7HD7.jpg', 'tmdb:movie:1443374'),
